(713585, 75170, 16488, '<td valign="top">On it''s own the bowl with fruit would make and interesting still=life study.  There''s good lighting there with enough detail in the shadow.  The out-of-focus flowers are not a good addition to the composition.</td>', 'On it''s own the bowl with fruit would make and interesting still=life study.  There''s good lighting there with enough detail in the shadow.  The out-of-focus flowers are not a good addition to the composition.', '2004-05-12 07:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
