(713932, 76009, 20210, '<td valign="top">Wow!  And thanks for taking what could''ve been a snapshot, and keeping it well-composed.  Power-lines are unfortunate, but not much you can do on that front.</td>', 'Wow!  And thanks for taking what could''ve been a snapshot, and keeping it well-composed.  Power-lines are unfortunate, but not much you can do on that front.', '2004-05-12 11:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
