(713937, 74778, 21430, '<td valign="top">Without the CD-ROM this is something that I would definately consider hanging in my home. A very nice shot. <br/> <br/>   As for following the challeng, I believe it does so nicely.<br/> <br/>    If you can reshoot this without the CD-ROM and possibly do something to even out the lighting in the background this would make a decent print. (In my neophyte opinion)</td>', 'Without the CD-ROM this is something that I would definately consider hanging in my home. A very nice shot.     As for following the challeng, I believe it does so nicely.     If you can reshoot this without the CD-ROM and possibly do something to even out the lighting in the background this would make a decent print. (In my neophyte opinion)', '2004-05-12 11:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
