(714208, 76034, 21202, '<td valign="top">The blue background works well as contrast for all of the colors on the edges of the main objects except for the blue on the battery label. The lighting produces glare and dark shadow.  The narrow depth of field obscures the near AC terminal and the plus sign on the battery, both part of the story being told.  The composition holds very little appeal for me.  A 3.</td>', 'The blue background works well as contrast for all of the colors on the edges of the main objects except for the blue on the battery label. The lighting produces glare and dark shadow.  The narrow depth of field obscures the near AC terminal and the plus sign on the battery, both part of the story being told.  The composition holds very little appeal for me.  A 3.', '2004-05-12 13:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
