(714253, 75394, 21202, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.  Very nice selection of batteries.  The camera looks lovely in the blueish light.  The reflected light off the background is just right to define the perimeter of the lens body.  The glare off the batteries is a little unfortunate as it obscures the subject of the photo.  Another light source below and to the right would have helped with the shadows as well.  A smaller aperture and more depth of field would not hurt.<br/> <br/>A 7.</td>', 'Beautiful colors.  Very nice selection of batteries.  The camera looks lovely in the blueish light.  The reflected light off the background is just right to define the perimeter of the lens body.  The glare off the batteries is a little unfortunate as it obscures the subject of the photo.  Another light source below and to the right would have helped with the shadows as well.  A smaller aperture and more depth of field would not hurt. A 7.', '2004-05-12 14:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
