(714261, 76078, 18349, '<td valign="top">Took a while to get this one...hard to tell at first what the point is.  I think this would have much of a bigger impact on the viewer if it were in color, so that the eyes stand out more.  Not a big fan of the framing, but shot is unique and a good idea.</td>', 'Took a while to get this one...hard to tell at first what the point is.  I think this would have much of a bigger impact on the viewer if it were in color, so that the eyes stand out more.  Not a big fan of the framing, but shot is unique and a good idea.', '2004-05-12 14:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
