(714284, 75780, 15207, '<td valign="top">A good idea, but would like to have seen it shot in a way I''ve never seen before - maybe looking head on to one of the bolts with the nuts and bolts all blurred behind. Just an idea. see www.comstock.com for ideas of composition.</td>', 'A good idea, but would like to have seen it shot in a way I''ve never seen before - maybe looking head on to one of the bolts with the nuts and bolts all blurred behind. Just an idea. see www.comstock.com for ideas of composition.', '2004-05-12 14:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(714285, 75917, 18349, '<td valign="top">Most interesting I''ve seen so far...nice color, but the glass'' edges are lost a bit on the black background.  Appears tilted to left just a hair.</td>', 'Most interesting I''ve seen so far...nice color, but the glass'' edges are lost a bit on the black background.  Appears tilted to left just a hair.', '2004-05-12 14:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
