(714293, 75203, 15207, '<td valign="top">hey... how did you manage to take a photo of my house - LOL - I''m the girl the mess and his side is clean. Great idea - 7</td>', 'hey... how did you manage to take a photo of my house - LOL - I''m the girl the mess and his side is clean. Great idea - 7', '2004-05-12 14:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
