(714309, 75280, 5354, '<td valign="top">Lots of people had the same thought, and managed to execute the shot better than this. It needs COLOR somewhere in it, just to give it some zap !!</td>', 'Lots of people had the same thought, and managed to execute the shot better than this. It needs COLOR somewhere in it, just to give it some zap !!', '2004-05-12 14:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(714310, 75965, 18349, '<td valign="top">Lines on the bricks appear to be tilting up to the left.  I like the coloration; there are some "hot" spots on the skin and the entirety of the shirts that could be toned down a bit.</td>', 'Lines on the bricks appear to be tilting up to the left.  I like the coloration; there are some "hot" spots on the skin and the entirety of the shirts that could be toned down a bit.', '2004-05-12 14:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(714311, 76061, 15207, '<td valign="top">This seems very out of focus and a bit grainy. I''m not sure how you''d fix it, but it''s a tiny bit distracting. However, I can tell you put a lot of work into this and it''s a great idea for this challenge -7</td>', 'This seems very out of focus and a bit grainy. I''m not sure how you''d fix it, but it''s a tiny bit distracting. However, I can tell you put a lot of work into this and it''s a great idea for this challenge -7', '2004-05-12 14:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(714312, 75775, 20771, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen. Thanks.</td>', 'Nicely seen. Thanks.', '2004-05-12 14:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(714313, 75896, 18349, '<td valign="top">Would have been great for abstract last week!  As for opposites, I guess you are going with dark and light?  I wish you could bring out the texture of the column a bit more.</td>', 'Would have been great for abstract last week!  As for opposites, I guess you are going with dark and light?  I wish you could bring out the texture of the column a bit more.', '2004-05-12 14:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(714314, 75854, 19831, '<td valign="top">try cropping some of the top off. nice shot. lightening is very difficult to capture.</td>', 'try cropping some of the top off. nice shot. lightening is very difficult to capture.', '2004-05-12 14:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(714315, 75676, 21202, '<td valign="top">This meets the challenge.  The composition and colors are very nice   This does not look like it was much fun for the children though.  A 4.</td>', 'This meets the challenge.  The composition and colors are very nice   This does not look like it was much fun for the children though.  A 4.', '2004-05-12 14:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(714316, 76126, 5354, '<td valign="top">One of the better ''galss of water'' entries, but still feels uninspiring. With so many people using the same metaphor an image has to sparkle to stand out from the croud. This doesn''t sparkle I''m afraid.</td>', 'One of the better ''galss of water'' entries, but still feels uninspiring. With so many people using the same metaphor an image has to sparkle to stand out from the croud. This doesn''t sparkle I''m afraid.', '2004-05-12 14:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(714317, 74748, 17505, '<td valign="top">HA HA HA! Excellent!</td>', 'HA HA HA! Excellent!', '2004-05-12 14:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(714318, 76089, 5354, '<td valign="top">Opposite what ?</td>', 'Opposite what ?', '2004-05-12 14:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(714320, 75015, 13136, '<td valign="top">Is this the same person who impaled a tennis ball in "Rusted"? I like the idea and image.</td>', 'Is this the same person who impaled a tennis ball in "Rusted"? I like the idea and image.', '2004-05-12 14:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(714322, 75907, 20771, '<td valign="top">A good idea and a fine picture. However, I shaved points off because the ice looks more like amber than ice.</td>', 'A good idea and a fine picture. However, I shaved points off because the ice looks more like amber than ice.', '2004-05-12 14:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(714323, 75601, 5354, '<td valign="top">Nah !!</td>', 'Nah !!', '2004-05-12 14:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(714324, 75751, 18374, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I see any opposites here.  Everything in the picture seems to have lots of light except for the flower- I would prefer it the other way around.  Crisp focus and good detail on the flower and grass blades.</td>', 'I''m not sure I see any opposites here.  Everything in the picture seems to have lots of light except for the flower- I would prefer it the other way around.  Crisp focus and good detail on the flower and grass blades.', '2004-05-12 14:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(714325, 75757, 18349, '<td valign="top">Great perspective/proportion/conflict shot.  As for opposites, I think it is a bit off.  It is difficult to draw an exact opposite definition for man and system, as man is part of a system, be it bad, good, or indifferent.  That, of course, is MHO.  The shot itself is nice; good composition.</td>', 'Great perspective/proportion/conflict shot.  As for opposites, I think it is a bit off.  It is difficult to draw an exact opposite definition for man and system, as man is part of a system, be it bad, good, or indifferent.  That, of course, is MHO.  The shot itself is nice; good composition.', '2004-05-12 14:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(714327, 75411, 13136, '<td valign="top">Total lack of focus does not work for me with this shot.</td>', 'Total lack of focus does not work for me with this shot.', '2004-05-12 14:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(714328, 75656, 21430, '<td valign="top">I think the ''inside'' part of the photo is to dark.</td>', 'I think the ''inside'' part of the photo is to dark.', '2004-05-12 14:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(714330, 75503, 20771, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. Why does wife  look so anguished?</td>', 'Nice portrait. Why does wife  look so anguished?', '2004-05-12 14:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(714331, 74778, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nice coloration; don''t like the tilt.</td>', 'Nice coloration; don''t like the tilt.', '2004-05-12 14:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(714332, 75850, 5354, '<td valign="top">Ice and candles all over DPC this challenge. In order to stand out from the croud an image has to be extra-ordinary, and although better than some this isn''t extra-ordinary.</td>', 'Ice and candles all over DPC this challenge. In order to stand out from the croud an image has to be extra-ordinary, and although better than some this isn''t extra-ordinary.', '2004-05-12 14:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(714333, 75909, 18374, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  The light on their faces is very harsh though.  A warming filter or more diffuse flash would probably fix that.  I like the expressions and poses.</td>', 'Nice picture.  The light on their faces is very harsh though.  A warming filter or more diffuse flash would probably fix that.  I like the expressions and poses.', '2004-05-12 14:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(714335, 76073, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Fits challenge well; I like the lighting and the composition.  It may be hard for some viewers to take, but it really does justice to the challenge instructions.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Fits challenge well; I like the lighting and the composition.  It may be hard for some viewers to take, but it really does justice to the challenge instructions.  Good job.', '2004-05-12 14:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(714336, 75331, 13136, '<td valign="top">Sorry. I cannot tell hwat is going on in this picture to match the title. Very confusing shot.</td>', 'Sorry. I cannot tell hwat is going on in this picture to match the title. Very confusing shot.', '2004-05-12 14:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
