(714342, 75843, 18349, '<td valign="top">Not following you on the whole opposite concept...maybe it''s too cerebral for me.  Is it light/dark?  Not easy to rate this one.</td>', 'Not following you on the whole opposite concept...maybe it''s too cerebral for me.  Is it light/dark?  Not easy to rate this one.', '2004-05-12 14:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(714343, 75954, 21202, '<td valign="top">I guess this is a wall covered and uncovered by ivy.    A little less glare off the leaves would help.  Polarizing lenses, less aperture, shorter exposure, time of day can all be changed to reduce glare at time of capture.  Not much can be done after the pixels have become oversaturated.  The colors and lighting on the wall make a very lovely picture.  A 5.</td>', 'I guess this is a wall covered and uncovered by ivy.    A little less glare off the leaves would help.  Polarizing lenses, less aperture, shorter exposure, time of day can all be changed to reduce glare at time of capture.  Not much can be done after the pixels have become oversaturated.  The colors and lighting on the wall make a very lovely picture.  A 5.', '2004-05-12 14:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(714344, 75233, 18374, '<td valign="top">The ice seems a bit out of focus.  The tint on the entire picture looks unnatural.  You may want to try some different white balance settings on your camera.</td>', 'The ice seems a bit out of focus.  The tint on the entire picture looks unnatural.  You may want to try some different white balance settings on your camera.', '2004-05-12 14:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(714345, 76033, 5354, '<td valign="top">Candles and ice all over DPC !<br/>Sorry this just doesn''t compete with many of the others using the same concept, let alone those images with an individual concept. <br/> <br/>I almost did a fire and water, but just knew there would be a lot of them.</td>', 'Candles and ice all over DPC !Sorry this just doesn''t compete with many of the others using the same concept, let alone those images with an individual concept.  I almost did a fire and water, but just knew there would be a lot of them.', '2004-05-12 14:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
