(714349, 76096, 5354, '<td valign="top">Slightly different from the candles and ice images, but similar in concept and execution. <br/> <br/>Not enough dof to make this stand out, though the colours are nice</td>', 'Slightly different from the candles and ice images, but similar in concept and execution.  Not enough dof to make this stand out, though the colours are nice', '2004-05-12 14:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(714354, 75818, 5354, '<td valign="top">Only the eggs are in focus, which destroys any chance of a decent shot. More DOF, smaller apperture, longer exposure, tripod, lights .... all these would have helped produce a crisper image.</td>', 'Only the eggs are in focus, which destroys any chance of a decent shot. More DOF, smaller apperture, longer exposure, tripod, lights .... all these would have helped produce a crisper image.', '2004-05-12 14:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(714356, 76004, 20771, '<td valign="top">Enjoyable picture.My only comment is that It might have been worth waiting for some  interesting interplay between people and the cowboy.</td>', 'Enjoyable picture.My only comment is that It might have been worth waiting for some  interesting interplay between people and the cowboy.', '2004-05-12 14:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(714357, 75548, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, but then again, I love cats, LOL!<br/> <br/>Great composition, expressions, lighting.  The leather chair is my only problem, the reflections are a tad distracting.  A 9</td>', 'I love this shot, but then again, I love cats, LOL! Great composition, expressions, lighting.  The leather chair is my only problem, the reflections are a tad distracting.  A 9', '2004-05-12 14:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(714359, 76124, 20771, '<td valign="top">Why didn''t the coin cast a shadow?</td>', 'Why didn''t the coin cast a shadow?', '2004-05-12 14:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(714360, 75749, 12448, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture!  Hope no one was shocked during this little shooting session ;)  A 9, just a tad off balance to me :)</td>', 'Excellent capture!  Hope no one was shocked during this little shooting session ;)  A 9, just a tad off balance to me :)', '2004-05-12 14:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(714361, 75940, 21202, '<td valign="top">I look forward to entering an 180 degree rotated picture soon.  Cropping away the pavement would make this even more intriguing.  The bricks on the bottom of the reflecting pool superimpose a very interesting texture on the entire scene. and the ripples produce their own wonderful distortions especially on the darker building and the sky.  I guess the question is not whether you want your magic explained or not, but rather does the pavement add beauty to the picture or not.  For me, the answer is no.  An 8.</td>', 'I look forward to entering an 180 degree rotated picture soon.  Cropping away the pavement would make this even more intriguing.  The bricks on the bottom of the reflecting pool superimpose a very interesting texture on the entire scene. and the ripples produce their own wonderful distortions especially on the darker building and the sky.  I guess the question is not whether you want your magic explained or not, but rather does the pavement add beauty to the picture or not.  For me, the answer is no.  An 8.', '2004-05-12 14:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(714362, 75957, 5354, '<td valign="top">The light drop off from front to back is killing this image. The perspective doesn''t help either.<br/> <br/>I would have ''cleaned'' the chocs too - specs of dark choc on white etc just make it look messy.<br/> <br/>Sorry</td>', 'The light drop off from front to back is killing this image. The perspective doesn''t help either. I would have ''cleaned'' the chocs too - specs of dark choc on white etc just make it look messy. Sorry', '2004-05-12 14:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(714363, 75851, 19831, '<td valign="top">nice idea. there are some glare spots on the black kitty.</td>', 'nice idea. there are some glare spots on the black kitty.', '2004-05-12 14:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(714364, 75411, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, bad capture, fuzzy disjointed.  A 2</td>', 'Nice idea, bad capture, fuzzy disjointed.  A 2', '2004-05-12 14:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(714365, 76102, 20673, '<td valign="top">This is the absolute best one I have seen yet - Perfect focus, contrast, background, colors, and perfectly in the theme!  A 10 for you my friend!</td>', 'This is the absolute best one I have seen yet - Perfect focus, contrast, background, colors, and perfectly in the theme!  A 10 for you my friend!', '2004-05-12 14:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
