(714385, 75211, 20779, '<td valign="top">I am torn on this one . . . I really love the capture of the girl and the concept . . I tend to go for the less obvious concepts. But I honestly don''t know if I would I would see it as opposites. I am learning that "meeting" the challenge is to be considered heavily when voting. To me -- really great piece!</td>', 'I am torn on this one . . . I really love the capture of the girl and the concept . . I tend to go for the less obvious concepts. But I honestly don''t know if I would I would see it as opposites. I am learning that "meeting" the challenge is to be considered heavily when voting. To me -- really great piece!', '2004-05-12 14:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
