(714389, 74764, 5354, '<td valign="top">Very predictable - too predictable, too many ice and fire shots.<br/>Unfortunately some of the others are very much better executed than this. Better lighting, better framing, better focus and dof.<br/></td>', 'Very predictable - too predictable, too many ice and fire shots.Unfortunately some of the others are very much better executed than this. Better lighting, better framing, better focus and dof.', '2004-05-12 14:38:14.000000', NULL, 1);
