(714390, 74994, 20779, '<td valign="top">Simple, common, but very cleanly executed.</td>', 'Simple, common, but very cleanly executed.', '2004-05-12 14:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(714392, 75958, 12448, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing the Opposite is the boat on dry land?  Not really sure.  The shot is blown out on the right side and too dark on the left.  It seems a bit hazy also.  The composition is okay but nothing to really hold my attention.  A 3</td>', 'I''m guessing the Opposite is the boat on dry land?  Not really sure.  The shot is blown out on the right side and too dark on the left.  It seems a bit hazy also.  The composition is okay but nothing to really hold my attention.  A 3', '2004-05-12 14:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(714394, 76026, 5354, '<td valign="top">Actually one of the better fire n ice shots, nice colour, nice dof, nice detail.</td>', 'Actually one of the better fire n ice shots, nice colour, nice dof, nice detail.', '2004-05-12 14:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(714395, 75262, 20771, '<td valign="top">It''s important to get the horizon horisontal in pictures , particularly if the point of the picture is the horizon.</td>', 'It''s important to get the horizon horisontal in pictures , particularly if the point of the picture is the horizon.', '2004-05-12 14:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(714397, 76034, 20779, '<td valign="top">Like this for its orininality and composition; well done! With sharper focus and maybe less tight cropping -- really nice!</td>', 'Like this for its orininality and composition; well done! With sharper focus and maybe less tight cropping -- really nice!', '2004-05-12 14:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(714400, 75015, 18374, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  I''m having trouble coming up with any constructive criticism for you.  Maybe taking the brightness of the white background down a notch would keep it from stealing some attention from the fruit?</td>', 'Nice picture.  I''m having trouble coming up with any constructive criticism for you.  Maybe taking the brightness of the white background down a notch would keep it from stealing some attention from the fruit?', '2004-05-12 14:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(714401, 75838, 20771, '<td valign="top">Evocative.</td>', 'Evocative.', '2004-05-12 14:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(714402, 75411, 20779, '<td valign="top">I like this one, but I have a feeling it will get comments of "opposites????" and "out of focus". But it really catches my eye and keeps me interested.</td>', 'I like this one, but I have a feeling it will get comments of "opposites????" and "out of focus". But it really catches my eye and keeps me interested.', '2004-05-12 14:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(714403, 75855, 5354, '<td valign="top">One of the better fire n ice images, good color, good composition, interesting shapes</td>', 'One of the better fire n ice images, good color, good composition, interesting shapes', '2004-05-12 14:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(714404, 75742, 12448, '<td valign="top">I guess it meets the challenge, barely.  Nothing to really hold my attention, the lighting is off and the colors are more distracting than appealing.  A 2</td>', 'I guess it meets the challenge, barely.  Nothing to really hold my attention, the lighting is off and the colors are more distracting than appealing.  A 2', '2004-05-12 14:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(714406, 74699, 20771, '<td valign="top">Fine abstraction . Inside vs outside?</td>', 'Fine abstraction . Inside vs outside?', '2004-05-12 14:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(714407, 75681, 21202, '<td valign="top">The blues in the darker chess pieces come off quite well.  I like the streaks of light and shadow off reflective surfaces coming from an unseen window.  I wonder what rules this game has and wonder what kind of game it is.  The depth of field is necessary to keep the pieces and the board in focus, but the wood surface on which the board lays does not have sufficient appeal to support the focus that is placed on it.<br/> <br/>A 5.</td>', 'The blues in the darker chess pieces come off quite well.  I like the streaks of light and shadow off reflective surfaces coming from an unseen window.  I wonder what rules this game has and wonder what kind of game it is.  The depth of field is necessary to keep the pieces and the board in focus, but the wood surface on which the board lays does not have sufficient appeal to support the focus that is placed on it. A 5.', '2004-05-12 14:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(714408, 76073, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice colors = and the black background make the red and blue really pop.</td>', 'Nice colors = and the black background make the red and blue really pop.', '2004-05-12 14:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(714410, 75046, 18374, '<td valign="top">Nice picture!  How did you get this shot?  It doesn''t look like it was shot through glass!</td>', 'Nice picture!  How did you get this shot?  It doesn''t look like it was shot through glass!', '2004-05-12 14:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(714411, 75572, 12448, '<td valign="top">Opposite sides of the board?  Guess that works, the shot is out of focus, the light doesn''t work well for this shot and the cropping and composition leaves me wanting.  A 2</td>', 'Opposite sides of the board?  Guess that works, the shot is out of focus, the light doesn''t work well for this shot and the cropping and composition leaves me wanting.  A 2', '2004-05-12 14:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(714414, 76027, 20779, '<td valign="top">Good catch!!! I wish the focus could have been keppt a bit better.</td>', 'Good catch!!! I wish the focus could have been keppt a bit better.', '2004-05-12 14:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(714415, 74727, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.</td>', 'Nice idea.', '2004-05-12 14:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(714416, 75245, 5354, '<td valign="top">Unclear what this is trying to depict, why balloon ?</td>', 'Unclear what this is trying to depict, why balloon ?', '2004-05-12 14:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(714417, 75850, 20779, '<td valign="top">So far, my favorite of the fire &amp; ice entries. Beautiful composition and clean focus.</td>', 'So far, my favorite of the fire & ice entries. Beautiful composition and clean focus.', '2004-05-12 14:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(714418, 74661, 18374, '<td valign="top">This looks out of focus,  the background is pretty dull and I don''t get the Yin-Yang reference.</td>', 'This looks out of focus,  the background is pretty dull and I don''t get the Yin-Yang reference.', '2004-05-12 14:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(714419, 76031, 12448, '<td valign="top">Huh, interesting.  Well one thing I know is that you are on the site counsil from the buttons available to you :)  Wonder how many others will catch that.  The shot doesn''t really offer me much overall.  A 2, please don''t delete me! :)</td>', 'Huh, interesting.  Well one thing I know is that you are on the site counsil from the buttons available to you :)  Wonder how many others will catch that.  The shot doesn''t really offer me much overall.  A 2, please don''t delete me! :)', '2004-05-12 14:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(714420, 75815, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea . . . . had to think about it after the title. Nicely set-up and shot.</td>', 'Very cool idea . . . . had to think about it after the title. Nicely set-up and shot.', '2004-05-12 14:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(714421, 75280, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge!  The image is very effectice - nice composition (but a bit crowded at the top), nice DoF.  Lighting could have been a bit better.</td>', 'Great take on the challenge!  The image is very effectice - nice composition (but a bit crowded at the top), nice DoF.  Lighting could have been a bit better.', '2004-05-12 14:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(714422, 75843, 18374, '<td valign="top">Too dark and to me it is uninteresting.</td>', 'Too dark and to me it is uninteresting.', '2004-05-12 14:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(714423, 75998, 12448, '<td valign="top">The front of this shot is pretty good,  the water droplets, the shine on the surface and then you see the candle, out of focus and glaring out at me.  The negaive space on the left doesn''t add anything to the shot for me personally.  A 2</td>', 'The front of this shot is pretty good,  the water droplets, the shine on the surface and then you see the candle, out of focus and glaring out at me.  The negaive space on the left doesn''t add anything to the shot for me personally.  A 2', '2004-05-12 14:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(714424, 74764, 18374, '<td valign="top">This looks out of focus and isn''t all that interesting to me.</td>', 'This looks out of focus and isn''t all that interesting to me.', '2004-05-12 14:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(714427, 75572, 18374, '<td valign="top">Out of focus.  The lighting seems to be coming from a bad angle to show the detail of the pieces.</td>', 'Out of focus.  The lighting seems to be coming from a bad angle to show the detail of the pieces.', '2004-05-12 14:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(714430, 75937, 21202, '<td valign="top">Your title implies you find both balance and the lack of balance in this composition.  Same patterns give balance.  Different colors, sizes, and lighting provide a lack of balance.  I like that the crosses are not vertical and they both point in the same direction.  I just do not see anything near 150K of pixels in this picture.  A 4.</td>', 'Your title implies you find both balance and the lack of balance in this composition.  Same patterns give balance.  Different colors, sizes, and lighting provide a lack of balance.  I like that the crosses are not vertical and they both point in the same direction.  I just do not see anything near 150K of pixels in this picture.  A 4.', '2004-05-12 14:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(714431, 76088, 19608, '<td valign="top">Guess Coke won, huh?  Nice shot - very nice job of "printing" the black and white - with crisp whites and deep blacks evident. The top of the center can is a bit soft, but not enough to deduct any points for.  Likewise the bottoms of the cans have a jagged edge (guess they are sitting on some kind of cloth?)  Overall - a very competitive entry (pun intended.)</td>', 'Guess Coke won, huh?  Nice shot - very nice job of "printing" the black and white - with crisp whites and deep blacks evident. The top of the center can is a bit soft, but not enough to deduct any points for.  Likewise the bottoms of the cans have a jagged edge (guess they are sitting on some kind of cloth?)  Overall - a very competitive entry (pun intended.)', '2004-05-12 14:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(714432, 75828, 21291, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus, reflection and great use of a black background to bring out color to draw your eyes away from the glass.   Definite 10!</td>', 'Excellent focus, reflection and great use of a black background to bring out color to draw your eyes away from the glass.   Definite 10!', '2004-05-12 14:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(714433, 75291, 18374, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of black/dark area in this picture and a relatively small area of interest.</td>', 'There is a lot of black/dark area in this picture and a relatively small area of interest.', '2004-05-12 14:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(714434, 74732, 12448, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, not a very good shot though.  Sorry, out of focus, grainy and nothing to really hold my attention.  A 2</td>', 'Interesting idea, not a very good shot though.  Sorry, out of focus, grainy and nothing to really hold my attention.  A 2', '2004-05-12 14:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(714435, 75897, 18374, '<td valign="top">To me this looks like a plain old shot of a sign.  There is nothing that stands out or makes it interesting.</td>', 'To me this looks like a plain old shot of a sign.  There is nothing that stands out or makes it interesting.', '2004-05-12 14:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(714436, 75838, 9747, '<td valign="top">Lovely! I like the pattern made by the shadows. Great composition. Though I can''t say I like the borders... they''re too thick (and too gray, too) and takes away the attention.</td>', 'Lovely! I like the pattern made by the shadows. Great composition. Though I can''t say I like the borders... they''re too thick (and too gray, too) and takes away the attention.', '2004-05-12 14:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(714440, 75015, 19608, '<td valign="top">Ah - a "double" entry - very clever. Your colors are right on as is the exposure.  But I do have a problem with your composition.  The top of the appleorange is very crowded at the top, should be a bit more space above. And, I think it would be better if the entire orange half on the right were included in the frame.  Overall - a very ORIGINAL idea very well executed.</td>', 'Ah - a "double" entry - very clever. Your colors are right on as is the exposure.  But I do have a problem with your composition.  The top of the appleorange is very crowded at the top, should be a bit more space above. And, I think it would be better if the entire orange half on the right were included in the frame.  Overall - a very ORIGINAL idea very well executed.', '2004-05-12 14:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(714441, 75917, 12448, '<td valign="top">This shot has a lot of potential with the right lighting and composition and angle.  The way it is set up now is uninteresting to me personally, the glare on the glass is distracting and the negative space on the right does nothing for the shot to me.  Maybe if you tried lighting from behind or underneath?  Also, focus is lacking on the base even though most of the glass looks like it''s {b]almost[/b] in focus.  A 2 as is, sorry</td>', 'This shot has a lot of potential with the right lighting and composition and angle.  The way it is set up now is uninteresting to me personally, the glare on the glass is distracting and the negative space on the right does nothing for the shot to me.  Maybe if you tried lighting from behind or underneath?  Also, focus is lacking on the base even though most of the glass looks like it''s {b]almost[/b] in focus.  A 2 as is, sorry', '2004-05-12 14:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(714442, 75572, 21432, '<td valign="top">Image is out of focus.</td>', 'Image is out of focus.', '2004-05-12 14:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(714444, 76088, 21432, '<td valign="top">Neat, sharp image.</td>', 'Neat, sharp image.', '2004-05-12 14:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(714447, 75924, 21202, '<td valign="top">What I see is two weathered yellow arrowheads one pointing toward us and one away on rather nice pavement whose color and texture goes well with the yellow paint.  The way the arrow pointing toward us has worn provides an animal like ears, eyes, and nose of a dog or wolf like creature.  To the left is a nicely photographed well lit nicely focused pine cone.  I find some but not much appeal in this image.  A 5.</td>', 'What I see is two weathered yellow arrowheads one pointing toward us and one away on rather nice pavement whose color and texture goes well with the yellow paint.  The way the arrow pointing toward us has worn provides an animal like ears, eyes, and nose of a dog or wolf like creature.  To the left is a nicely photographed well lit nicely focused pine cone.  I find some but not much appeal in this image.  A 5.', '2004-05-12 14:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(714450, 74991, 21291, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but it looks more like a snapshot, than a nicely composed photo.  I would have either zoomed in and made this a nice headshot, or zoomed out and included surroundings.  Good job otherwise.</td>', 'Nice picture, but it looks more like a snapshot, than a nicely composed photo.  I would have either zoomed in and made this a nice headshot, or zoomed out and included surroundings.  Good job otherwise.', '2004-05-12 14:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(714451, 75780, 13158, '<td valign="top">Upped my score on this one after looking at it again.  You have portrayed quite a few different opposites with this one image.  Very creative!  Technically I see nothing wrong with it, so I had to give you a higher score.</td>', 'Upped my score on this one after looking at it again.  You have portrayed quite a few different opposites with this one image.  Very creative!  Technically I see nothing wrong with it, so I had to give you a higher score.', '2004-05-12 14:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(714457, 75701, 21291, '<td valign="top">Definite opposites, but I don''t find this photo very interesting.   It also seems that the clear bottle, should actually be clear, but it looks full of water with the reflection on the ground.</td>', 'Definite opposites, but I don''t find this photo very interesting.   It also seems that the clear bottle, should actually be clear, but it looks full of water with the reflection on the ground.', '2004-05-12 14:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(714458, 75823, 21120, '<td valign="top">Looks romantic... was there any hanky-panky going on wiith PC?  Sure?</td>', 'Looks romantic... was there any hanky-panky going on wiith PC?  Sure?', '2004-05-12 14:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(714460, 75321, 15832, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. All details in place.. 8</td>', 'Very nicely done. All details in place.. 8', '2004-05-12 14:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(714461, 75854, 10614, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture and great take on challenge.</td>', 'Very nice capture and great take on challenge.', '2004-05-12 14:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(714463, 74991, 21202, '<td valign="top">I like that the leopard is showing such keen interest in us and the eyes and nose are so clearly portrayed.  I also like the colors other than black and white that appear. The bottom of the rear paw invites a full body portrait, yet the depth of field alllows little more than a head and shoulders.  <br/> <br/>A 6.</td>', 'I like that the leopard is showing such keen interest in us and the eyes and nose are so clearly portrayed.  I also like the colors other than black and white that appear. The bottom of the rear paw invites a full body portrait, yet the depth of field alllows little more than a head and shoulders.   A 6.', '2004-05-12 15:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(714465, 76073, 13158, '<td valign="top">The pentagram (pentacle) is not an evil symbol.  Each point on the star represents something.  Wicca uses the pentacle as their symbol and it''s not evil.  I do take offense because most people just assume its a symbol of the devil and satanic worship.    A little reading up on the pentagram can tell you how treasured it is.  Sighhh, movies have really desecrated it.  Anyway, on to the technical aspects of the photo.  I like the colors very much, the red and blue are saturated perfectly.  I like how the cross reflects some red, and the pentacle reflects some blue.  Not sure I like the crop too much.  I''ll have to come back to this one later in the challenge to comment more.   *Ok* I''m back. After taking some time looking at the image again, I have decided I do like the crop.  There is equal space between both symbols and the side of the image and also from top to bottom. I can''t rate this low because I don''t like how you used the pentacle.  That is personal preference and not what the voting is about.  So I will rate it just on the technical aspects.  I''ve changed my vote and given you a 7.</td>', 'The pentagram (pentacle) is not an evil symbol.  Each point on the star represents something.  Wicca uses the pentacle as their symbol and it''s not evil.  I do take offense because most people just assume its a symbol of the devil and satanic worship.    A little reading up on the pentagram can tell you how treasured it is.  Sighhh, movies have really desecrated it.  Anyway, on to the technical aspects of the photo.  I like the colors very much, the red and blue are saturated perfectly.  I like how the cross reflects some red, and the pentacle reflects some blue.  Not sure I like the crop too much.  I''ll have to come back to this one later in the challenge to comment more.   *Ok* I''m back. After taking some time looking at the image again, I have decided I do like the crop.  There is equal space between both symbols and the side of the image and also from top to bottom. I can''t rate this low because I don''t like how you used the pentacle.  That is personal preference and not what the voting is about.  So I will rate it just on the technical aspects.  I''ve changed my vote and given you a 7.', '2004-05-12 15:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(714466, 76114, 5354, '<td valign="top">The lighting needs some zest to make this stand out from all the other ice images</td>', 'The lighting needs some zest to make this stand out from all the other ice images', '2004-05-12 15:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(714467, 75844, 21120, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites. Nice idea. Beautifully composed. It''s one of those pictures where i can stare at it all day... a 9 from me.</td>', 'One of my favourites. Nice idea. Beautifully composed. It''s one of those pictures where i can stare at it all day... a 9 from me.', '2004-05-12 15:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(714468, 74981, 13158, '<td valign="top">Excellent DOF here!  The colors are beautiful and the texture of the closed bud is gorgeous!  Had to up my score on this one after looking at it again.  Good job, I really like it.</td>', 'Excellent DOF here!  The colors are beautiful and the texture of the closed bud is gorgeous!  Had to up my score on this one after looking at it again.  Good job, I really like it.', '2004-05-12 15:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(714469, 75621, 5354, '<td valign="top">Nothing is in focus here, and coupled with the fact that there are many, many ''fire and ice'' entries this joust doesn''t match up. Sorry</td>', 'Nothing is in focus here, and coupled with the fact that there are many, many ''fire and ice'' entries this joust doesn''t match up. Sorry', '2004-05-12 15:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(714472, 75928, 21202, '<td valign="top">I guess I fail to see the opposite.  Sorry.  As to the picture itself, the ice and griddle do not appear to have great photogenic qualities.<br/> <br/>A 4.</td>', 'I guess I fail to see the opposite.  Sorry.  As to the picture itself, the ice and griddle do not appear to have great photogenic qualities. A 4.', '2004-05-12 15:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(714473, 76056, 10614, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like the glare on the front of the black keys.  I don''t know if it was intentional, or not so I am scoring as if it was.  good luck.</td>', 'I don''t really like the glare on the front of the black keys.  I don''t know if it was intentional, or not so I am scoring as if it was.  good luck.', '2004-05-12 15:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(714474, 75504, 5354, '<td valign="top">One of many ''glass of water'' images. The background kills this dead for me, too bright, overpowers the main image.</td>', 'One of many ''glass of water'' images. The background kills this dead for me, too bright, overpowers the main image.', '2004-05-12 15:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(714475, 75548, 13158, '<td valign="top">Awww very cute cats!  The black one gets a little lost on the black leather sofa, but the white one stands out perfectly!</td>', 'Awww very cute cats!  The black one gets a little lost on the black leather sofa, but the white one stands out perfectly!', '2004-05-12 15:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(714478, 75548, 15207, '<td valign="top">I know photographs of cats and pets usually get slagged in the DPForums. However, I  personally love the animal shots better than the people shots. This one in particular is extremely well done and I just love the expressions. Despite what people think, I know cats are very hard to capture with your camera because oft heir eyes. You did a perfect job. this ia great submission - 10</td>', 'I know photographs of cats and pets usually get slagged in the DPForums. However, I  personally love the animal shots better than the people shots. This one in particular is extremely well done and I just love the expressions. Despite what people think, I know cats are very hard to capture with your camera because oft heir eyes. You did a perfect job. this ia great submission - 10', '2004-05-12 15:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(714479, 75522, 13158, '<td valign="top">Wow very interesting photo!  The only thing I see is moving the little white phone to the right just a hair so it''s not touching the white the other phone is sitting on.  Otherwise, it''s very pleasing to look at.  I love b&amp;w images like this and you have done a great job with this one.</td>', 'Wow very interesting photo!  The only thing I see is moving the little white phone to the right just a hair so it''s not touching the white the other phone is sitting on.  Otherwise, it''s very pleasing to look at.  I love b&w images like this and you have done a great job with this one.', '2004-05-12 15:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(714480, 76056, 12448, '<td valign="top">If this was in focus and the end of the keys weren''t blown out with light this would probably rate an 8 or above,  I like the crop and the composition of the shot but the other factors hurt it a great deal.  A 3</td>', 'If this was in focus and the end of the keys weren''t blown out with light this would probably rate an 8 or above,  I like the crop and the composition of the shot but the other factors hurt it a great deal.  A 3', '2004-05-12 15:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(714482, 74616, 21440, '<td valign="top">Enter your comment here...</td>', 'Enter your comment here...', '2004-05-12 15:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(714487, 74590, 21430, '<td valign="top">Nice setup. <br/> <br/>  Ii don''t know if I would call Salt and Pepper Opposites so much as complimentary of each other...<br/> <br/>  The peppe rmill doesn''t have that much definition to it, mostly due to the darkness of the background. Maybe there is something that could be done with the lighting or perhaps with a different background color that could pop out the shape of the peper mill a little bit better.</td>', 'Nice setup.    Ii don''t know if I would call Salt and Pepper Opposites so much as complimentary of each other...   The peppe rmill doesn''t have that much definition to it, mostly due to the darkness of the background. Maybe there is something that could be done with the lighting or perhaps with a different background color that could pop out the shape of the peper mill a little bit better.', '2004-05-12 15:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(714489, 75998, 21430, '<td valign="top">I wish that the candle was in better focus with this shot.</td>', 'I wish that the candle was in better focus with this shot.', '2004-05-12 15:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(714490, 75321, 21291, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo!  What an excellent idea for this challenge.</td>', 'Excellent photo!  What an excellent idea for this challenge.', '2004-05-12 15:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(714491, 76027, 21202, '<td valign="top">Besides uptown and downtown there is motion and rest, focus and blur, light and dark, hatless and covered, bald and not.  I think the challenge has been well met.  The photo has a lot of appeal for me as well as my eyes keep going to the interest that the man with shoulder strap and hat is showing in the uptown sign. Excellent composition and exposure.<br/> <br/>A 9.</td>', 'Besides uptown and downtown there is motion and rest, focus and blur, light and dark, hatless and covered, bald and not.  I think the challenge has been well met.  The photo has a lot of appeal for me as well as my eyes keep going to the interest that the man with shoulder strap and hat is showing in the uptown sign. Excellent composition and exposure. A 9.', '2004-05-12 15:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
