(715290, 74613, 18349, '<td valign="top">Cute, very cute.   Wonder whose this is???  Very nice play on the challenge concept.  Too bad the light colored guy wouldn''t pose better for you...are they temperamental creatures?  :o)</td>', 'Cute, very cute.   Wonder whose this is???  Very nice play on the challenge concept.  Too bad the light colored guy wouldn''t pose better for you...are they temperamental creatures?  :o)', '2004-05-12 21:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
