(715379, 76093, 16488, '<td valign="top">Good idea for opposites...man/woman, leisure/dressy, big/small.  Possible improvements: re-orient the tongue of the boot so the label doesn''t show, try a background with more interest/texture, vary the relationship of the shoes to each other to take advantage of negative space.</td>', 'Good idea for opposites...man/woman, leisure/dressy, big/small.  Possible improvements: re-orient the tongue of the boot so the label doesn''t show, try a background with more interest/texture, vary the relationship of the shoes to each other to take advantage of negative space.', '2004-05-12 22:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
