(715452, 75203, 16488, '<td valign="top">Great idea for this challenge!  The choice of black and white works to unify the elements in the picture.  At first the staging felt a bit over-done to me.  But I realized it''s actually a bit under-done--I think "her" side needs something on the night stand. She may be a neat freak but I expect she has some personal belongings such as a tidy arrangement of photos, or neatly arranged books.  Overall, very nice.  Good light, focus, etc.</td>', 'Great idea for this challenge!  The choice of black and white works to unify the elements in the picture.  At first the staging felt a bit over-done to me.  But I realized it''s actually a bit under-done--I think "her" side needs something on the night stand. She may be a neat freak but I expect she has some personal belongings such as a tidy arrangement of photos, or neatly arranged books.  Overall, very nice.  Good light, focus, etc.', '2004-05-12 22:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
