(715465, 75761, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for this challenge!  I like the roundness of the shapes and the round light behind.  (There is some digital artifact on the background, though.)  I think you might have been able to convey the concept better (say, in the absence of a title) by not filling the one glass all the way to the top--I think with a little gap it would still be "full."  I mention that because at first glance it appeared to be just a differently colored glass.  Overall, very nice.  Good lighting, well composed, warm tones....</td>', 'Nice idea for this challenge!  I like the roundness of the shapes and the round light behind.  (There is some digital artifact on the background, though.)  I think you might have been able to convey the concept better (say, in the absence of a title) by not filling the one glass all the way to the top--I think with a little gap it would still be "full."  I mention that because at first glance it appeared to be just a differently colored glass.  Overall, very nice.  Good lighting, well composed, warm tones....', '2004-05-12 22:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
