(716286, 76063, 15919, '<td valign="top">The idea is good, the background is clean but still I think this could have been better performed.  A higher angela, show less of the salsa-cup (or what it´s called).  Think also that this kind of a photography works best with pretty shallow DOF to cast some parts of the subject out of foucs.</td>', 'The idea is good, the background is clean but still I think this could have been better performed.  A higher angela, show less of the salsa-cup (or what it´s called).  Think also that this kind of a photography works best with pretty shallow DOF to cast some parts of the subject out of foucs.', '2004-05-13 08:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(716287, 75863, 13759, '<td valign="top">Great subject, a bit aware from the theme at first time. But I´m impressed with results.</td>', 'Great subject, a bit aware from the theme at first time. But I´m impressed with results.', '2004-05-13 08:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(716288, 75063, 15919, '<td valign="top">Seems a litle grainy or pixaleted.  Also I think the setup isn´t very good and the background is to agressive and takes the attention from the main subjects.</td>', 'Seems a litle grainy or pixaleted.  Also I think the setup isn´t very good and the background is to agressive and takes the attention from the main subjects.', '2004-05-13 08:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
