(716297, 75552, 13759, '<td valign="top">I gues that oposites here are the colors itself. As a contrasting black and green. The subject to me is not clearly defined, but a second look made me saw.</td>', 'I gues that oposites here are the colors itself. As a contrasting black and green. The subject to me is not clearly defined, but a second look made me saw.', '2004-05-13 09:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(716298, 75321, 15497, '<td valign="top">Kiwiness? Amazing!!</td>', 'Kiwiness? Amazing!!', '2004-05-13 09:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(716302, 75572, 12253, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ve received a lot of comments that have told you this is out of focus (OOF).  But I am guessing you knew that.  So let''s look at something else.  It''s hard, in this depiction, to tell that the chess players are different.  The colors are the same in this very dark image.  There is a good feeling of "opposition" though, from the angle you''ve chosen.  But the tight crop here, combined with it being dark and OOF, doesn''t have any dynamic, or "pop" as some people refer to it.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ve received a lot of comments that have told you this is out of focus (OOF).  But I am guessing you knew that.  So let''s look at something else.  It''s hard, in this depiction, to tell that the chess players are different.  The colors are the same in this very dark image.  There is a good feeling of "opposition" though, from the angle you''ve chosen.  But the tight crop here, combined with it being dark and OOF, doesn''t have any dynamic, or "pop" as some people refer to it.', '2004-05-13 09:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(716305, 74599, 12253, '<td valign="top">While your concept for opposites is a very good one, it is in the cleverness of the realization of that concept that a wonderful picture could have been conceived.  It''s far too simplistic to represent this in lego characters.  Few could identify or even associate real life to these miniatures.  I think had you shot a BMW or limousine downtown where indigints were loitering, that would have had a lot of impact.</td>', 'While your concept for opposites is a very good one, it is in the cleverness of the realization of that concept that a wonderful picture could have been conceived.  It''s far too simplistic to represent this in lego characters.  Few could identify or even associate real life to these miniatures.  I think had you shot a BMW or limousine downtown where indigints were loitering, that would have had a lot of impact.', '2004-05-13 09:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(716308, 75474, 12253, '<td valign="top">IMHO, this shot suffers from a few technical faults, the boots are almost so dark as to be recognizable--I can tell they''re boots, and I''m guessing they''re some sort of ski boot?  Levels adjustment or some different lighting, perhaps from the side, might have remedied that.  The shadow and reflection on the wall are distracting--you could have avoided this by moving the subject far enough away from the wall, and even used an F-Stop to give you a soft background taking advantage of low DOF.</td>', 'IMHO, this shot suffers from a few technical faults, the boots are almost so dark as to be recognizable--I can tell they''re boots, and I''m guessing they''re some sort of ski boot?  Levels adjustment or some different lighting, perhaps from the side, might have remedied that.  The shadow and reflection on the wall are distracting--you could have avoided this by moving the subject far enough away from the wall, and even used an F-Stop to give you a soft background taking advantage of low DOF.', '2004-05-13 09:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(716315, 75656, 19785, '<td valign="top">I''ve got those lights!</td>', 'I''ve got those lights!', '2004-05-13 09:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(716316, 75873, 19785, '<td valign="top">Better if the bug were not black</td>', 'Better if the bug were not black', '2004-05-13 09:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(716327, 75748, 18349, '<td valign="top">That''s different.  Would have been good during the Abstract challenge.  It''s difficult for me to rate because I don''t know what it is or where to really look.  There isn''t a main focal point IMHO.  The faint lights in the dark BG are a bit distracting as well.  Sorry I couldn''t be of more help, but since I don''t know what it is, I can''t really offer suggestions on how I would improve or change it.</td>', 'That''s different.  Would have been good during the Abstract challenge.  It''s difficult for me to rate because I don''t know what it is or where to really look.  There isn''t a main focal point IMHO.  The faint lights in the dark BG are a bit distracting as well.  Sorry I couldn''t be of more help, but since I don''t know what it is, I can''t really offer suggestions on how I would improve or change it.', '2004-05-13 10:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(716330, 75992, 18349, '<td valign="top">I like this entry for it''s message...very poignant.  I do wish the lighting were a tad better across the photos to really emphasize the "citizen" part...and it appears that the photo in the center is a bit OOF.   But overall I like looking at this one.   I hope you get more comments soon! :o)</td>', 'I like this entry for it''s message...very poignant.  I do wish the lighting were a tad better across the photos to really emphasize the "citizen" part...and it appears that the photo in the center is a bit OOF.   But overall I like looking at this one.   I hope you get more comments soon! :o)', '2004-05-13 10:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(716331, 75184, 8139, '<td valign="top">Good subject. A level adjustment could improve it.</td>', 'Good subject. A level adjustment could improve it.', '2004-05-13 10:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(716341, 76060, 19841, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the challenge, but why is it all blue?  Grey or sepia tones look like deliberate limiting of color, but this blue just looks like you didn''t balance the color.  Good composotion and focus.</td>', 'Great idea for the challenge, but why is it all blue?  Grey or sepia tones look like deliberate limiting of color, but this blue just looks like you didn''t balance the color.  Good composotion and focus.', '2004-05-13 10:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(716346, 74599, 19841, '<td valign="top">If it was in focus, it would be good.   You could also crop closer on the bottom.</td>', 'If it was in focus, it would be good.   You could also crop closer on the bottom.', '2004-05-13 10:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(716349, 75909, 19841, '<td valign="top">I don''t know exactly what opposites you were aiming for.  He''s such a convincing woman that, without the title, most people would not see it.   Very nice portrait.</td>', 'I don''t know exactly what opposites you were aiming for.  He''s such a convincing woman that, without the title, most people would not see it.   Very nice portrait.', '2004-05-13 10:44:06.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(716350, 75744, 8139, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition, fits well the theme.</td>', 'Beautiful composition, fits well the theme.', '2004-05-13 10:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(716353, 75486, 19841, '<td valign="top">The photo is a bit unclear.  The light colored dog is blurry, and the dark one is so much blended with the shadows that, without the reference of another dog and the title, it would be very difficult to tell what it is.  Good idea, though!  The blonde one looks like a swell dog, too.</td>', 'The photo is a bit unclear.  The light colored dog is blurry, and the dark one is so much blended with the shadows that, without the reference of another dog and the title, it would be very difficult to tell what it is.  Good idea, though!  The blonde one looks like a swell dog, too.', '2004-05-13 10:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(716360, 75430, 19841, '<td valign="top">Good politically charged image.</td>', 'Good politically charged image.', '2004-05-13 10:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(716363, 76024, 19841, '<td valign="top">This is such a good action shot.. if only it were in focus!  You''ve got the hard part down.  (which is pointing the camera in the right direction, it''s amazing how many people never seem to get that)  Now you just need to get the technical details sorted out.</td>', 'This is such a good action shot.. if only it were in focus!  You''ve got the hard part down.  (which is pointing the camera in the right direction, it''s amazing how many people never seem to get that)  Now you just need to get the technical details sorted out.', '2004-05-13 11:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(716366, 75932, 16241, '<td valign="top">very cool</td>', 'very cool', '2004-05-13 11:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(716369, 75153, 16241, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2004-05-13 11:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(716370, 75058, 327, '<td valign="top">Love your lighting. Special. The bottom crop/right crop are really tight. Still excellent focus, composition and that light is great. good work.</td>', 'Love your lighting. Special. The bottom crop/right crop are really tight. Still excellent focus, composition and that light is great. good work.', '2004-05-13 11:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(716371, 75976, 327, '<td valign="top">Really nicely done. Good set up, good shot. The frame helps balance this well.</td>', 'Really nicely done. Good set up, good shot. The frame helps balance this well.', '2004-05-13 11:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(716373, 76016, 16241, '<td valign="top">great shot 8</td>', 'great shot 8', '2004-05-13 11:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(716374, 75681, 16241, '<td valign="top">neat</td>', 'neat', '2004-05-13 11:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(716380, 76117, 2464, '<td valign="top">My Opinion, good Subject chosen, though I think if you''d brought the tombstone and the flower to the centre as the main focus area it would have been better. 7.</td>', 'My Opinion, good Subject chosen, though I think if you''d brought the tombstone and the flower to the centre as the main focus area it would have been better. 7.', '2004-05-13 11:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(716382, 76010, 327, '<td valign="top">Good composition and good entry. Improvements would be the focus point, &lt;bottle&gt; the whole shot could be a bit more sharp, frame is a bit heavy. Still like the shot and wish you good luck.</td>', 'Good composition and good entry. Improvements would be the focus point, <bottle> the whole shot could be a bit more sharp, frame is a bit heavy. Still like the shot and wish you good luck.', '2004-05-13 11:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(716383, 75262, 2464, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I think it could use a little more exposure to bring a stronger colour to the pic. 7</td>', 'Nice, but I think it could use a little more exposure to bring a stronger colour to the pic. 7', '2004-05-13 11:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(716384, 75548, 13759, '<td valign="top">Nyce Kitty! Very well done. The eyes are superb.</td>', 'Nyce Kitty! Very well done. The eyes are superb.', '2004-05-13 11:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(716386, 75659, 2464, '<td valign="top">Good shot, however I think needs to be a little brighter, to really bring out the contrast of the dead and the living.</td>', 'Good shot, however I think needs to be a little brighter, to really bring out the contrast of the dead and the living.', '2004-05-13 11:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(716388, 75520, 2464, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh!!! : )</td>', 'Made me laugh!!! : )', '2004-05-13 11:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(716389, 76078, 19841, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  Why not in color, though?  I think color would have made the difference more striking.  You''ll probably get some complaints about the unusual composition, but I like it.</td>', 'Great idea!  Why not in color, though?  I think color would have made the difference more striking.  You''ll probably get some complaints about the unusual composition, but I like it.', '2004-05-13 11:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(716392, 75996, 2464, '<td valign="top">Good subject, but not sure of the title though. 7.</td>', 'Good subject, but not sure of the title though. 7.', '2004-05-13 11:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(716394, 75973, 19841, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  Unfortunately, sugar looks just like salt.  (salt and lemons are a favorite snack around here)  Maybe honey would have been more dramatic?</td>', 'Good idea.  Unfortunately, sugar looks just like salt.  (salt and lemons are a favorite snack around here)  Maybe honey would have been more dramatic?', '2004-05-13 11:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(716395, 75832, 2464, '<td valign="top">Appears a little out of focus.6</td>', 'Appears a little out of focus.6', '2004-05-13 11:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(716401, 76055, 18219, '<td valign="top">I can''t make out what is opposite here.<br/>Sorry.<br/>The smoke looks good and the colors are good though.<br/>Edit-yelow and blue are opposite!!!!</td>', 'I can''t make out what is opposite here.Sorry.The smoke looks good and the colors are good though.Edit-yelow and blue are opposite!!!!', '2004-05-13 11:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(716402, 74764, 18219, '<td valign="top">Predictable and blurry!!!<br/>But a good attempt at making the predictable original!</td>', 'Predictable and blurry!!!But a good attempt at making the predictable original!', '2004-05-13 11:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(716404, 76078, 2464, '<td valign="top">Didn''t really get it at first glance till I stared really hard at it and knew what you were going at. Hwr I think I would have been better in full colour? 6.</td>', 'Didn''t really get it at first glance till I stared really hard at it and knew what you were going at. Hwr I think I would have been better in full colour? 6.', '2004-05-13 11:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(716406, 74599, 2464, '<td valign="top">a bit out of focus. 6.</td>', 'a bit out of focus. 6.', '2004-05-13 11:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(716410, 75668, 18219, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if they are opposites?<br/>But a nice idea.<br/>The "side St." seems a bit dark.</td>', 'I''m not sure if they are opposites?But a nice idea.The "side St." seems a bit dark.', '2004-05-13 11:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(716411, 75621, 18219, '<td valign="top">would have been better if it was in focus.</td>', 'would have been better if it was in focus.', '2004-05-13 11:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(716412, 75522, 18219, '<td valign="top">S &amp; P aren''t opposites.<br/>The black and white is.<br/>I like that.<br/></td>', 'S & P aren''t opposites.The black and white is.I like that.', '2004-05-13 11:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(716413, 76084, 18219, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what is meant to be opposite here?<br/>I''m thinking the engine versus the muscles?<br/>But they aren''t oppsoites.<br/>Maybe male and female?<br/></td>', 'I can''t tell what is meant to be opposite here?I''m thinking the engine versus the muscles?But they aren''t oppsoites.Maybe male and female?', '2004-05-13 11:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(716414, 75548, 18219, '<td valign="top">I was going to do this with my cats!!<br/>So an extra point for having similar cats to me :-)</td>', 'I was going to do this with my cats!!So an extra point for having similar cats to me :-)', '2004-05-13 11:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(716415, 75489, 18219, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of this border, but the picture is good.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of this border, but the picture is good.', '2004-05-13 11:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(716419, 76069, 21217, '<td valign="top">Good idea, good traslation and good shot. Congratulations. My favourite in this challenge: 9.</td>', 'Good idea, good traslation and good shot. Congratulations. My favourite in this challenge: 9.', '2004-05-13 11:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(716423, 74604, 21430, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject...<br/> <br/>  I like the splash of color from the flowerbed in the bottom of the image, it really looks nice with the yellowish subjects of this shot. Good shot.</td>', 'Interesting subject...   I like the splash of color from the flowerbed in the bottom of the image, it really looks nice with the yellowish subjects of this shot. Good shot.', '2004-05-13 11:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(716425, 75970, 18219, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.<br/>But I''m not quite sure what is opposite?</td>', 'Interesting shot.But I''m not quite sure what is opposite?', '2004-05-13 11:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(716427, 75699, 18219, '<td valign="top">I can see a spider, but that''s all.<br/>I''m not even sure what an opposite of a spider is.</td>', 'I can see a spider, but that''s all.I''m not even sure what an opposite of a spider is.', '2004-05-13 11:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(716428, 76009, 18219, '<td valign="top">Very interesting!</td>', 'Very interesting!', '2004-05-13 11:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(716432, 76056, 18219, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been much better if the white keys were in focus.</td>', 'I think it would have been much better if the white keys were in focus.', '2004-05-13 12:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(716433, 75953, 21430, '<td valign="top">This is slightly out of focus, the composition isn''t extremely pleasing to look at. However, the coloration of the yellow from the candle(?) is a pleasing capture. There''s also a bit of noise in this shot.</td>', 'This is slightly out of focus, the composition isn''t extremely pleasing to look at. However, the coloration of the yellow from the candle(?) is a pleasing capture. There''s also a bit of noise in this shot.', '2004-05-13 12:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(716434, 75104, 18219, '<td valign="top">It took me a couple of seconds.....but an original idea.</td>', 'It took me a couple of seconds.....but an original idea.', '2004-05-13 12:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(716435, 75823, 21430, '<td valign="top">This is a good night time shot. To me, it doesn''t seem to busy and it doesn''t seem to dead. I believe this would work nicely as one of the smaller ''side'' photos in a brochure for this resort(?).</td>', 'This is a good night time shot. To me, it doesn''t seem to busy and it doesn''t seem to dead. I believe this would work nicely as one of the smaller ''side'' photos in a brochure for this resort(?).', '2004-05-13 12:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(716436, 76123, 18219, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure daughter is the opposite of mother.<br/>Nice idea though.</td>', 'I''m not sure daughter is the opposite of mother.Nice idea though.', '2004-05-13 12:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(716437, 75815, 18219, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2004-05-13 12:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(716439, 75828, 18219, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.<br/>A little too dark though.</td>', 'Nice picture.A little too dark though.', '2004-05-13 12:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(716446, 75998, 19901, '<td valign="top">Good idea, I like the DOF idea.  I would like to see what this picture would look like if the DOF was a little deeper, with little more detail on the candle.</td>', 'Good idea, I like the DOF idea.  I would like to see what this picture would look like if the DOF was a little deeper, with little more detail on the candle.', '2004-05-13 12:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(716449, 76126, 19901, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple picture, well illustrated.</td>', 'Nice, simple picture, well illustrated.', '2004-05-13 12:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(716451, 75411, 19901, '<td valign="top">Good idea,  I would score it much higher if it were not blurry</td>', 'Good idea,  I would score it much higher if it were not blurry', '2004-05-13 12:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(716452, 76086, 19901, '<td valign="top">I like the composition with people in motion.  It''s too bad the face of the man sitting to the right is dark.  That''s difficult to correct with the Basic editing requirements</td>', 'I like the composition with people in motion.  It''s too bad the face of the man sitting to the right is dark.  That''s difficult to correct with the Basic editing requirements', '2004-05-13 12:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(716454, 75321, 19901, '<td valign="top">Very striking photo, I like it.</td>', 'Very striking photo, I like it.', '2004-05-13 12:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(716455, 74590, 16106, '<td valign="top">I think the cropping is powerfull and the B&amp;W reduction silky and strong, on the whole a good graphic image. My only beef is that I think of salt and pepper as two things that go together, with more similarties than differences. Same can be said of the subjects in about one third of the entries, but this is such a good shot it is my only criticism.</td>', 'I think the cropping is powerfull and the B&W reduction silky and strong, on the whole a good graphic image. My only beef is that I think of salt and pepper as two things that go together, with more similarties than differences. Same can be said of the subjects in about one third of the entries, but this is such a good shot it is my only criticism.', '2004-05-13 12:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(716458, 76078, 19901, '<td valign="top">Good idea and composition, not too sure about the tint though.  I would like to see this in color.</td>', 'Good idea and composition, not too sure about the tint though.  I would like to see this in color.', '2004-05-13 12:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(716461, 76027, 16106, '<td valign="top">two things that would have made this a stronger shot. If the white guy was walking in the other direction, it would have compleated the opposition. If the downtown sign was more firmly in the frame it would have given it more power to balance out the softness of focus, as it is it has less impact than the uptown sign, where as the two figures balance very nicely because of their solid placment in the frame. Nice to see a non studio/ posed shot here.</td>', 'two things that would have made this a stronger shot. If the white guy was walking in the other direction, it would have compleated the opposition. If the downtown sign was more firmly in the frame it would have given it more power to balance out the softness of focus, as it is it has less impact than the uptown sign, where as the two figures balance very nicely because of their solid placment in the frame. Nice to see a non studio/ posed shot here.', '2004-05-13 12:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(716463, 76098, 16106, '<td valign="top">A bit back focused, too bad because this colors are strong, but the fore ground and main focal point is out of focus.</td>', 'A bit back focused, too bad because this colors are strong, but the fore ground and main focal point is out of focus.', '2004-05-13 12:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(716465, 74588, 16106, '<td valign="top">great light but if the lack of focus is intentional it dosen''t work for me.</td>', 'great light but if the lack of focus is intentional it dosen''t work for me.', '2004-05-13 12:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(716469, 75280, 16106, '<td valign="top">I wish you had left a tiny bit of space around the top and bottom of the glass in the foreground. Given the area left and right the bottom and top feel squeezed. Very tough subject matter well shot.</td>', 'I wish you had left a tiny bit of space around the top and bottom of the glass in the foreground. Given the area left and right the bottom and top feel squeezed. Very tough subject matter well shot.', '2004-05-13 12:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(716471, 75854, 16106, '<td valign="top">Wow, this shot makes quite an impression after 200 staged shots. I think you could have cropped down and right to increase the impact of your central elements, after all this is about power not clouds, but that is nit picking, this one is in ribbon territory.</td>', 'Wow, this shot makes quite an impression after 200 staged shots. I think you could have cropped down and right to increase the impact of your central elements, after all this is about power not clouds, but that is nit picking, this one is in ribbon territory.', '2004-05-13 12:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(716477, 76024, 16106, '<td valign="top">Good subject matter, but if you can''t get it in focus you missed the capture. In some fora you can get away with a certain softness, but here it seems to be a mania, and sport action dosen''t lend itself to soft focus.</td>', 'Good subject matter, but if you can''t get it in focus you missed the capture. In some fora you can get away with a certain softness, but here it seems to be a mania, and sport action dosen''t lend itself to soft focus.', '2004-05-13 12:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(716479, 75971, 16106, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been stronger with less grass, and with out the distracting triangle of white in the upper right corner. Crop it square and make it bigger</td>', 'I think this would have been stronger with less grass, and with out the distracting triangle of white in the upper right corner. Crop it square and make it bigger', '2004-05-13 12:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(716480, 75907, 16106, '<td valign="top">Very pretty ice, good color balance</td>', 'Very pretty ice, good color balance', '2004-05-13 12:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(716481, 75770, 11324, '<td valign="top">People are voting critically this challenge because they aren''t using their brain.  But this photo is GREAT!  Life- the flower itself, or the LIFE term you''ll get if you use the gun on someone.  Death - the gun itself or the flowers that you place on a grave. I don''t know if you meant this double-edged opposition, where each subject could represent both LIFE and DEATH, but this is truly well done.  (9)</td>', 'People are voting critically this challenge because they aren''t using their brain.  But this photo is GREAT!  Life- the flower itself, or the LIFE term you''ll get if you use the gun on someone.  Death - the gun itself or the flowers that you place on a grave. I don''t know if you meant this double-edged opposition, where each subject could represent both LIFE and DEATH, but this is truly well done.  (9)', '2004-05-13 12:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(716484, 75477, 16106, '<td valign="top">why the keystone perspective? either shoot at a lower more dynamic angle or from square up for the static image. It seems to me this angle straddles the fence and is hurt for it.</td>', 'why the keystone perspective? either shoot at a lower more dynamic angle or from square up for the static image. It seems to me this angle straddles the fence and is hurt for it.', '2004-05-13 12:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(716485, 75930, 11324, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Simple and captivating.  However, the photo is way to grainy and doesn'' t have enough contrast.  The whites could be whiter and the black could be blacker.  Good attempt.</td>', 'Great idea.  Simple and captivating.  However, the photo is way to grainy and doesn'' t have enough contrast.  The whites could be whiter and the black could be blacker.  Good attempt.', '2004-05-13 12:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(716488, 76034, 11324, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to see it more in focus.  Great concept - would have been one of my top picks if the photo itself would have been sharper. (7)</td>', 'Would have liked to see it more in focus.  Great concept - would have been one of my top picks if the photo itself would have been sharper. (7)', '2004-05-13 12:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(716492, 76023, 11324, '<td valign="top">Salt and pepper - ying and the yang - narrow vs. fat neck - very nicely done!  Love the natural shadows and definitely LOVE the composition.  Ribbon duly deserved.  9</td>', 'Salt and pepper - ying and the yang - narrow vs. fat neck - very nicely done!  Love the natural shadows and definitely LOVE the composition.  Ribbon duly deserved.  9', '2004-05-13 12:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(716493, 75952, 11324, '<td valign="top">Simple elegance.  Love it!  (8)</td>', 'Simple elegance.  Love it!  (8)', '2004-05-13 12:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(716495, 75203, 11324, '<td valign="top">*snickers*  looks like my bedroom !  8</td>', '*snickers*  looks like my bedroom !  8', '2004-05-13 12:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(716497, 74696, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, very, very good!  Hope you do well with this one.   9  (came back and raised this beauty to 10)</td>', 'Oh, very, very good!  Hope you do well with this one.   9  (came back and raised this beauty to 10)', '2004-05-13 12:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(716500, 75558, 20027, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Lighting seems to favor the U.S flag. Perhaps this was done on purpose to signify their victory in The Civil War. 8</td>', 'Nicely done. Lighting seems to favor the U.S flag. Perhaps this was done on purpose to signify their victory in The Civil War. 8', '2004-05-13 12:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(716501, 75815, 11324, '<td valign="top">Very elegant.  Nice concept.  Border addes A LOT of, how do you say - umph!  (8)</td>', 'Very elegant.  Nice concept.  Border addes A LOT of, how do you say - umph!  (8)', '2004-05-13 12:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(716502, 75967, 11324, '<td valign="top">Sambuca!</td>', 'Sambuca!', '2004-05-13 12:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(716503, 75970, 16106, '<td valign="top">Im not sure if the cromatic aberation can in the camera or is the result of too much saturation in post processing, but it hurts this shot. Strong idea but too jangly in the final image.</td>', 'Im not sure if the cromatic aberation can in the camera or is the result of too much saturation in post processing, but it hurts this shot. Strong idea but too jangly in the final image.', '2004-05-13 12:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(716504, 75913, 20027, '<td valign="top">Great contrast, very vivid. Whites seems to have lost some detail but it works nonetheless. One of my favoriites in this challenge. 8</td>', 'Great contrast, very vivid. Whites seems to have lost some detail but it works nonetheless. One of my favoriites in this challenge. 8', '2004-05-13 12:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(716505, 75403, 11324, '<td valign="top">Awww, this is the cutest animal photograph of the challenge!  Nicely done -  I especially like the faact that they are also looking at each other which adds to the "opposite" effect.  (8)</td>', 'Awww, this is the cutest animal photograph of the challenge!  Nicely done -  I especially like the faact that they are also looking at each other which adds to the "opposite" effect.  (8)', '2004-05-13 12:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(716507, 75907, 20027, '<td valign="top">Many tried and many failed. You succeeded. Originally gave this an 8 but after revisiting, I''m bumping it up to a 9.</td>', 'Many tried and many failed. You succeeded. Originally gave this an 8 but after revisiting, I''m bumping it up to a 9.', '2004-05-13 12:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(716508, 74599, 16106, '<td valign="top">In a still life set up you have to be able to get the subejct in focus! If this shot is in focus then something happened in post processing because it isn''t now. No matter how good an idea you have people can''t judge it if the presentation is flawed. Be fair to your ideas, shoot and review untill you get what you want.</td>', 'In a still life set up you have to be able to get the subejct in focus! If this shot is in focus then something happened in post processing because it isn''t now. No matter how good an idea you have people can''t judge it if the presentation is flawed. Be fair to your ideas, shoot and review untill you get what you want.', '2004-05-13 12:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(716512, 74991, 16106, '<td valign="top">Great expression on the beasty, but the framing puzzles me. I would have either pulled back and gotten his whole body and the architecture of curves of this feet and tail, or moved in so his face filled the frame to maximise the power of his gaze. This composition does a bit of both but neither all the way.</td>', 'Great expression on the beasty, but the framing puzzles me. I would have either pulled back and gotten his whole body and the architecture of curves of this feet and tail, or moved in so his face filled the frame to maximise the power of his gaze. This composition does a bit of both but neither all the way.', '2004-05-13 13:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(716513, 76009, 20027, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation of the challenge, one of the more unique photos. Damn telephone poles, their everywhere! 8</td>', 'Nice interpretation of the challenge, one of the more unique photos. Damn telephone poles, their everywhere! 8', '2004-05-13 13:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(716519, 76069, 20027, '<td valign="top">Possibly, the most unique idea in the challenge. Great job. Would like to know how you did this without creating shadows. 8</td>', 'Possibly, the most unique idea in the challenge. Great job. Would like to know how you did this without creating shadows. 8', '2004-05-13 13:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
