(716703, 76122, 16106, '<td valign="top">I wish you had hit the oil with more light to really make it glow, either from behind or above to keep highlights off the glass. The composition is interesting but the colors need to be as bold as your framing.</td>', 'I wish you had hit the oil with more light to really make it glow, either from behind or above to keep highlights off the glass. The composition is interesting but the colors need to be as bold as your framing.', '2004-05-13 13:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
