(716706, 76107, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for this challenge.  The refraction from the lens detracts somewhat--perhaps if you''d waited a few more minutes the trees would have obscured the sun enough to make this more pleasing.</td>', 'Nice idea for this challenge.  The refraction from the lens detracts somewhat--perhaps if you''d waited a few more minutes the trees would have obscured the sun enough to make this more pleasing.', '2004-05-13 13:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
