(716732, 75699, 12252, '<td valign="top">What IS this? I take it the black thing is some kind of bug? So that must be the beast, right? So where''s Beauty? The bug or whatever it is is mostly out of focus, and the background is confusing and doesn''t support the subject.</td>', 'What IS this? I take it the black thing is some kind of bug? So that must be the beast, right? So where''s Beauty? The bug or whatever it is is mostly out of focus, and the background is confusing and doesn''t support the subject.', '2004-05-13 14:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
