(716794, 76046, 21430, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. It''s also good to see color in this image as opposed to simply a white feather.<br/> <br/>Good work. The only thing I can suggest is perhaps altering the lighting to lessen the white along the ''spine'' of the purple feather and along the edges of the weight.</td>', 'Nice composition. It''s also good to see color in this image as opposed to simply a white feather. Good work. The only thing I can suggest is perhaps altering the lighting to lessen the white along the ''spine'' of the purple feather and along the edges of the weight.', '2004-05-13 15:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
