(716847, 75831, 21202, '<td valign="top">A very hard concept to deliver in a photo.  The left hand side of the left hand rock is in too soft focus to illustrate hard, and the sharp focus on parts of the feather do not convey soft.  In fact, it is the downy feathers, not the wing feathers which are soft enough for pillows.  The horizontal piece of grass hurts the composition in my estimation, and the wasp steals the eye.<br/> <br/>A 3.</td>', 'A very hard concept to deliver in a photo.  The left hand side of the left hand rock is in too soft focus to illustrate hard, and the sharp focus on parts of the feather do not convey soft.  In fact, it is the downy feathers, not the wing feathers which are soft enough for pillows.  The horizontal piece of grass hurts the composition in my estimation, and the wasp steals the eye. A 3.', '2004-05-13 15:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
