(717043, 75818, 15810, '<td valign="top">This is very very odd. The lighting on the eggs (in focus) seems totally separate from the Veg (which is out of focus) which is blurrier than the greens in the background. As a photograph depicting opposites it works though coz everything works against each other to make it truly horrible.</td>', 'This is very very odd. The lighting on the eggs (in focus) seems totally separate from the Veg (which is out of focus) which is blurrier than the greens in the background. As a photograph depicting opposites it works though coz everything works against each other to make it truly horrible.', '2004-05-13 16:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
