(717401, 76009, 5044, '<td valign="top">Amazing scene. Good capture. Good image for this challnge.</td>', 'Amazing scene. Good capture. Good image for this challnge.', '2004-05-13 21:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(717414, 76024, 7560, '<td valign="top">Sports shooting is one of the hardest things to do. This is a great start. First off, you should look at upping the shutter speed. 1/250 and higher should freeze the motion with litle blurring.  The sign with the #8 is very distracting. When shooting sports, try to position yourself to eliminate things like that if possible. When not submitting to a challenge, clone that puppy out!. Also consider blurring out more of the figures in the background in post processing. <br/> <br/>Sports is all about capturing the moment. Keep working at it!</td>', 'Sports shooting is one of the hardest things to do. This is a great start. First off, you should look at upping the shutter speed. 1/250 and higher should freeze the motion with litle blurring.  The sign with the #8 is very distracting. When shooting sports, try to position yourself to eliminate things like that if possible. When not submitting to a challenge, clone that puppy out!. Also consider blurring out more of the figures in the background in post processing.  Sports is all about capturing the moment. Keep working at it!', '2004-05-13 21:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(717418, 75548, 7560, '<td valign="top">What can I say, I''m a sucker for cat pictures. :) Looks like the whiskers are a tad over sharp. This should probably get a lower score on the technical side (over sharpened, some hilights blown out) but frankly they are just too cute. :) Exposing correctly in this situation is hard. You might burn in a bit on the white kitty.  7</td>', 'What can I say, I''m a sucker for cat pictures. :) Looks like the whiskers are a tad over sharp. This should probably get a lower score on the technical side (over sharpened, some hilights blown out) but frankly they are just too cute. :) Exposing correctly in this situation is hard. You might burn in a bit on the white kitty.  7', '2004-05-13 21:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
