(717434, 76087, 7560, '<td valign="top">The strength of this image comes from the two different sets of lines, curved and straight. It''s incredibly powerful visually. I''d love to see this shot at sunrise/set with the color change! 8</td>', 'The strength of this image comes from the two different sets of lines, curved and straight. It''s incredibly powerful visually. I''d love to see this shot at sunrise/set with the color change! 8', '2004-05-13 22:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
