(717983, 75870, 19785, '<td valign="top">analog!</td>', 'analog!', '2004-05-14 09:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(717991, 75651, 18374, '<td valign="top">While this might be a great photo for the family album, I don''t think it is a good entry for this challenge.  Technically it is a very nice portrait (+1 point)- Very sharp, decent lighting and appropriate blurring of the background.</td>', 'While this might be a great photo for the family album, I don''t think it is a good entry for this challenge.  Technically it is a very nice portrait (+1 point)- Very sharp, decent lighting and appropriate blurring of the background.', '2004-05-14 10:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(717995, 75969, 18374, '<td valign="top">I don''t particularly care for the overexposure or blown out highlights on this photo.  I also don''t get what is opposite.</td>', 'I don''t particularly care for the overexposure or blown out highlights on this photo.  I also don''t get what is opposite.', '2004-05-14 10:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(717997, 75170, 18374, '<td valign="top">I don''t get what is opposite about the elements in this photo.  The still life of the fruit looks very nice, but the out of focus flowers really detract from this image.  If the flowers are an important element in the photo (as I suspect from the title) I would prefer to see them in focus and more than 1/4 of the way into the frame.  As it is right now, it feels very unbalanced- the eye is drawn all the way to the left of the photo and out of the frame.</td>', 'I don''t get what is opposite about the elements in this photo.  The still life of the fruit looks very nice, but the out of focus flowers really detract from this image.  If the flowers are an important element in the photo (as I suspect from the title) I would prefer to see them in focus and more than 1/4 of the way into the frame.  As it is right now, it feels very unbalanced- the eye is drawn all the way to the left of the photo and out of the frame.', '2004-05-14 10:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(717998, 75850, 16862, '<td valign="top">This is a nice picture. <br/>1. I think it should have been vertical<br/>2. The light (flame) is too close to the frame<br/>3. Maybe the white balace should be different.<br/>4. The focus is good<br/>5. The background is good<br/>Good work</td>', 'This is a nice picture. 1. I think it should have been vertical2. The light (flame) is too close to the frame3. Maybe the white balace should be different.4. The focus is good5. The background is goodGood work', '2004-05-14 10:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
