(718020, 75958, 18374, '<td valign="top">I don''t get what is opposite here- light and dark?  The bright (overexposed) light at the right draws the eye away from the subject and pulls the eye out of the frame leaving the entire left side of the photograph dark and unnoticed.  There is nothing of interest for the eye on the left.</td>', 'I don''t get what is opposite here- light and dark?  The bright (overexposed) light at the right draws the eye away from the subject and pulls the eye out of the frame leaving the entire left side of the photograph dark and unnoticed.  There is nothing of interest for the eye on the left.', '2004-05-14 10:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
