(718032, 75621, 18374, '<td valign="top">The ice looks out of focus and is awfully dark.  It doesn''t stand out from the background at all.  The fire is interesting and by itself might make a good photo, but this combination is pretty dull.</td>', 'The ice looks out of focus and is awfully dark.  It doesn''t stand out from the background at all.  The fire is interesting and by itself might make a good photo, but this combination is pretty dull.', '2004-05-14 10:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(718036, 75928, 18374, '<td valign="top">I don''t find this image very appealing.  The colors are dull, like the photo was overexposed or brightened too much.  The focus looks a little soft.  Overall the subject is boring too.  There is nothing that makes you go "wow".</td>', 'I don''t find this image very appealing.  The colors are dull, like the photo was overexposed or brightened too much.  The focus looks a little soft.  Overall the subject is boring too.  There is nothing that makes you go "wow".', '2004-05-14 10:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
