(718043, 75659, 20204, '<td valign="top">A bit dark, and the left thistle is out of focus.  I like the depth of field - does a great job of highlighting the subject.  I also like the water on the right thistles - very nice touch.</td>', 'A bit dark, and the left thistle is out of focus.  I like the depth of field - does a great job of highlighting the subject.  I also like the water on the right thistles - very nice touch.', '2004-05-14 10:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(718044, 75681, 18374, '<td valign="top">The colors look very subdued and unnatural in this picture.  If this was done in PS, I don''t particulary care for the effect.  If it came from the camera, you may want to re-evaluate the use of backlighting for this shot.  The reflections on the floor distract from the main subject.  A table cloth or sheet or something under the chess set might have removed or at least softened these reflections.</td>', 'The colors look very subdued and unnatural in this picture.  If this was done in PS, I don''t particulary care for the effect.  If it came from the camera, you may want to re-evaluate the use of backlighting for this shot.  The reflections on the floor distract from the main subject.  A table cloth or sheet or something under the chess set might have removed or at least softened these reflections.', '2004-05-14 10:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(718045, 76001, 20204, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and nice lighting.</td>', 'Interesting composition and nice lighting.', '2004-05-14 10:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(718046, 75280, 20204, '<td valign="top">Very clever use of perspective (mental AND photographic!)</td>', 'Very clever use of perspective (mental AND photographic!)', '2004-05-14 10:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(718047, 76005, 18374, '<td valign="top">I don''t find this picture to be particulary interesting.  It feels very busy with lots of different elements vying for your attention.  I like the focus and depth of field.</td>', 'I don''t find this picture to be particulary interesting.  It feels very busy with lots of different elements vying for your attention.  I like the focus and depth of field.', '2004-05-14 10:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(718048, 75406, 20204, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic.  I love the fine detail on the silhouetted trees.</td>', 'Very dramatic.  I love the fine detail on the silhouetted trees.', '2004-05-14 10:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(718049, 74764, 20204, '<td valign="top">I think this one should have been a do-over.  It''s completely out of focus.</td>', 'I think this one should have been a do-over.  It''s completely out of focus.', '2004-05-14 11:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(718051, 75744, 20204, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting in this!  The composition is excellent also.  The laptop doesn''t compete with the window details, but makes for a complimentary point of interest.  Very creative and well done!</td>', 'I love the lighting in this!  The composition is excellent also.  The laptop doesn''t compete with the window details, but makes for a complimentary point of interest.  Very creative and well done!', '2004-05-14 11:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(718052, 75971, 6130, '<td valign="top">Nice and cute.</td>', 'Nice and cute.', '2004-05-14 11:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(718053, 75211, 6130, '<td valign="top">lovely</td>', 'lovely', '2004-05-14 11:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(718055, 74748, 20204, '<td valign="top">I thnk this would have wored better if you''d removed the foreground rightmost flower which is out of focus, leaving only the center, focused flower.  Without the title I''m not sure how well this would have met the challenge.  I like to see the pictures stand more on their own.</td>', 'I thnk this would have wored better if you''d removed the foreground rightmost flower which is out of focus, leaving only the center, focused flower.  Without the title I''m not sure how well this would have met the challenge.  I like to see the pictures stand more on their own.', '2004-05-14 11:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(718057, 75046, 6130, '<td valign="top">Outstanding 10</td>', 'Outstanding 10', '2004-05-14 11:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(718058, 74694, 18374, '<td valign="top">This picture isn''t very interesting to me.  I see some dull colored rocks and poorly defined shadows.  Much of the rock in this picture looks overexposed and washed out.</td>', 'This picture isn''t very interesting to me.  I see some dull colored rocks and poorly defined shadows.  Much of the rock in this picture looks overexposed and washed out.', '2004-05-14 11:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(718059, 75406, 6130, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2004-05-14 11:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(718060, 74613, 20204, '<td valign="top">Creative.  The image seems a bit fuzzy to me.  I''m not sure if its the lighting or the sharpness.</td>', 'Creative.  The image seems a bit fuzzy to me.  I''m not sure if its the lighting or the sharpness.', '2004-05-14 11:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(718062, 75832, 6130, '<td valign="top">Funny lol.</td>', 'Funny lol.', '2004-05-14 11:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(718063, 74732, 20204, '<td valign="top">The table edge on the right is distracting, and the image is very grainy.  Might have also done better from a more interesting angle than head-on.  Maybe contrasting the knife against the flag.</td>', 'The table edge on the right is distracting, and the image is very grainy.  Might have also done better from a more interesting angle than head-on.  Maybe contrasting the knife against the flag.', '2004-05-14 11:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(718064, 75955, 18374, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I get the "Opposites" in this photo.  Good detail in the picture, but I don''t find the subject and overall picture to be that interesting.  The colors and "skin tones" seem to be slightly off.  Maybe a different white balance setting would fix that.</td>', 'I''m not sure I get the "Opposites" in this photo.  Good detail in the picture, but I don''t find the subject and overall picture to be that interesting.  The colors and "skin tones" seem to be slightly off.  Maybe a different white balance setting would fix that.', '2004-05-14 11:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(718066, 75775, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great use of silhouette!  I didn''t realize the bird was alive until I looked twice.  I''ve said it many times, but my favorite quality in an image is one that rewards a second glance.  It looks like the crop is a bit tight on the left, but otherwise, great job!</td>', 'Great use of silhouette!  I didn''t realize the bird was alive until I looked twice.  I''ve said it many times, but my favorite quality in an image is one that rewards a second glance.  It looks like the crop is a bit tight on the left, but otherwise, great job!', '2004-05-14 11:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(718067, 74631, 20204, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.  There''s some distraction in the lower left corner which would have been nice to eliminate.  Also a little extra shadow on the keys which a second light source might have helped with.  Finally, I think it needs more sharpness.</td>', 'Nice perspective.  There''s some distraction in the lower left corner which would have been nice to eliminate.  Also a little extra shadow on the keys which a second light source might have helped with.  Finally, I think it needs more sharpness.', '2004-05-14 11:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(718069, 75834, 20204, '<td valign="top">I think this image would be better without the opposing colors in the backdrop.  Just a clean image of the two oreo halves.  The cookie seems a bit grey vs. black.  Not sure how to improve that, but something to think about.</td>', 'I think this image would be better without the opposing colors in the backdrop.  Just a clean image of the two oreo halves.  The cookie seems a bit grey vs. black.  Not sure how to improve that, but something to think about.', '2004-05-14 11:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(718072, 75763, 20204, '<td valign="top">Not sure how these are opposites, but its an interesting image.  The image is lacking in sharpness, and there seems to be a shadow or light artifact in the lower left which is distracting.</td>', 'Not sure how these are opposites, but its an interesting image.  The image is lacking in sharpness, and there seems to be a shadow or light artifact in the lower left which is distracting.', '2004-05-14 11:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(718073, 75960, 20204, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, and it''s nice that the background doesn''t compete with the subject(s).  the problem is that the subject is not in focus.  the shadow  from the cloth in upper left is also distracting.</td>', 'Interesting composition, and it''s nice that the background doesn''t compete with the subject(s).  the problem is that the subject is not in focus.  the shadow  from the cloth in upper left is also distracting.', '2004-05-14 11:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(718074, 75991, 20204, '<td valign="top">The cropping is awkward in cutting off the boot tray.  The shadow near the formal shoes, and the black thing on the left are both distracting.  I''d suggest that you focus on what your subject is and find ways to highlight them rather than have competition for them.  In other words, try shotting this sgain without distracting elements and maybe from a perspective that brings out the delicate features of the formal shoes vs. the clunky and dirty sneakers.  It would make an interesting contrast.</td>', 'The cropping is awkward in cutting off the boot tray.  The shadow near the formal shoes, and the black thing on the left are both distracting.  I''d suggest that you focus on what your subject is and find ways to highlight them rather than have competition for them.  In other words, try shotting this sgain without distracting elements and maybe from a perspective that brings out the delicate features of the formal shoes vs. the clunky and dirty sneakers.  It would make an interesting contrast.', '2004-05-14 11:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(718075, 75958, 20204, '<td valign="top">I wish it wasn''t overesposed on the right as I like the dramatic sidelighting in this.  Seems like ti would benefit from a little sharpening as well.</td>', 'I wish it wasn''t overesposed on the right as I like the dramatic sidelighting in this.  Seems like ti would benefit from a little sharpening as well.', '2004-05-14 11:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(718077, 75973, 20204, '<td valign="top">The background has too much texture and distracts from the subjects.   The shadow on the lemon''s edge is also distracting.</td>', 'The background has too much texture and distracts from the subjects.   The shadow on the lemon''s edge is also distracting.', '2004-05-14 11:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(718079, 75985, 20204, '<td valign="top">Looks like the image is tilted clockwise by 1-2 degrees.  It''s also a bit dark for my liking, and would benefit from sharpening.</td>', 'Looks like the image is tilted clockwise by 1-2 degrees.  It''s also a bit dark for my liking, and would benefit from sharpening.', '2004-05-14 11:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(718081, 75923, 20204, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition.  A bit overexposed on the left leaf.</td>', 'Very interesting composition.  A bit overexposed on the left leaf.', '2004-05-14 11:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(718083, 75897, 6870, '<td valign="top">Great idea! Centered composition is appropriate. Straightforward point of view is, well, straightforward and communicates what you want to communicate. Have you tried other angles for fun?</td>', 'Great idea! Centered composition is appropriate. Straightforward point of view is, well, straightforward and communicates what you want to communicate. Have you tried other angles for fun?', '2004-05-14 11:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(718084, 75907, 20204, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure and colors.  The background is nice as well - doesn''t distract from the image.</td>', 'Nice exposure and colors.  The background is nice as well - doesn''t distract from the image.', '2004-05-14 11:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(718086, 75063, 20204, '<td valign="top">Seems out of focus, and the background is competing strongly with the subjects instead of complimenting them.  Shadows on the minolta are also distracting.</td>', 'Seems out of focus, and the background is competing strongly with the subjects instead of complimenting them.  Shadows on the minolta are also distracting.', '2004-05-14 11:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(718087, 76112, 20204, '<td valign="top">Looks like a focus problem on the back set of batteries.  Background is nice though - doesn''t compete with the subject.</td>', 'Looks like a focus problem on the back set of batteries.  Background is nice though - doesn''t compete with the subject.', '2004-05-14 11:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(718088, 75920, 20204, '<td valign="top">Very creative and interesting use of the tile pattern.  I''m not crazy about the lighting being so much brighter in the back, but I like seeing somethign different.</td>', 'Very creative and interesting use of the tile pattern.  I''m not crazy about the lighting being so much brighter in the back, but I like seeing somethign different.', '2004-05-14 11:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(718089, 75548, 20204, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, and the background works well.</td>', 'Nicely composed, and the background works well.', '2004-05-14 11:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(718091, 75717, 20204, '<td valign="top">Flame is unsharp, out of focus, or overesposed.  The tray its in is also distracting from its reflective properties.  This might have worked better with a match or candle.</td>', 'Flame is unsharp, out of focus, or overesposed.  The tray its in is also distracting from its reflective properties.  This might have worked better with a match or candle.', '2004-05-14 11:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(718093, 75928, 20204, '<td valign="top">There''s a lack of sharpness here, and not enough contrast between the subject and background.</td>', 'There''s a lack of sharpness here, and not enough contrast between the subject and background.', '2004-05-14 11:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(718094, 75974, 18219, '<td valign="top">Classic rivalry, but not exactly opposites.</td>', 'Classic rivalry, but not exactly opposites.', '2004-05-14 11:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(718096, 75973, 18219, '<td valign="top">hooray, finally a decent opposite.<br/>Well done.<br/>I don''t like the background though!!!<br/>But what do I know?</td>', 'hooray, finally a decent opposite.Well done.I don''t like the background though!!!But what do I know?', '2004-05-14 11:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(718097, 75715, 20204, '<td valign="top">If you could save the image with a lower quality you''d still have plenty of detail for on screen viewing and provide an image alrge enough so as to be more viewable.  Try to get the biggest image you can.  It''s hard to tell if this is in or out of focus. due to its size.</td>', 'If you could save the image with a lower quality you''d still have plenty of detail for on screen viewing and provide an image alrge enough so as to be more viewable.  Try to get the biggest image you can.  It''s hard to tell if this is in or out of focus. due to its size.', '2004-05-14 11:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
