(718107, 75968, 20204, '<td valign="top">Shadow on the lower right, and the image is''t very sharp.  Seems like its a bit underexposed as well.</td>', 'Shadow on the lower right, and the image is''t very sharp.  Seems like its a bit underexposed as well.', '2004-05-14 11:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(718109, 75411, 18374, '<td valign="top">The focus looks soft or blurred.  It kind of hurts my eyes.</td>', 'The focus looks soft or blurred.  It kind of hurts my eyes.', '2004-05-14 11:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(718111, 75474, 18374, '<td valign="top">The lighting looks too harsh for this picture.  The glare on the left part of the wall  around the boots is distracting.  The shadow and bright area of the wall on the lower right tries to pull your attention out of the frame.  This looks to me like Sepia tones were used to try to make an dull picture more interesting, but I don''t think it worked in this case.</td>', 'The lighting looks too harsh for this picture.  The glare on the left part of the wall  around the boots is distracting.  The shadow and bright area of the wall on the lower right tries to pull your attention out of the frame.  This looks to me like Sepia tones were used to try to make an dull picture more interesting, but I don''t think it worked in this case.', '2004-05-14 11:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(718113, 76008, 18374, '<td valign="top">I like this photo from a technical standpoint, but the light seems "off" on it.  Some white balance adjustment might help compensate for the artificial light.</td>', 'I like this photo from a technical standpoint, but the light seems "off" on it.  Some white balance adjustment might help compensate for the artificial light.', '2004-05-14 11:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(718117, 75896, 12448, '<td valign="top">Well, youi do have the dark and light but other than that there is nothing here to hold my interest.  A 3</td>', 'Well, youi do have the dark and light but other than that there is nothing here to hold my interest.  A 3', '2004-05-14 11:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(718118, 75970, 18374, '<td valign="top">There is something about this photo that looks unnatural but I can''t quite place it.  Maybe it is too much brightness/contrast adjustment.  The bright overexposed area on the middle cactus leaf detracts from the overall image.  It looks like a finger or something is darkening/obscuring the frame at the left edge.  It would probably be better if it were cropped out.</td>', 'There is something about this photo that looks unnatural but I can''t quite place it.  Maybe it is too much brightness/contrast adjustment.  The bright overexposed area on the middle cactus leaf detracts from the overall image.  It looks like a finger or something is darkening/obscuring the frame at the left edge.  It would probably be better if it were cropped out.', '2004-05-14 11:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(718120, 76055, 12448, '<td valign="top">Hummmmmm, not really seeing the opposite of the shot, interesting idea though but needs a bit more definition.  The shadows are distracting.  A 3</td>', 'Hummmmmm, not really seeing the opposite of the shot, interesting idea though but needs a bit more definition.  The shadows are distracting.  A 3', '2004-05-14 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(718123, 75970, 12448, '<td valign="top">Not sure I see the opposite in this shot.  If it was actual sand and I could see the water more clearly, maybe it would work better for me.  As is, the  background is distracting and the forground is almost too sharp.  A 3</td>', 'Not sure I see the opposite in this shot.  If it was actual sand and I could see the water more clearly, maybe it would work better for me.  As is, the  background is distracting and the forground is almost too sharp.  A 3', '2004-05-14 11:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(718132, 74631, 21751, '<td valign="top">Classic! I never tire of shots like these... unfortunatly, I think the drum kit markings on this Casio keyboard detract from the overall picture. All in all, though, great shot.</td>', 'Classic! I never tire of shots like these... unfortunatly, I think the drum kit markings on this Casio keyboard detract from the overall picture. All in all, though, great shot.', '2004-05-14 11:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(718148, 75284, 18374, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  The top of the flame looks a little out of focus or blurry.  The lighting on the ice and pan has a strange cast to it that detracts from the photo somewhat.  I like that your ice is an interesting shape and not a "standard" cube that you get out of your ice-maker.</td>', 'Interesting.  The top of the flame looks a little out of focus or blurry.  The lighting on the ice and pan has a strange cast to it that detracts from the photo somewhat.  I like that your ice is an interesting shape and not a "standard" cube that you get out of your ice-maker.', '2004-05-14 12:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(718149, 75761, 21432, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting effect.</td>', 'Nice lighting effect.', '2004-05-14 12:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(718152, 76074, 18374, '<td valign="top">The colors look a little washed out on this.  Nice DOF.  Overall I find the subject of this photo not too interesting.</td>', 'The colors look a little washed out on this.  Nice DOF.  Overall I find the subject of this photo not too interesting.', '2004-05-14 12:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(718153, 75681, 12448, '<td valign="top">Opposition, yes, opposite sides, yes.  The shot has potential but the lighting is too harsh in some areas and muted in others and the front peices are out of focus.  DOF is a good thing at time but for this shot I would really like to see it all in focus.  A 4</td>', 'Opposition, yes, opposite sides, yes.  The shot has potential but the lighting is too harsh in some areas and muted in others and the front peices are out of focus.  DOF is a good thing at time but for this shot I would really like to see it all in focus.  A 4', '2004-05-14 12:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(718155, 75974, 16241, '<td valign="top">nice and bright</td>', 'nice and bright', '2004-05-14 12:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(718156, 75670, 12448, '<td valign="top">They very well could be but no way to really tell in this shot.  Just two sets of tracks, would work great for a parralle line challenge.  Lacks contrast for my personal taste and just not much here to hold my interest overall.  A 3</td>', 'They very well could be but no way to really tell in this shot.  Just two sets of tracks, would work great for a parralle line challenge.  Lacks contrast for my personal taste and just not much here to hold my interest overall.  A 3', '2004-05-14 12:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(718157, 75752, 18374, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred to have some light on the flower in the foreground.</td>', 'I would have preferred to have some light on the flower in the foreground.', '2004-05-14 12:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(718160, 76024, 21432, '<td valign="top">Out of focus</td>', 'Out of focus', '2004-05-14 12:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(718161, 76069, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the background and sharpness.  I''m not crazy about this overall though - doesn''t have quite enough points of interest to make it really stand out for me.</td>', 'I like the background and sharpness.  I''m not crazy about this overall though - doesn''t have quite enough points of interest to make it really stand out for me.', '2004-05-14 12:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(718162, 75147, 18374, '<td valign="top">The bright background and unused space at the upper left detract from this photo.  Good focus and light on the subjects.</td>', 'The bright background and unused space at the upper left detract from this photo.  Good focus and light on the subjects.', '2004-05-14 12:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(718163, 75974, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yes it is, but not really opposites per say, more like opposition.  Slight difference.  I like the way you lighted the cups from within but the harshness is a bit much for my taste.  Also the set up leaves me wanting, the black line on the right is distracting and the cropping seems a bit tight.  A 3</td>', 'Yes it is, but not really opposites per say, more like opposition.  Slight difference.  I like the way you lighted the cups from within but the harshness is a bit much for my taste.  Also the set up leaves me wanting, the black line on the right is distracting and the cropping seems a bit tight.  A 3', '2004-05-14 12:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(718169, 75943, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yes they are, I used to work in a pet store.  Nice looking Guppies and fish can be so hard to capture, I know, I''ve been trying for 4 years.  Not a bad shot overall but the mesh between them is very distracting  and the lack of focus is also distracting.  A 3</td>', 'Yes they are, I used to work in a pet store.  Nice looking Guppies and fish can be so hard to capture, I know, I''ve been trying for 4 years.  Not a bad shot overall but the mesh between them is very distracting  and the lack of focus is also distracting.  A 3', '2004-05-14 12:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(718172, 75683, 20204, '<td valign="top">The draping in the background is distracting, as is the lack of contrast between it and the subject.  That being said, I give you kudos for trying something technically challenging.  It stands out on that merit.</td>', 'The draping in the background is distracting, as is the lack of contrast between it and the subject.  That being said, I give you kudos for trying something technically challenging.  It stands out on that merit.', '2004-05-14 12:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(718173, 75749, 20204, '<td valign="top">Nice background and great capture of the sparks.</td>', 'Nice background and great capture of the sparks.', '2004-05-14 12:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(718174, 75706, 20204, '<td valign="top">Feels washed out...  Lighting perhaps too bright?</td>', 'Feels washed out...  Lighting perhaps too bright?', '2004-05-14 12:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(718175, 75308, 18374, '<td valign="top">The light reflections on the models are a bit distracting.  Interesting composition- you definitely get the impression of opposites.</td>', 'The light reflections on the models are a bit distracting.  Interesting composition- you definitely get the impression of opposites.', '2004-05-14 12:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(718176, 75774, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great contrast and sharpness.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Great contrast and sharpness.  Nice composition.', '2004-05-14 12:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(718179, 75968, 12448, '<td valign="top">Wow, you really put some time into setting this up.  I actually makes my eyes hurt a little to look at it for very long.  You took some real time to cut out the black and white curves and while everything else is perfectly lined up, those two peices seem off because they aren''t touching all the edges of the opposite color and on the bottom curve they are overlapping.  I had to look at this in spurts, it really hurts my eyes, not sure why.  I would say more contrast but that would make it hurt even more.  I like the idea, maybe different lighting would help?  The black is great but the white seems rather dull.  A 3</td>', 'Wow, you really put some time into setting this up.  I actually makes my eyes hurt a little to look at it for very long.  You took some real time to cut out the black and white curves and while everything else is perfectly lined up, those two peices seem off because they aren''t touching all the edges of the opposite color and on the bottom curve they are overlapping.  I had to look at this in spurts, it really hurts my eyes, not sure why.  I would say more contrast but that would make it hurt even more.  I like the idea, maybe different lighting would help?  The black is great but the white seems rather dull.  A 3', '2004-05-14 12:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(718180, 75780, 20204, '<td valign="top">Nice background and lighting.  I''m not sure that purposely having things out of focus works in your favor for a photo comptetition though.</td>', 'Nice background and lighting.  I''m not sure that purposely having things out of focus works in your favor for a photo comptetition though.', '2004-05-14 12:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(718181, 75046, 20494, '<td valign="top">one mean look ;) Great Shot! :)</td>', 'one mean look ;) Great Shot! :)', '2004-05-14 12:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(718182, 75866, 12448, '<td valign="top">Really kind of boring and the hand ends up being very distracting.  A 3</td>', 'Really kind of boring and the hand ends up being very distracting.  A 3', '2004-05-14 12:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(718183, 74746, 20204, '<td valign="top">I would like to see the depth of field emphasize the subject more.  My eyes were drawn past the subject to look at the other details.  The title is humorous though.</td>', 'I would like to see the depth of field emphasize the subject more.  My eyes were drawn past the subject to look at the other details.  The title is humorous though.', '2004-05-14 12:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(718186, 75504, 20204, '<td valign="top">I think I would like to see the glasses more in the center which is odd for me.  Great image technically - well composed, sharpness, lighting, etc.  Nicve work!</td>', 'I think I would like to see the glasses more in the center which is odd for me.  Great image technically - well composed, sharpness, lighting, etc.  Nicve work!', '2004-05-14 12:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(718188, 75955, 12448, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this meets the challenge, don''t really see too much opposites here.  The lighting is dull in this shot and the contrast is just a tad short for my taste.  The dolls could be in sharper focus and maybe if the crop was so that all the hair was included or just on the faces, cutting off at the chins, offering more balance to the shot?  A 3</td>', 'Not sure how this meets the challenge, don''t really see too much opposites here.  The lighting is dull in this shot and the contrast is just a tad short for my taste.  The dolls could be in sharper focus and maybe if the crop was so that all the hair was included or just on the faces, cutting off at the chins, offering more balance to the shot?  A 3', '2004-05-14 12:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(718189, 75331, 18374, '<td valign="top">This photo is very busy.  There are a lot of elements demanding attention, and having two different points of interest at different depths makes it difficult to look at.</td>', 'This photo is very busy.  There are a lot of elements demanding attention, and having two different points of interest at different depths makes it difficult to look at.', '2004-05-14 12:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(718192, 74661, 12448, '<td valign="top">Im guessing you are going with the black/white opposite?  A more posed or head on shot of the cat would score much higher with me.  I love cat shots but this is just a snapshot, nice to look at but nothing to really hold my interest overall.  Also the angle of the shot makes his/her head seem rather large compared to the feet.  A 3</td>', 'Im guessing you are going with the black/white opposite?  A more posed or head on shot of the cat would score much higher with me.  I love cat shots but this is just a snapshot, nice to look at but nothing to really hold my interest overall.  Also the angle of the shot makes his/her head seem rather large compared to the feet.  A 3', '2004-05-14 12:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(718195, 76005, 12448, '<td valign="top">Not really sure how this meets the challenge, maybe if you had included the trees in this world as well to show the opposite reflection?  Not a bad shot but nothing to really hold my interest.  I''m thinking this would look good in black and white or sepia, not sure why, maybe  the different textures and such?  As is, a 3</td>', 'Not really sure how this meets the challenge, maybe if you had included the trees in this world as well to show the opposite reflection?  Not a bad shot but nothing to really hold my interest.  I''m thinking this would look good in black and white or sepia, not sure why, maybe  the different textures and such?  As is, a 3', '2004-05-14 12:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(718197, 75970, 20204, '<td valign="top">Very surreal effect from the water, but it looks like the cactus moved a bit during the long exposure.  This would be an amazing shot if you had a sharper  subject there.  Seems slightly overesposed on the cactus'' edge as well.</td>', 'Very surreal effect from the water, but it looks like the cactus moved a bit during the long exposure.  This would be an amazing shot if you had a sharper  subject there.  Seems slightly overesposed on the cactus'' edge as well.', '2004-05-14 12:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(718199, 75963, 12448, '<td valign="top">The glare on the glass is very distracting, maybe a tighter crop from the bottom?  Also the top part and the foam seems out of focus and it''s not really appearing black and white on my screen, more rust and white.  A 3</td>', 'The glare on the glass is very distracting, maybe a tighter crop from the bottom?  Also the top part and the foam seems out of focus and it''s not really appearing black and white on my screen, more rust and white.  A 3', '2004-05-14 12:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(718200, 75738, 18374, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty ugly subject and idea.  I like the photo technically.  The focus and DOF are very good.  The background color is a good contrast to the rest of the image.  Unfortunately, the photo leaves me with a bad taste in my mouth...</td>', 'This is a pretty ugly subject and idea.  I like the photo technically.  The focus and DOF are very good.  The background color is a good contrast to the rest of the image.  Unfortunately, the photo leaves me with a bad taste in my mouth...', '2004-05-14 12:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(718201, 76114, 20204, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, and great lighting.  Everything is detailed with no glare at all.  Having a clean background works very well also.  It woudl be nice to have more of the frame filled as I think the ice probably has interest in it''s lines and curves what is hidden in the small size.</td>', 'Interesting composition, and great lighting.  Everything is detailed with no glare at all.  Having a clean background works very well also.  It woudl be nice to have more of the frame filled as I think the ice probably has interest in it''s lines and curves what is hidden in the small size.', '2004-05-14 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(718204, 75960, 12448, '<td valign="top">It took me three looks at this shot to figure out the opposite parts.  The lingerie is not very well defined.  At first I thought it was just a lacy hankerchief or doily.  I thought the opposite was the Catholic church thing, you can sin, confess and all is well.  Anyway, the DOF of this shot doesn''t work for me personally, I would like to see more the the opposite side of the cross and see more focus overall.  The white is almost blown out also.  A 3</td>', 'It took me three looks at this shot to figure out the opposite parts.  The lingerie is not very well defined.  At first I thought it was just a lacy hankerchief or doily.  I thought the opposite was the Catholic church thing, you can sin, confess and all is well.  Anyway, the DOF of this shot doesn''t work for me personally, I would like to see more the the opposite side of the cross and see more focus overall.  The white is almost blown out also.  A 3', '2004-05-14 12:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(718205, 75898, 20204, '<td valign="top">Looks slightly out of focus.  Nice job on the background.  The theme is met, but I don''t have enough points of interest.  Maybe too much background and not enough of the subject?</td>', 'Looks slightly out of focus.  Nice job on the background.  The theme is met, but I don''t have enough points of interest.  Maybe too much background and not enough of the subject?', '2004-05-14 12:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(718207, 75049, 20204, '<td valign="top">Busy and grainy.  I can''t find a point of intersest to hold my attention.</td>', 'Busy and grainy.  I can''t find a point of intersest to hold my attention.', '2004-05-14 12:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(718210, 75773, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the pine bough in the foreground.  I think you''ve also used DOF well to keep enough of the subject in focus, yet soften it for emphasis of mood. You obviously put some time into this image - nice work!</td>', 'I like the pine bough in the foreground.  I think you''ve also used DOF well to keep enough of the subject in focus, yet soften it for emphasis of mood. You obviously put some time into this image - nice work!', '2004-05-14 12:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(718212, 75756, 12448, '<td valign="top">Large and small, okay, that works.  he shot has potential but as is, leaves me wanting more clarity and less distractions.  The flowers and grass in the foreground is very distracting and the angle gives the illusion that the size of these are rather small, amost like a miniture golf course size, not sure why.  The sky is dull, nothing much you could do about the overcast sky :(  A 3</td>', 'Large and small, okay, that works.  he shot has potential but as is, leaves me wanting more clarity and less distractions.  The flowers and grass in the foreground is very distracting and the angle gives the illusion that the size of these are rather small, amost like a miniture golf course size, not sure why.  The sky is dull, nothing much you could do about the overcast sky :(  A 3', '2004-05-14 12:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(718213, 75058, 15919, '<td valign="top">Good idea and an ok image.  May lack a litle contrast for my opinon.</td>', 'Good idea and an ok image.  May lack a litle contrast for my opinon.', '2004-05-14 12:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(718215, 75701, 20204, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect, but I find the background distracting.  The placement of the bottles is awkawrd to me as well.  I think you could improve the point of view by getting lower.</td>', 'Interesting effect, but I find the background distracting.  The placement of the bottles is awkawrd to me as well.  I think you could improve the point of view by getting lower.', '2004-05-14 12:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(718216, 74631, 15919, '<td valign="top">The idea is ok but poorly performed.  Think more even lightning would have been better and a closer angel.  Maybe some experimenting with DOF would also have given you a better result.</td>', 'The idea is ok but poorly performed.  Think more even lightning would have been better and a closer angel.  Maybe some experimenting with DOF would also have given you a better result.', '2004-05-14 12:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(718217, 75974, 20204, '<td valign="top">Neat colors and composition.  This has a lot of artictic appeal.</td>', 'Neat colors and composition.  This has a lot of artictic appeal.', '2004-05-14 12:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(718218, 75929, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yeah, you could say lines but the curves is questionable :)  The outfit really hides the curves and the wind blowing on her face is distracting.  A much tighter crop, leaving just her and maybe lining up the poles, coming more from in front of the subject?  Also the lighting is a bit harsh, maybe tone it down a bit in PS?  A 3</td>', 'Yeah, you could say lines but the curves is questionable :)  The outfit really hides the curves and the wind blowing on her face is distracting.  A much tighter crop, leaving just her and maybe lining up the poles, coming more from in front of the subject?  Also the lighting is a bit harsh, maybe tone it down a bit in PS?  A 3', '2004-05-14 12:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(718219, 75770, 20204, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the artistic appeal of this, but I do like the higlighting on the pistol and the overall darkness; It works to creat a fitting mood.</td>', 'I don''t like the artistic appeal of this, but I do like the higlighting on the pistol and the overall darkness; It works to creat a fitting mood.', '2004-05-14 12:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(718220, 76055, 20204, '<td valign="top">This is a bit abstract and unsharp for my liking.  It is creative though.</td>', 'This is a bit abstract and unsharp for my liking.  It is creative though.', '2004-05-14 12:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(718221, 75782, 15919, '<td valign="top">Technically well done, sharp and well focused and nice usage of DOF.  Still I dont find it very eyecaching to be honest, maybe not very creative.  But you are well backed up considering meeting the challenge.</td>', 'Technically well done, sharp and well focused and nice usage of DOF.  Still I dont find it very eyecaching to be honest, maybe not very creative.  But you are well backed up considering meeting the challenge.', '2004-05-14 12:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(718223, 75969, 12448, '<td valign="top">Not really sure what the opposite is here.  The post processing, if that is what caused the effect, really hurt this shot for me.  It''s blown out and the rug or material under the dish doesn''t really come off as sand to me. The cropping seems a bit tight, maybe line up the fork and knife so they cross and crop the ends at the corners?  A 3</td>', 'Not really sure what the opposite is here.  The post processing, if that is what caused the effect, really hurt this shot for me.  It''s blown out and the rug or material under the dish doesn''t really come off as sand to me. The cropping seems a bit tight, maybe line up the fork and knife so they cross and crop the ends at the corners?  A 3', '2004-05-14 12:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(718224, 75245, 20204, '<td valign="top">Interesting image - the lighting makes it, and I like the subtle texture in the dark region.</td>', 'Interesting image - the lighting makes it, and I like the subtle texture in the dark region.', '2004-05-14 12:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(718227, 75681, 20204, '<td valign="top">Lighting and background is very distracting.  The subject is not emphasized well.</td>', 'Lighting and background is very distracting.  The subject is not emphasized well.', '2004-05-14 12:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(718228, 75284, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting, and the flame is well exposed.</td>', 'I like the lighting, and the flame is well exposed.', '2004-05-14 12:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(718230, 75052, 20204, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see more sharpness in the pier, but I think the image is a baeutiful landscap, and the sky blends well with the sea.</td>', 'I''d like to see more sharpness in the pier, but I think the image is a baeutiful landscap, and the sky blends well with the sea.', '2004-05-14 12:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(718232, 75203, 12448, '<td valign="top">The left side looks like my room, LOL but all around the room!<br/> <br/>The shot isn''t bad overall but the it leaves me off for some reason.  I think it''s because the left side isn''t quite even with the right,  the cropping seems off also, the lamp got cut off on the left but is whole on the right.  Also the lighting is harsh on the right and too dark on the right and there seems to be some noise on the right side.  A 3</td>', 'The left side looks like my room, LOL but all around the room! The shot isn''t bad overall but the it leaves me off for some reason.  I think it''s because the left side isn''t quite even with the right,  the cropping seems off also, the lamp got cut off on the left but is whole on the right.  Also the lighting is harsh on the right and too dark on the right and there seems to be some noise on the right side.  A 3', '2004-05-14 12:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(718234, 75699, 15919, '<td valign="top">Macro, macro, macro.  Though shallow DOF is good for this purpose I think it´s overdone here.</td>', 'Macro, macro, macro.  Though shallow DOF is good for this purpose I think it´s overdone here.', '2004-05-14 12:41:24.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(718236, 74588, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great rich blue color in the sky, and I like the simplicity of the image.  The towers add interest without cluttering.  There''s something about the clouds that isn''t working for me though - sorry I can''t put my finger on it exactly, but its almost as if they are too blurry.  I know, clouds are naturally blurry :)</td>', 'Great rich blue color in the sky, and I like the simplicity of the image.  The towers add interest without cluttering.  There''s something about the clouds that isn''t working for me though - sorry I can''t put my finger on it exactly, but its almost as if they are too blurry.  I know, clouds are naturally blurry :)', '2004-05-14 12:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(718238, 75952, 20204, '<td valign="top">This image doesn''t appeal to me artistically, but it is well composed.</td>', 'This image doesn''t appeal to me artistically, but it is well composed.', '2004-05-14 12:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(718239, 75151, 12448, '<td valign="top">This would have been great for the proportion challenge!  Not sure quite how it fits the opposite challenge though.  Not a bad shot but the picture just doesn''t really pop for me, the colors seem a bit dull and the cropping seems a bit loose.  A 3</td>', 'This would have been great for the proportion challenge!  Not sure quite how it fits the opposite challenge though.  Not a bad shot but the picture just doesn''t really pop for me, the colors seem a bit dull and the cropping seems a bit loose.  A 3', '2004-05-14 12:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(718240, 76069, 20494, '<td valign="top">PEACEEEEEEEE!!!!!! ;)</td>', 'PEACEEEEEEEE!!!!!! ;)', '2004-05-14 12:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(718241, 75474, 20204, '<td valign="top">Bear is out of focus and boots are underexposed.</td>', 'Bear is out of focus and boots are underexposed.', '2004-05-14 12:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(718244, 75284, 12448, '<td valign="top">Not bad but, (don''t you just hate those buts) the cropping seems a bit loose to me and the melting water on the tray or plate is a bit distracting.  I know the ice melts as it gets hot but maybe if you had someone helping you and wiping up the water as you go?  The coloration overall seems off to, not sure why.  A 3</td>', 'Not bad but, (don''t you just hate those buts) the cropping seems a bit loose to me and the melting water on the tray or plate is a bit distracting.  I know the ice melts as it gets hot but maybe if you had someone helping you and wiping up the water as you go?  The coloration overall seems off to, not sure why.  A 3', '2004-05-14 12:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(718245, 75644, 20204, '<td valign="top">Overexposed in the foreground, and not quite enough light on the match / candle to bring it out.</td>', 'Overexposed in the foreground, and not quite enough light on the match / candle to bring it out.', '2004-05-14 12:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(718246, 75932, 20204, '<td valign="top">Very creative!  I wish the streams on the left weren''t as blurred together.  I really like this !</td>', 'Very creative!  I wish the streams on the left weren''t as blurred together.  I really like this !', '2004-05-14 12:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(718247, 76016, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the depth of field and lighting.  Detail is great.  Something feels odd about that wedge shaped light between the two leftmost buildings, but a nice image.</td>', 'I like the depth of field and lighting.  Detail is great.  Something feels odd about that wedge shaped light between the two leftmost buildings, but a nice image.', '2004-05-14 12:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(718248, 75818, 20204, '<td valign="top">This is completely out of focus.</td>', 'This is completely out of focus.', '2004-05-14 12:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(718249, 76032, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice "centred" shot that also works well for this challenge..the colour contrast adds to the overall feel of the image. You may have had criticism for your shallow DOF putting the weeds being out of focus??.. (as they are part of the subject)..but no such criticism from me.. it doesn`t spoil my enjoyment of this excellent image</td>', 'Nice "centred" shot that also works well for this challenge..the colour contrast adds to the overall feel of the image. You may have had criticism for your shallow DOF putting the weeds being out of focus??.. (as they are part of the subject)..but no such criticism from me.. it doesn`t spoil my enjoyment of this excellent image', '2004-05-14 12:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(718250, 76089, 12448, '<td valign="top">Okay, just what are these two hiding behind that newspaper and afgan? :)  Not sure how the title helps this fit the challenge, I would have thought man/woman as the opposite.  The paper and afgan are very distracting and the lighting seems a bit harsh.  A 3</td>', 'Okay, just what are these two hiding behind that newspaper and afgan? :)  Not sure how the title helps this fit the challenge, I would have thought man/woman as the opposite.  The paper and afgan are very distracting and the lighting seems a bit harsh.  A 3', '2004-05-14 12:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(718251, 75955, 20204, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I see the opposites in this image, but its interesting to look at.</td>', 'I''m not sure I see the opposites in this image, but its interesting to look at.', '2004-05-14 12:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(718253, 75782, 20204, '<td valign="top">I think this needs to be cropped more tightly.  The foreground competes with the subjects for my attention due to the reflections.</td>', 'I think this needs to be cropped more tightly.  The foreground competes with the subjects for my attention due to the reflections.', '2004-05-14 12:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(718255, 75940, 12448, '<td valign="top">I think this would work much better if it wasn''t a reflection, the colors get lost and the bricks under the water are really distracting.  The building looks interesting all on it''s own. :)  A 3</td>', 'I think this would work much better if it wasn''t a reflection, the colors get lost and the bricks under the water are really distracting.  The building looks interesting all on it''s own. :)  A 3', '2004-05-14 12:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(718257, 75948, 20204, '<td valign="top">This feels like it needs more lighting and sharpness to bring out the interest in the pieces of glass.  It is nicely composed and cropped.</td>', 'This feels like it needs more lighting and sharpness to bring out the interest in the pieces of glass.  It is nicely composed and cropped.', '2004-05-14 12:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(718258, 75522, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge..no argument about whether this meets the challenge or not.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge..no argument about whether this meets the challenge or not.', '2004-05-14 12:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(718259, 74641, 20204, '<td valign="top">I''m not seeing the poosites aspect in this image.  There also isn''t enough red to offset the overpowering green.   The background competes for my eye with the subject.</td>', 'I''m not seeing the poosites aspect in this image.  There also isn''t enough red to offset the overpowering green.   The background competes for my eye with the subject.', '2004-05-14 12:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(718260, 75747, 20204, '<td valign="top">Very cool image!  I like the composition and lighting.  Looks like the filament drops in and out of focus so it might need adjustment to depth of field.</td>', 'Very cool image!  I like the composition and lighting.  Looks like the filament drops in and out of focus so it might need adjustment to depth of field.', '2004-05-14 12:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(718261, 75924, 12448, '<td valign="top">Gotta love government indecision ;)<br/> <br/>Good idea but the shot leaves me wanting more contrast and lighting and maybe a different angle, maybe from the side and from above if possible?  Play with the colors just a bit to make the yellow really pop?  A 3 as is</td>', 'Gotta love government indecision ;) Good idea but the shot leaves me wanting more contrast and lighting and maybe a different angle, maybe from the side and from above if possible?  Play with the colors just a bit to make the yellow really pop?  A 3 as is', '2004-05-14 12:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(718262, 75601, 20204, '<td valign="top">This is st6retching the opposites theme.  From a technical perespective there isn''t enough contrast between subjects and background to really make it interesting either.</td>', 'This is st6retching the opposites theme.  From a technical perespective there isn''t enough contrast between subjects and background to really make it interesting either.', '2004-05-14 12:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(718264, 74981, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot of a closed bud but the open flower in the background ends up being a distraction to me rather than part of the shot.  Maybe if you could have had them both in focus, DOF just doesn''t work in this shot for me personally.  A 3 to start but will bump to a 5 since the bud is so well done. :)</td>', 'This is a great shot of a closed bud but the open flower in the background ends up being a distraction to me rather than part of the shot.  Maybe if you could have had them both in focus, DOF just doesn''t work in this shot for me personally.  A 3 to start but will bump to a 5 since the bud is so well done. :)', '2004-05-14 12:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(718265, 75411, 20204, '<td valign="top">A bit too blurry for me.</td>', 'A bit too blurry for me.', '2004-05-14 12:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(718268, 75993, 20204, '<td valign="top">This conveys opposites well - thanks for paying attention to the challenge theme!  Great focus and above all, a photo that is pleasant to look at.  I''m biased as a dog lover, but still looks like a great image to me!  Feels like it might be a bit heavy on the right.  Either a tighter crop on the left, or a lot more room on the left would help this.</td>', 'This conveys opposites well - thanks for paying attention to the challenge theme!  Great focus and above all, a photo that is pleasant to look at.  I''m biased as a dog lover, but still looks like a great image to me!  Feels like it might be a bit heavy on the right.  Either a tighter crop on the left, or a lot more room on the left would help this.', '2004-05-14 12:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(718269, 74744, 20204, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but not enough sharpness in the ice to really make it obvious as a subject.</td>', 'Interesting, but not enough sharpness in the ice to really make it obvious as a subject.', '2004-05-14 12:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(718270, 76105, 14603, '<td valign="top">Well captured...the plain sandy background (Beach?) keeps distractions to the minimum and the shadows add an extra dimension.Would have scored a 10 with me if the image had included all of the larger dog.<br/>Good work..9</td>', 'Well captured...the plain sandy background (Beach?) keeps distractions to the minimum and the shadows add an extra dimension.Would have scored a 10 with me if the image had included all of the larger dog.Good work..9', '2004-05-14 12:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
