(718752, 75104, 18374, '<td valign="top">This is a good picture technically.  I like the lighting and the DOF.  I don''t understand what is opposite about the elements in it, though.  To me the picture needs something to add some life or soul to it.  It feels very cold and clinical.  Perhaps that was the intended effect.</td>', 'This is a good picture technically.  I like the lighting and the DOF.  I don''t understand what is opposite about the elements in it, though.  To me the picture needs something to add some life or soul to it.  It feels very cold and clinical.  Perhaps that was the intended effect.', '2004-05-14 17:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(718754, 75015, 20204, '<td valign="top">I''m not picking up the relationship between the b/w and the apples oranges.  I''m also not seeing the role played by the nail.  I think I''d try to pick a single theme here so the image could make a stronger statement.</td>', 'I''m not picking up the relationship between the b/w and the apples oranges.  I''m also not seeing the role played by the nail.  I think I''d try to pick a single theme here so the image could make a stronger statement.', '2004-05-14 17:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
