(718761, 75520, 20204, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see the image cropped a bit more at the top as I think the heavy trees detract from the subjects which hold pletny of interest on their own.  You''ve definitely captured the right moment - just needs a little work.</td>', 'I''d like to see the image cropped a bit more at the top as I think the heavy trees detract from the subjects which hold pletny of interest on their own.  You''ve definitely captured the right moment - just needs a little work.', '2004-05-14 17:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
