(718766, 76107, 18374, '<td valign="top">I think the contrast between the bright parts and the dark parts of this picture are too great.  Perhaps the light will be a bit softer when it is filtered through the trees a few minutes later (assuming this is sunset).  Alternatively, some fill flash might help brighten the monuments.</td>', 'I think the contrast between the bright parts and the dark parts of this picture are too great.  Perhaps the light will be a bit softer when it is filtered through the trees a few minutes later (assuming this is sunset).  Alternatively, some fill flash might help brighten the monuments.', '2004-05-14 17:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
