(718786, 76044, 20204, '<td valign="top">Looks to be tilted 2 degrees clockwise and would benefit from tighter cropping to get rid of the distracting cars.  Not sure what could be done about the sign post, but it''s also out of place here.</td>', 'Looks to be tilted 2 degrees clockwise and would benefit from tighter cropping to get rid of the distracting cars.  Not sure what could be done about the sign post, but it''s also out of place here.', '2004-05-14 17:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
