(718790, 74920, 18374, '<td valign="top">The lights in this image, aside from the moon, aren''t defined well enough to be interesting.  A shot zoomed in on the moon through the leaves might have made for a better entry.</td>', 'The lights in this image, aside from the moon, aren''t defined well enough to be interesting.  A shot zoomed in on the moon through the leaves might have made for a better entry.', '2004-05-14 17:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
