(718804, 76112, 21761, '<td valign="top">The "opposites" concept is obvious - that''s good.  I don''t understand why the set in the background is included given that the set in the foreground is in better focus and conveys the same message.  Perhaps you might have extend the series (include more battery pairs) or reduced it to a single set.</td>', 'The "opposites" concept is obvious - that''s good.  I don''t understand why the set in the background is included given that the set in the foreground is in better focus and conveys the same message.  Perhaps you might have extend the series (include more battery pairs) or reduced it to a single set.', '2004-05-14 17:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(718806, 74920, 20204, '<td valign="top">A bit longer exposure might have silkhouetted the foreground leaves better.  Overasll this whole image feel underexposed.</td>', 'A bit longer exposure might have silkhouetted the foreground leaves better.  Overasll this whole image feel underexposed.', '2004-05-14 17:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(718808, 75474, 19322, '<td valign="top">Trying too hard.  Lack of color plus forced arrangement makes for low interest</td>', 'Trying too hard.  Lack of color plus forced arrangement makes for low interest', '2004-05-14 17:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(718809, 75699, 20204, '<td valign="top">If the spider were in focus this would be incredible.</td>', 'If the spider were in focus this would be incredible.', '2004-05-14 17:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
