(718817, 74732, 21761, '<td valign="top">Black vs. white and war vs. peace - contrasting tones and symbols working together - that''s good.  Image appears very grainy - I think the contrast apparent in your background detracts from the contrast you''ve established between your two objects.</td>', 'Black vs. white and war vs. peace - contrasting tones and symbols working together - that''s good.  Image appears very grainy - I think the contrast apparent in your background detracts from the contrast you''ve established between your two objects.', '2004-05-14 17:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(718821, 75898, 18374, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and focus.  Very clean picture.  I might have preferred a tighter crop on the subjects and a more square frame.</td>', 'Nice lighting and focus.  Very clean picture.  I might have preferred a tighter crop on the subjects and a more square frame.', '2004-05-14 17:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(718823, 75805, 19322, '<td valign="top">Abn "opportunity shot," suffers from loss of detail in black dog''s face.  Plain grass background doesn''t give enough context.</td>', 'Abn "opportunity shot," suffers from loss of detail in black dog''s face.  Plain grass background doesn''t give enough context.', '2004-05-14 17:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(718825, 75154, 19322, '<td valign="top">Lighting too flat to create interest</td>', 'Lighting too flat to create interest', '2004-05-14 17:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(718826, 75863, 21761, '<td valign="top">Good detail - I like how the third animal is staring right at me.  Not sure your title captures "opposite" however.  Sitting and standing are different kinds of "stationary", while crawling is a kind of "motion."  So yeah, there''s a couple of individual opposites working here, but the picture as a whole doesn''t convey a single message.</td>', 'Good detail - I like how the third animal is staring right at me.  Not sure your title captures "opposite" however.  Sitting and standing are different kinds of "stationary", while crawling is a kind of "motion."  So yeah, there''s a couple of individual opposites working here, but the picture as a whole doesn''t convey a single message.', '2004-05-14 17:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(718828, 75104, 20204, '<td valign="top">Cool composition, but the overexposed spots are a bit distracting.</td>', 'Cool composition, but the overexposed spots are a bit distracting.', '2004-05-14 17:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
