(718862, 76060, 21761, '<td valign="top">a) On vs. off.  b) Figure in focus vs. ground that''s not.  So, two opposites are apparent - yet neither cue is working to support/contrast the other.</td>', 'a) On vs. off.  b) Figure in focus vs. ground that''s not.  So, two opposites are apparent - yet neither cue is working to support/contrast the other.', '2004-05-14 18:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
