(718958, 75245, 20822, '<td valign="top">My photo has a ballon in it and I''m getting hammered. I like this better than mine.</td>', 'My photo has a ballon in it and I''m getting hammered. I like this better than mine.', '2004-05-14 19:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(718964, 76087, 12962, '<td valign="top">Nice concept!  Lighting on the dome is also very nice.</td>', 'Nice concept!  Lighting on the dome is also very nice.', '2004-05-14 19:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(718966, 75960, 12962, '<td valign="top">A good concept ... shallow DOF doesn''t work that much here though.  Perhaps it might look better (to me) if the DOF were wider.  Compositionally, the diagonals work well but the white space on the left is a little bit bigger for my taste  - I do like negative space but has it has no purpose here.  But that is just my opinion, you can disregard it.</td>', 'A good concept ... shallow DOF doesn''t work that much here though.  Perhaps it might look better (to me) if the DOF were wider.  Compositionally, the diagonals work well but the white space on the left is a little bit bigger for my taste  - I do like negative space but has it has no purpose here.  But that is just my opinion, you can disregard it.', '2004-05-14 19:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(718977, 76102, 16148, '<td valign="top">Nice job!  I like the bright background behind the yellow flower and dark behind the dying.  This adds more impact to your image.</td>', 'Nice job!  I like the bright background behind the yellow flower and dark behind the dying.  This adds more impact to your image.', '2004-05-14 19:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(718983, 75744, 19608, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite in this challenge.  Very serene and peaceful.</td>', 'One of my favorite in this challenge.  Very serene and peaceful.', '2004-05-14 19:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(718990, 75321, 19608, '<td valign="top">SUPER great!  Perfectly planned and executed composition.  The  one thing I don''t get is the lighting - how can the black sugar cubes have a shadow - showing light coming from the left - but the black cup doesn''t?  That is NOT a bad comment - just a question/observation.  Bottom line - I expect you will be heading for ribbonville.</td>', 'SUPER great!  Perfectly planned and executed composition.  The  one thing I don''t get is the lighting - how can the black sugar cubes have a shadow - showing light coming from the left - but the black cup doesn''t?  That is NOT a bad comment - just a question/observation.  Bottom line - I expect you will be heading for ribbonville.', '2004-05-14 19:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(718997, 75761, 19608, '<td valign="top">Exceptional one of several that did the half full or full empty theme.  Of all of them, this is my top choice. Wonderful lighting - super choice of colors.</td>', 'Exceptional one of several that did the half full or full empty theme.  Of all of them, this is my top choice. Wonderful lighting - super choice of colors.', '2004-05-14 19:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(719000, 75749, 19608, '<td valign="top">Yep - looks like you fond some opposites for sure!  Nice technique - composition - colors.  I have nothing to suggest what you could have done to make it better.</td>', 'Yep - looks like you fond some opposites for sure!  Nice technique - composition - colors.  I have nothing to suggest what you could have done to make it better.', '2004-05-14 19:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
