(719012, 75477, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very ORIGINAL idea!   I''m sure you gave a few folks a chuckle.  Photographically - it''s a pleasing image, but not really "exciting."  Overall - a strong entry.</td>', 'A very ORIGINAL idea!   I''m sure you gave a few folks a chuckle.  Photographically - it''s a pleasing image, but not really "exciting."  Overall - a strong entry.', '2004-05-14 19:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(719015, 75892, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellnt diagonal composition.  I like the lighting with one small caveat:  there should be a bit more light on the screw''s head.  Over all it''s one of the strongest entries.  To me, the border is a bit heavy - but that''s not a point off or anything.</td>', 'Excellnt diagonal composition.  I like the lighting with one small caveat:  there should be a bit more light on the screw''s head.  Over all it''s one of the strongest entries.  To me, the border is a bit heavy - but that''s not a point off or anything.', '2004-05-14 19:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(719024, 75844, 259, '<td valign="top">best picture this week</td>', 'best picture this week', '2004-05-14 20:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(719036, 76004, 16148, '<td valign="top">This is very funny!  I like your composition too.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is very funny!  I like your composition too.  Good luck!', '2004-05-14 20:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(719064, 75892, 18349, '<td valign="top">I see where you are going/where you are coming from with this one.   It''s a great picture; love the background, the composition, and the framing.  I don''t really consider a screwdriver and a screw as opposites, although the blade edge and the phillips screw head might be considered as such.  Since I''m not sure, I won''t figure that into my rating.  It''s a great shot anyway.  :o)</td>', 'I see where you are going/where you are coming from with this one.   It''s a great picture; love the background, the composition, and the framing.  I don''t really consider a screwdriver and a screw as opposites, although the blade edge and the phillips screw head might be considered as such.  Since I''m not sure, I won''t figure that into my rating.  It''s a great shot anyway.  :o)', '2004-05-14 20:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(719067, 75907, 3697, '<td valign="top">This is definately the best interpretation of "fire and ice" I have seen this week. Great lighting and perfect focus. Nice work.</td>', 'This is definately the best interpretation of "fire and ice" I have seen this week. Great lighting and perfect focus. Nice work.', '2004-05-14 20:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(719091, 75437, 12252, '<td valign="top">Very good picture, but you''re beating us over the head with the title. We get it. Anyway, nicely done picture.</td>', 'Very good picture, but you''re beating us over the head with the title. We get it. Anyway, nicely done picture.', '2004-05-14 21:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(719094, 75863, 12252, '<td valign="top">I don''t know, these aren''t really what I think of as opposites! But the picture is adorable, and giving you the benefit of the doubt for the challenge. You might have considered cropping a bit closer to these subjects.</td>', 'I don''t know, these aren''t really what I think of as opposites! But the picture is adorable, and giving you the benefit of the doubt for the challenge. You might have considered cropping a bit closer to these subjects.', '2004-05-14 21:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(719096, 74696, 12252, '<td valign="top">GET OUT OF THERE NOW! Probably too late. &lt;sigh&gt; Meets the challenge and I like how you have the individual strands of the web captured. Poor fly!</td>', 'GET OUT OF THERE NOW! Probably too late. <sigh> Meets the challenge and I like how you have the individual strands of the web captured. Poor fly!', '2004-05-14 21:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(719098, 75046, 12252, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful picture but without the title, I don''t see it meeting the challenge. I mean, I don''t think B&amp;W the moment I see it. I think TIGER. Or Blue Eyes. That said, it does meet the challenge I guess, given the title. The picture itself is terrific. I just can''t see a magazine editor choosing it to illustrate OPPOSITES. I like the DOF</td>', 'This is a wonderful picture but without the title, I don''t see it meeting the challenge. I mean, I don''t think B&W the moment I see it. I think TIGER. Or Blue Eyes. That said, it does meet the challenge I guess, given the title. The picture itself is terrific. I just can''t see a magazine editor choosing it to illustrate OPPOSITES. I like the DOF', '2004-05-14 21:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(719101, 75401, 12252, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors, meets the challenge, but I wish the DOF was better on the New dandelion.</td>', 'Pretty colors, meets the challenge, but I wish the DOF was better on the New dandelion.', '2004-05-14 21:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(719103, 75744, 12252, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit, well composed. The exterior is blown out and that''s a minor distraction. Meets the challenge. Might have had something on the puter screen (a cross?) for a bit more punch. 6</td>', 'Nicely lit, well composed. The exterior is blown out and that''s a minor distraction. Meets the challenge. Might have had something on the puter screen (a cross?) for a bit more punch. 6', '2004-05-14 21:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(719105, 75976, 12252, '<td valign="top">A fresh take on the chess set. I like the water drops, think I know how you did it, and hope you didn''t put n/a in the photographer''s box. Meets the challenge. Your border maybe just a skosh thick.</td>', 'A fresh take on the chess set. I like the water drops, think I know how you did it, and hope you didn''t put n/a in the photographer''s box. Meets the challenge. Your border maybe just a skosh thick.', '2004-05-14 21:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(719108, 75749, 12252, '<td valign="top">Looks to me like a tough shot to set up, so that means it''s probably pretty simple, lol. In any event, you''ve met the challenge very nicely. Good action, colors, background. Would have had even more "pop" if there was a hand holding the red handles. Ouch!</td>', 'Looks to me like a tough shot to set up, so that means it''s probably pretty simple, lol. In any event, you''ve met the challenge very nicely. Good action, colors, background. Would have had even more "pop" if there was a hand holding the red handles. Ouch!', '2004-05-14 21:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(719109, 75659, 21061, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and great work finding the subject. I find that the photo of the subject is too dark against the lighter background. Maybe try a different angle</td>', 'I like the idea and great work finding the subject. I find that the photo of the subject is too dark against the lighter background. Maybe try a different angle', '2004-05-14 21:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(719111, 75676, 21061, '<td valign="top">Love the idea! Background subject is too far out of focus. I would have tried a higher f-stop.</td>', 'Love the idea! Background subject is too far out of focus. I would have tried a higher f-stop.', '2004-05-14 21:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(719113, 75827, 12252, '<td valign="top">This is a cute photo. I like the negative space, the repetition of the Budweiser crates, and the position of the dog. That said, it''s a bit of a stretch to think of this as a photo to illustrate OPPOSITES, although the title conveys the point. It''s a good capture, and I gave you a six, but I wouldn''t chose this picture to illustrate a story on OPPOSITES. 6</td>', 'This is a cute photo. I like the negative space, the repetition of the Budweiser crates, and the position of the dog. That said, it''s a bit of a stretch to think of this as a photo to illustrate OPPOSITES, although the title conveys the point. It''s a good capture, and I gave you a six, but I wouldn''t chose this picture to illustrate a story on OPPOSITES. 6', '2004-05-14 21:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(719115, 75770, 21061, '<td valign="top">I like what you are trying to portrai but the image contains too much shadow.</td>', 'I like what you are trying to portrai but the image contains too much shadow.', '2004-05-14 21:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(719117, 74604, 21061, '<td valign="top">very amusing. well done.</td>', 'very amusing. well done.', '2004-05-14 21:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(719118, 74994, 12252, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, but otherwise rather boring picture. Sorry! Way too much negative space and there''s no story here that I can see. Just front and back of a coin.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, but otherwise rather boring picture. Sorry! Way too much negative space and there''s no story here that I can see. Just front and back of a coin.', '2004-05-14 21:34:29.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(719119, 76009, 21061, '<td valign="top">I won''t be complaining about my backyard any more!</td>', 'I won''t be complaining about my backyard any more!', '2004-05-14 21:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(719120, 75904, 21061, '<td valign="top">original idea, well executed. I like the inclusion of the blue bottle.</td>', 'original idea, well executed. I like the inclusion of the blue bottle.', '2004-05-14 21:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(719121, 75477, 12252, '<td valign="top">I like this idea, and it meets the challenge nicely and creatively. I think the picture would be improved if the sides of the game board formed the edges of the picture (no table showing). You''d have to shoot straight down on the game board. I also think it would have been better in color to take advantage of those colored squares.</td>', 'I like this idea, and it meets the challenge nicely and creatively. I think the picture would be improved if the sides of the game board formed the edges of the picture (no table showing). You''d have to shoot straight down on the game board. I also think it would have been better in color to take advantage of those colored squares.', '2004-05-14 21:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(719122, 75993, 12252, '<td valign="top">I love this picture because of the little dog especially, but I''m not seeing any obvious Opposites. Sure, I can find things that are opposite (big dog, little dog) but the picture doesn''t say OPPOSITE first, and foremost. Cute shot though.</td>', 'I love this picture because of the little dog especially, but I''m not seeing any obvious Opposites. Sure, I can find things that are opposite (big dog, little dog) but the picture doesn''t say OPPOSITE first, and foremost. Cute shot though.', '2004-05-14 21:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(719123, 75749, 21061, '<td valign="top">very well captured! my favourite for the challenge. good luck.</td>', 'very well captured! my favourite for the challenge. good luck.', '2004-05-14 21:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(719126, 75015, 12252, '<td valign="top">First of all, i don''t get your title. If the b&amp;w has to do with the tray and background, okay, I guess I get it. Second, i don''t think apples and oranges represent opposites so much as they represent things that are different (and often not comparable). So I don''t think you met the challenge. That said, putting the apple skin over the orange is quite clever.</td>', 'First of all, i don''t get your title. If the b&w has to do with the tray and background, okay, I guess I get it. Second, i don''t think apples and oranges represent opposites so much as they represent things that are different (and often not comparable). So I don''t think you met the challenge. That said, putting the apple skin over the orange is quite clever.', '2004-05-14 21:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(719127, 75976, 21061, '<td valign="top">I like the water effect.</td>', 'I like the water effect.', '2004-05-14 21:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(719128, 75986, 12252, '<td valign="top">Why the question mark in the title? This shot doesn''t hold much interest. The colors are so-so, the lines appear out of focus, and the cropping is a bit awkward (especially at the top left and right corner). Might try a top down picture to eliminate the underside of each piece.</td>', 'Why the question mark in the title? This shot doesn''t hold much interest. The colors are so-so, the lines appear out of focus, and the cropping is a bit awkward (especially at the top left and right corner). Might try a top down picture to eliminate the underside of each piece.', '2004-05-14 21:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(719130, 75973, 12252, '<td valign="top">I had this idea as well, and didn''t do it, for the same reason that your picture runs into problems -- how does one make white grains of sugar interesting? The table top background is not helping, and the composition of the lemon and sugar isn''t particularly engaging. Yes, the picture meets the challenge but aside from that, there''s not much going on here to reward the eye.</td>', 'I had this idea as well, and didn''t do it, for the same reason that your picture runs into problems -- how does one make white grains of sugar interesting? The table top background is not helping, and the composition of the lemon and sugar isn''t particularly engaging. Yes, the picture meets the challenge but aside from that, there''s not much going on here to reward the eye.', '2004-05-14 21:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(719132, 75275, 12252, '<td valign="top">Personally I think Fire and Ice is hard to pull off. Lots of people tried in this contest, and most fell short. Your "fire" is overblown, and your "ice" is rather oddly shaped, in terms of composition. Plus, you have blue artifacts on the right hand side of the shot.</td>', 'Personally I think Fire and Ice is hard to pull off. Lots of people tried in this contest, and most fell short. Your "fire" is overblown, and your "ice" is rather oddly shaped, in terms of composition. Plus, you have blue artifacts on the right hand side of the shot.', '2004-05-14 21:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(719133, 74599, 12252, '<td valign="top">Out of focus, very distracting background, non-compelling subjects.</td>', 'Out of focus, very distracting background, non-compelling subjects.', '2004-05-14 21:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(719135, 75928, 12252, '<td valign="top">I''m not understanding this image. Melting ice? ice and steam? Solid ice and water drops? Anyway, the monochromatic scheme isn''t giving your picture any life. The image doesn''t convey OPPOSITES to me, except with a stretch.</td>', 'I''m not understanding this image. Melting ice? ice and steam? Solid ice and water drops? Anyway, the monochromatic scheme isn''t giving your picture any life. The image doesn''t convey OPPOSITES to me, except with a stretch.', '2004-05-14 21:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(719137, 74920, 12252, '<td valign="top">This is conveying Opposites, how? What I see is a picture that doesn''t give my eye somewhere to rest; there are three competing spots of light that don''t seem related to one another. The moon part with the branches is actually rather interesting, but it gets lost in the larger picture.</td>', 'This is conveying Opposites, how? What I see is a picture that doesn''t give my eye somewhere to rest; there are three competing spots of light that don''t seem related to one another. The moon part with the branches is actually rather interesting, but it gets lost in the larger picture.', '2004-05-14 21:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(719140, 75572, 12252, '<td valign="top">Terrible focus! Even if that were fixed, the image is static. Chessmen lined up on a chessboard. What''s different about YOUR perspective? Try different angles, get the thing focused, work on better lighting, move some of the pieces around, and you''ll have something interesting.</td>', 'Terrible focus! Even if that were fixed, the image is static. Chessmen lined up on a chessboard. What''s different about YOUR perspective? Try different angles, get the thing focused, work on better lighting, move some of the pieces around, and you''ll have something interesting.', '2004-05-14 21:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(719142, 75943, 12252, '<td valign="top">Not sure what I''m looking at here, except I realize it''s fish. Male and female guppy? That must be it. The idea isn''t bad (the male is always so colorful compared to the female) but in this picture, you have them separated too far, and that mesh thing isn''t adding anything to your picture. Fish are hard to photograph; keep trying! ;-)</td>', 'Not sure what I''m looking at here, except I realize it''s fish. Male and female guppy? That must be it. The idea isn''t bad (the male is always so colorful compared to the female) but in this picture, you have them separated too far, and that mesh thing isn''t adding anything to your picture. Fish are hard to photograph; keep trying! ;-)', '2004-05-14 21:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(719143, 76060, 20779, '<td valign="top">What a great idea and so simple as the title says. Perfectly set-up in my opinion.</td>', 'What a great idea and so simple as the title says. Perfectly set-up in my opinion.', '2004-05-14 21:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(719147, 75414, 12252, '<td valign="top">The ice is what falls short on this image. It''s too gray, too boring (obviously just taken from the ice maker), and too confined in the galss. Black background works, but the ice, which is most of the subject, isn''t compelling. There''s no mystery here. Either you have a candle behind the glass, or in the glass surrounded by ice cubes. Try to think of another angle or perspective!</td>', 'The ice is what falls short on this image. It''s too gray, too boring (obviously just taken from the ice maker), and too confined in the galss. Black background works, but the ice, which is most of the subject, isn''t compelling. There''s no mystery here. Either you have a candle behind the glass, or in the glass surrounded by ice cubes. Try to think of another angle or perspective!', '2004-05-14 21:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(719151, 75839, 12252, '<td valign="top">Like so many of the Fire and Ice entries, this falls short of being compelling. There''s no drama here, nothing to make the viewer wonder WHY there is Fire and Ice together. The image is rather flat, the flame just so-so, and the ice bland. Tough subject to do well -- that''s why I stayed away from it! lol</td>', 'Like so many of the Fire and Ice entries, this falls short of being compelling. There''s no drama here, nothing to make the viewer wonder WHY there is Fire and Ice together. The image is rather flat, the flame just so-so, and the ice bland. Tough subject to do well -- that''s why I stayed away from it! lol', '2004-05-14 21:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(719152, 75780, 20779, '<td valign="top">Pretty clean shot, but would maybe "pop" more with a cleaner white? I don''t think of these as opposites, but I guess they could be. I like the simplicity, also, but would like a little stronger interest.</td>', 'Pretty clean shot, but would maybe "pop" more with a cleaner white? I don''t think of these as opposites, but I guess they could be. I like the simplicity, also, but would like a little stronger interest.', '2004-05-14 21:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(719154, 76094, 12252, '<td valign="top">First, it''s way too small to evaluate fairly. Second, the blue portion (lower right) doesn''t make sense -- what is that? It looks like golden water above it, which does make sense (given the candlelight) and then there''s that blue stuff. &lt;&lt;shrug&gt;&gt;</td>', 'First, it''s way too small to evaluate fairly. Second, the blue portion (lower right) doesn''t make sense -- what is that? It looks like golden water above it, which does make sense (given the candlelight) and then there''s that blue stuff. <<shrug>>', '2004-05-14 21:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(719157, 75621, 12252, '<td valign="top">Fire and Ice is tough to pull off. Here''s what I think falls short in this image: contrast, using ice cubes, and going in black and white (which seems like a waste of color for this kind of image!). The "flame" is a bit odd, and there''s no visual explanation for that. The composition doesn''t treat the eye, IMHO.</td>', 'Fire and Ice is tough to pull off. Here''s what I think falls short in this image: contrast, using ice cubes, and going in black and white (which seems like a waste of color for this kind of image!). The "flame" is a bit odd, and there''s no visual explanation for that. The composition doesn''t treat the eye, IMHO.', '2004-05-14 22:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(719160, 76055, 12252, '<td valign="top">I tried but couldn''t see what''s opposite here. If it''s opposite colors on the color wheel, then I''m afraid I miss that boat because I don''t know which colors are opposite. That said, the image doesn''t hold too much visual interest for me.</td>', 'I tried but couldn''t see what''s opposite here. If it''s opposite colors on the color wheel, then I''m afraid I miss that boat because I don''t know which colors are opposite. That said, the image doesn''t hold too much visual interest for me.', '2004-05-14 22:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(719184, 75952, 6405, '<td valign="top">Vidalia La,nice photo..10 !</td>', 'Vidalia La,nice photo..10 !', '2004-05-14 22:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(719185, 75757, 6405, '<td valign="top">Beautiful size comparison,9 !</td>', 'Beautiful size comparison,9 !', '2004-05-14 22:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(719200, 75099, 13305, '<td valign="top">Backgorund is painfully overexposed.  Interesting idea though.</td>', 'Backgorund is painfully overexposed.  Interesting idea though.', '2004-05-14 23:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(719202, 74920, 13305, '<td valign="top">It took me a while to understand what your shot is, a tree with moonlight thru it''s branches and a cityscape in the background.  Maybe lighten up the background just a bit to make it a little easier to understand.</td>', 'It took me a while to understand what your shot is, a tree with moonlight thru it''s branches and a cityscape in the background.  Maybe lighten up the background just a bit to make it a little easier to understand.', '2004-05-14 23:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(719203, 76069, 13305, '<td valign="top">One of those people that hoard fireworks for later in the year (just in case). :)  Interesting shot and concept, I think one lit fuse might have enhanced the meaning.  7</td>', 'One of those people that hoard fireworks for later in the year (just in case). :)  Interesting shot and concept, I think one lit fuse might have enhanced the meaning.  7', '2004-05-14 23:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(719205, 75774, 13305, '<td valign="top">Good concept, but the pic is almost too busy.  Simplfy.  Perhaps just the cards or chess pieces by themselves on a stark background.  7</td>', 'Good concept, but the pic is almost too busy.  Simplfy.  Perhaps just the cards or chess pieces by themselves on a stark background.  7', '2004-05-14 23:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(719209, 75245, 13305, '<td valign="top">What I think I see is a mylar balloon with a string.  The balloon is overexposed to the extent that it''s not easily identifiable, also needs more depth of background to set the balloon off.</td>', 'What I think I see is a mylar balloon with a string.  The balloon is overexposed to the extent that it''s not easily identifiable, also needs more depth of background to set the balloon off.', '2004-05-14 23:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(719210, 75898, 10350, '<td valign="top">those are some damn ugly ass male underwear</td>', 'those are some damn ugly ass male underwear', '2004-05-14 23:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(719211, 75749, 13305, '<td valign="top">The first original shot I''ve seen in this challenge.  Good take on the challenge. Well shot, I know it''s hard to capture an arc like that.  10</td>', 'The first original shot I''ve seen in this challenge.  Good take on the challenge. Well shot, I know it''s hard to capture an arc like that.  10', '2004-05-14 23:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(719213, 74731, 13305, '<td valign="top">Very original take on the challenge.  Nicely shot too.  Not overexposed for the most part.  Good macro too.   10</td>', 'Very original take on the challenge.  Nicely shot too.  Not overexposed for the most part.  Good macro too.   10', '2004-05-14 23:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(719214, 76055, 13305, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about opposites, but the pic rocks.  I''d really like to know your technique on this.</td>', 'I''m not sure about opposites, but the pic rocks.  I''d really like to know your technique on this.', '2004-05-14 23:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(719215, 75744, 13305, '<td valign="top">Excellent comparison.  Would have more meaning if you had included an old Bible. 9</td>', 'Excellent comparison.  Would have more meaning if you had included an old Bible. 9', '2004-05-14 23:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(719216, 75838, 13305, '<td valign="top">Different. I think the pic would have more impact if the shadows were darker/smoother or if the view were up much closer, maybe crop it down to just about the center 30%.  Your border is ok, but I think more effort on the pic would be more effective. 7</td>', 'Different. I think the pic would have more impact if the shadows were darker/smoother or if the view were up much closer, maybe crop it down to just about the center 30%.  Your border is ok, but I think more effort on the pic would be more effective. 7', '2004-05-14 23:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(719219, 75522, 13305, '<td valign="top">Very nice on the challenge.  I think it would be more effective if the shakers were closer to the intersection of the colors and then crop in closer.  Good Effort. 8</td>', 'Very nice on the challenge.  I think it would be more effective if the shakers were closer to the intersection of the colors and then crop in closer.  Good Effort. 8', '2004-05-14 23:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(719222, 76061, 13305, '<td valign="top">Good shot on the challenge.  To make this really have impact, the people need to be completly in shadow.  Either a stronger light behind, or perhaps move the sheet/curtain between them and the camera.  There''s just enough detail that it distracts from the opposites theme. 9</td>', 'Good shot on the challenge.  To make this really have impact, the people need to be completly in shadow.  Either a stronger light behind, or perhaps move the sheet/curtain between them and the camera.  There''s just enough detail that it distracts from the opposites theme. 9', '2004-05-14 23:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(719225, 75854, 13305, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot!   Only minor problem, I think I might have cropped out the street light near the bottom.  It would still be a pretty dramatic shot.  10</td>', 'Awesome shot!   Only minor problem, I think I might have cropped out the street light near the bottom.  It would still be a pretty dramatic shot.  10', '2004-05-14 23:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(719229, 76115, 13305, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Minimalize the background by cropping in on the face.  Would be very impressive then.  8</td>', 'Nice idea.  Minimalize the background by cropping in on the face.  Would be very impressive then.  8', '2004-05-14 23:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(719232, 75827, 13305, '<td valign="top">Fill the frame with the dog, too much sky distracts from him.</td>', 'Fill the frame with the dog, too much sky distracts from him.', '2004-05-14 23:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(719235, 75940, 18834, '<td valign="top">A very clear reflection.  the fact that this was taken when the buildings looked upside down give it a good frame and background with the cobble stones.</td>', 'A very clear reflection.  the fact that this was taken when the buildings looked upside down give it a good frame and background with the cobble stones.', '2004-05-14 23:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(719238, 76060, 13305, '<td valign="top">I like the way you think.  There is something not quite right about this pic, but I can''t put my finger on it.  Perhaps the blue cast? Try correcting the color/exposure, it might improve.  Nice shot  8</td>', 'I like the way you think.  There is something not quite right about this pic, but I can''t put my finger on it.  Perhaps the blue cast? Try correcting the color/exposure, it might improve.  Nice shot  8', '2004-05-14 23:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(719239, 76046, 18834, '<td valign="top">The photo would have been a better shot if it was only one feather, because it probably would have showed  more of the weight, giving the photo more contrast in between the feather and the weight.</td>', 'The photo would have been a better shot if it was only one feather, because it probably would have showed  more of the weight, giving the photo more contrast in between the feather and the weight.', '2004-05-14 23:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(719242, 75914, 13305, '<td valign="top">I like your idea, the only problem is her shoes almost exactly match the background, Differentiate a little more or change to a different background. 7</td>', 'I like your idea, the only problem is her shoes almost exactly match the background, Differentiate a little more or change to a different background. 7', '2004-05-14 23:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
