(719549, 75401, 20407, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colour, DOF, focus. A really nice, well balanced shot. 8</td>', 'Beautiful colour, DOF, focus. A really nice, well balanced shot. 8', '2004-05-15 08:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(719551, 75996, 20407, '<td valign="top">A really nice take on the theme. The shpaes really work well. Lovely colours. 8</td>', 'A really nice take on the theme. The shpaes really work well. Lovely colours. 8', '2004-05-15 08:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(719552, 75968, 20407, '<td valign="top">Great ideas and well executed. The only thing that detracts is the slight shadows aound the black figures. Really nice balance.  7</td>', 'Great ideas and well executed. The only thing that detracts is the slight shadows aound the black figures. Really nice balance.  7', '2004-05-15 08:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(719554, 76113, 20407, '<td valign="top">A great shot, you must have a lot of patience! I''m impressed that you got all of them in focus. It''s a pity about the shadow across the right side, it''s the only thing that takes away from it. 8</td>', 'A great shot, you must have a lot of patience! I''m impressed that you got all of them in focus. It''s a pity about the shadow across the right side, it''s the only thing that takes away from it. 8', '2004-05-15 08:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(719555, 76020, 20407, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Great version of opposites. 8</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Great version of opposites. 8', '2004-05-15 08:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(719556, 74616, 20407, '<td valign="top">I was going to do this - you did it much beter than I could''ve :-) Very nice. 8</td>', 'I was going to do this - you did it much beter than I could''ve :-) Very nice. 8', '2004-05-15 08:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(719557, 75321, 20407, '<td valign="top">Lovely, well balanced. Good idea. 8</td>', 'Lovely, well balanced. Good idea. 8', '2004-05-15 08:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(719559, 76026, 20407, '<td valign="top">Very nice, one of the best fire &amp; ice shots. How did you get the ice on fire? I coludn''t get mine to do that ... 8</td>', 'Very nice, one of the best fire & ice shots. How did you get the ice on fire? I coludn''t get mine to do that ... 8', '2004-05-15 08:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(719561, 75749, 20407, '<td valign="top">This is cool - good idea.  Very nice shot, nothing else to say about it :) 8</td>', 'This is cool - good idea.  Very nice shot, nothing else to say about it :) 8', '2004-05-15 08:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(719563, 74991, 20407, '<td valign="top">Lovely pussycat. Very nice focus. It looks like he''s talking to you. 8</td>', 'Lovely pussycat. Very nice focus. It looks like he''s talking to you. 8', '2004-05-15 08:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(719564, 75456, 20407, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Lovely focus. The choice of colour is really nice. 8</td>', 'Beautiful. Lovely focus. The choice of colour is really nice. 8', '2004-05-15 08:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(719569, 75331, 20407, '<td valign="top">The subjec tin this image is a little complicated. I think you would do well by taking one of the elements of the image and focussing in on it.</td>', 'The subjec tin this image is a little complicated. I think you would do well by taking one of the elements of the image and focussing in on it.', '2004-05-15 08:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(719570, 75917, 20407, '<td valign="top">The blue colour is nice. The background is a little distracting, it would be good if it could be solid black.</td>', 'The blue colour is nice. The background is a little distracting, it would be good if it could be solid black.', '2004-05-15 08:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(719572, 76033, 20407, '<td valign="top">The red makes this one sifferent from the other fire &amp; ice images. The fire is a little too bright, but the composition is nice.</td>', 'The red makes this one sifferent from the other fire & ice images. The fire is a little too bright, but the composition is nice.', '2004-05-15 08:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(719573, 75403, 5240, '<td valign="top">Too bad the adult tail was cut off.  If it was not possible beacuse of other offsprings, you  could have cropped closer to the middle of the adult''s back. Awesome timing with drop of water from both!<br/></td>', 'Too bad the adult tail was cut off.  If it was not possible beacuse of other offsprings, you  could have cropped closer to the middle of the adult''s back. Awesome timing with drop of water from both!', '2004-05-15 08:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(719577, 75816, 5240, '<td valign="top">Your new life has just died...lol. Would have put the new leaf coming from the edge or with a longer branch. Other than that, composition is nice.</td>', 'Your new life has just died...lol. Would have put the new leaf coming from the edge or with a longer branch. Other than that, composition is nice.', '2004-05-15 09:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(719579, 75866, 21471, '<td valign="top">would''ve liked a little larger DOF, to include one of the fingers...</td>', 'would''ve liked a little larger DOF, to include one of the fingers...', '2004-05-15 09:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(719596, 75903, 21471, '<td valign="top">nice shot... but how are these opposites?</td>', 'nice shot... but how are these opposites?', '2004-05-15 09:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(719606, 75748, 21471, '<td valign="top">can''t figure out what this is a picture of, but I like it!</td>', 'can''t figure out what this is a picture of, but I like it!', '2004-05-15 09:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(719608, 75968, 21471, '<td valign="top">pretty basic, but I like the composition</td>', 'pretty basic, but I like the composition', '2004-05-15 09:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(719609, 76019, 21471, '<td valign="top">sp: jalapeno.  Cute idea.  The real question is: did you eat it afterwords?</td>', 'sp: jalapeno.  Cute idea.  The real question is: did you eat it afterwords?', '2004-05-15 09:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(719611, 74981, 21471, '<td valign="top">unusual choice for fg/bg subject &amp; focus.  I would''ve done them the "traditional" (flower/bud) way, but this works...</td>', 'unusual choice for fg/bg subject & focus.  I would''ve done them the "traditional" (flower/bud) way, but this works...', '2004-05-15 09:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(719612, 75275, 21471, '<td valign="top">Beautiful !!!<br/>The lone blue color is very effective...it keeps drawing my eye to different areas of the picture.. Compelling photo, technically well done, and seems a perfect fit to the theme.  Best of the fire/ice motif, imho.<br/>Added this one to my wishlist.</td>', 'Beautiful !!!The lone blue color is very effective...it keeps drawing my eye to different areas of the picture.. Compelling photo, technically well done, and seems a perfect fit to the theme.  Best of the fire/ice motif, imho.Added this one to my wishlist.', '2004-05-15 09:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(719616, 74604, 16488, '<td valign="top">Great idea for this challenge--what an unexpected subject!  I think the cropping could be tighter--perhaps a different shot angle would have permitted you more flexibility.</td>', 'Great idea for this challenge--what an unexpected subject!  I think the cropping could be tighter--perhaps a different shot angle would have permitted you more flexibility.', '2004-05-15 10:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(719617, 75456, 21613, '<td valign="top">wow</td>', 'wow', '2004-05-15 10:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(719618, 76007, 21613, '<td valign="top">eww</td>', 'eww', '2004-05-15 10:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(719620, 75854, 21613, '<td valign="top">awesome</td>', 'awesome', '2004-05-15 10:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(719623, 76088, 16488, '<td valign="top">Clever subject for this challenge.  I think there are some technical problems, though.  Your depth of field seems too limited--the " pepsi" at the bottom of the can could be in focus.  The lighting is a bit harsh--especially evident in the highlights at the top of the coke cans.  The background is neutral but the subjects fade into it at the edges.  The b&amp;w is a nice choice and the things I object to do lend an "artsy" feel.  Just think it could be done a bit better.</td>', 'Clever subject for this challenge.  I think there are some technical problems, though.  Your depth of field seems too limited--the " pepsi" at the bottom of the can could be in focus.  The lighting is a bit harsh--especially evident in the highlights at the top of the coke cans.  The background is neutral but the subjects fade into it at the edges.  The b&w is a nice choice and the things I object to do lend an "artsy" feel.  Just think it could be done a bit better.', '2004-05-15 10:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(719625, 75548, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for this challenge.  The subjects are interesting--and I know it can be difficult to get a cat to cooperate, no less two!  But the thing that stands out is, unfortunately, the pixelated whiskers.  Can''t tell you how to fix it, it depends on the camera and post-processing.</td>', 'Nice idea for this challenge.  The subjects are interesting--and I know it can be difficult to get a cat to cooperate, no less two!  But the thing that stands out is, unfortunately, the pixelated whiskers.  Can''t tell you how to fix it, it depends on the camera and post-processing.', '2004-05-15 10:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(719663, 75670, 19841, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice composition, but you can''t tell by looking which way the trains go, so the idea of North/South doesn''t come across at all.  .</td>', 'It''s a nice composition, but you can''t tell by looking which way the trains go, so the idea of North/South doesn''t come across at all.  .', '2004-05-15 10:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(719664, 75998, 19841, '<td valign="top">This would have worked better with a lot more depth of field.  The candle being out of focus makes it feel like background, and not really part of the picture, which spoils your effect.</td>', 'This would have worked better with a lot more depth of field.  The candle being out of focus makes it feel like background, and not really part of the picture, which spoils your effect.', '2004-05-15 10:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(719668, 75522, 19841, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Tackiest shakers ever!  Good idea, well composed.  More directional lighting would have been nice on the shakers.</td>', 'Wow!  Tackiest shakers ever!  Good idea, well composed.  More directional lighting would have been nice on the shakers.', '2004-05-15 10:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(719672, 75866, 20679, '<td valign="top">really nice idea and beautifully executed!</td>', 'really nice idea and beautifully executed!', '2004-05-15 10:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(719674, 75170, 19841, '<td valign="top">The flowers being out of focus takes the out of the idea.   Also, I would have prefered this in color.  There''s just something not right about food (and flowers) without color.</td>', 'The flowers being out of focus takes the out of the idea.   Also, I would have prefered this in color.  There''s just something not right about food (and flowers) without color.', '2004-05-15 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(719677, 75854, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  Dynamic and full of interest.</td>', 'Nice capture.  Dynamic and full of interest.', '2004-05-15 11:01:54.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(719681, 76009, 19608, '<td valign="top">NIMBY!  Great perspective, composition and exposure.  Nice crisp blue sky.  Keystoning of the buildings due to the wide angke kens is exaggerated by your choice of border.  Overall - one of the STRONGEST entries.</td>', 'NIMBY!  Great perspective, composition and exposure.  Nice crisp blue sky.  Keystoning of the buildings due to the wide angke kens is exaggerated by your choice of border.  Overall - one of the STRONGEST entries.', '2004-05-15 11:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(719682, 75211, 3032, '<td valign="top">As a thumb it looked pretty weak, so I had to check out why I had given it an eight. :) Now I know.<br/>I like the backlighting and detail/color of the hair. Her look is a as strong as the ''blade'' she is holding. The background gives it a feeling that this was near some battlefield out in the country. The blue sky reflection on the steel enhances the steel look.<br/> <br/>Nice work.</td>', 'As a thumb it looked pretty weak, so I had to check out why I had given it an eight. :) Now I know.I like the backlighting and detail/color of the hair. Her look is a as strong as the ''blade'' she is holding. The background gives it a feeling that this was near some battlefield out in the country. The blue sky reflection on the steel enhances the steel look. Nice work.', '2004-05-15 11:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(719683, 75921, 3032, '<td valign="top">Powerful image, great lighting, pose and composition.</td>', 'Powerful image, great lighting, pose and composition.', '2004-05-15 11:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(719684, 75403, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great lighting on the larger bird.  Catching that water drop falling was an added treat.  Exposure seems to be right on.</td>', 'Great lighting on the larger bird.  Catching that water drop falling was an added treat.  Exposure seems to be right on.', '2004-05-15 11:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(719685, 75558, 3032, '<td valign="top">I don''t like many flag photos, but this is a good one. Good composition (positioning/ use of lines), well chosen theme. In relation to the stars and stripes the other one''s lighting is a bit off, but perhaps that is also due to the dark colors of the flag itself, I don''t know. Good work.</td>', 'I don''t like many flag photos, but this is a good one. Good composition (positioning/ use of lines), well chosen theme. In relation to the stars and stripes the other one''s lighting is a bit off, but perhaps that is also due to the dark colors of the flag itself, I don''t know. Good work.', '2004-05-15 11:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(719687, 76029, 19608, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective.  This is one of several that used the black/white technique with eating utensils or something similar.  Since yours is divided exactly in half and not placed in a diagonal composition, it is not as dynamic as some.  The thin white line on the border is a bit unusual - showing only on the handle of the black fork.</td>', 'Simple and effective.  This is one of several that used the black/white technique with eating utensils or something similar.  Since yours is divided exactly in half and not placed in a diagonal composition, it is not as dynamic as some.  The thin white line on the border is a bit unusual - showing only on the handle of the black fork.', '2004-05-15 11:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(719689, 75974, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great composition, lighting &amp; colors. I like it as it is, don''t see how it could be improved. The grainy look in the whites and yellows makes it look classic.<br/> <br/>I wonder how you lit the cans up, from the inside?</td>', 'Great composition, lighting & colors. I like it as it is, don''t see how it could be improved. The grainy look in the whites and yellows makes it look classic. I wonder how you lit the cans up, from the inside?', '2004-05-15 11:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(719690, 75863, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very nice rendition.  Great exposure and lighting.</td>', 'A very nice rendition.  Great exposure and lighting.', '2004-05-15 11:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(719692, 75921, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nicely done black and white portrait.  Would like to see a tiny bit more outline of the top of the head.  Lighting on the hands is perfect.</td>', 'Nicely done black and white portrait.  Would like to see a tiny bit more outline of the top of the head.  Lighting on the hands is perfect.', '2004-05-15 11:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(719694, 76027, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great idea, the composition is good, lighting ok and duotoning (I guess) very good. I think that if the man in front hadn''t been there that a square composition (the right cut off) might have worked stronger.<br/>Shame that the dowtown sign is out of the field of focus. A smaller aperture (+bumped up ISO to not let the motion blur get out of hand) would have helped here. Choosing a nearer focus point sometimes does the trick as well. <br/></td>', 'Great idea, the composition is good, lighting ok and duotoning (I guess) very good. I think that if the man in front hadn''t been there that a square composition (the right cut off) might have worked stronger.Shame that the dowtown sign is out of the field of focus. A smaller aperture (+bumped up ISO to not let the motion blur get out of hand) would have helped here. Choosing a nearer focus point sometimes does the trick as well. ', '2004-05-15 11:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(719696, 75281, 19608, '<td valign="top">Catchy title, made me chuckle.  Great selection of colors - but it would be more effective if the chili manitained a dark crisp green instead of the muted yellowish green.  The way the red is bouncing around in the ice is really tremendous.</td>', 'Catchy title, made me chuckle.  Great selection of colors - but it would be more effective if the chili manitained a dark crisp green instead of the muted yellowish green.  The way the red is bouncing around in the ice is really tremendous.', '2004-05-15 11:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(719697, 74684, 20822, '<td valign="top">The violent or "uncalm" water does not come through the photo</td>', 'The violent or "uncalm" water does not come through the photo', '2004-05-15 11:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(719702, 74616, 20822, '<td valign="top">these are both devices to tell time</td>', 'these are both devices to tell time', '2004-05-15 11:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(719706, 75676, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice handling of your extreme depth of field.  Great exposure on the close face - and a pretty one at that.  The hair coming in from the top left leading you down to the eye is a GREAT touch.  There are two suggestions for improvement: 1) The bight sky in the top right corner is unfortunate and 2) The reddish object to the left of the legs is a minor detractor.</td>', 'Very nice handling of your extreme depth of field.  Great exposure on the close face - and a pretty one at that.  The hair coming in from the top left leading you down to the eye is a GREAT touch.  There are two suggestions for improvement: 1) The bight sky in the top right corner is unfortunate and 2) The reddish object to the left of the legs is a minor detractor.', '2004-05-15 11:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(719709, 75943, 20822, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what to say. I wish it was clearer.</td>', 'I don''t know what to say. I wish it was clearer.', '2004-05-15 11:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
