(719715, 75271, 20822, '<td valign="top">Your title says it all I agree the planes are not opposites</td>', 'Your title says it all I agree the planes are not opposites', '2004-05-15 11:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(719716, 75854, 21333, '<td valign="top">nice shot!</td>', 'nice shot!', '2004-05-15 11:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(719717, 75522, 19608, '<td valign="top">Simple, effective and nice to look at.  There are some things I think could improve your image: 1) The triangle of white on the top left edge is not needed, 2) Try moving the white phone just a bit to the right so that you can see the entire line of the boundary of the white/black, and 3) The whites should proably match better - remove the yellowish cast to the area under the black phone.   But that''s not saying it''s not a great submssion as it is!  Very well done!</td>', 'Simple, effective and nice to look at.  There are some things I think could improve your image: 1) The triangle of white on the top left edge is not needed, 2) Try moving the white phone just a bit to the right so that you can see the entire line of the boundary of the white/black, and 3) The whites should proably match better - remove the yellowish cast to the area under the black phone.   But that''s not saying it''s not a great submssion as it is!  Very well done!', '2004-05-15 11:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(719722, 75049, 19608, '<td valign="top">Busy but very intriguing as well.  Sometimes it appears the ringy thingy is "floating" above the surface.  Wish I could tell a bit more what it is.  Nice job!</td>', 'Busy but very intriguing as well.  Sometimes it appears the ringy thingy is "floating" above the surface.  Wish I could tell a bit more what it is.  Nice job!', '2004-05-15 11:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(719723, 75752, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Texture and soft colors on the top flower are very nice.  The repeated shape of  the out-of-focus flower adds a nice compositional element.  I was wondering about the lighting on te back flower but finally concluded it helps separate the colors of the petals front to back.  Fills the frame very nicely.</td>', 'Very nice!  Texture and soft colors on the top flower are very nice.  The repeated shape of  the out-of-focus flower adds a nice compositional element.  I was wondering about the lighting on te back flower but finally concluded it helps separate the colors of the petals front to back.  Fills the frame very nicely.', '2004-05-15 11:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(719724, 76123, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great use of that leading line. It adds a lot of depth to your composition. I also like it the puth their feet forward, gives some feeling of motion.<br/>I had to look for the opposite in this photo, but after some time found out that I overlooked it (the clothes, I was thinking too much on a mind &amp; gene level). ;) <br/>Good work.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Great use of that leading line. It adds a lot of depth to your composition. I also like it the puth their feet forward, gives some feeling of motion.I had to look for the opposite in this photo, but after some time found out that I overlooked it (the clothes, I was thinking too much on a mind & gene level). ;) Good work. ', '2004-05-15 11:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(719725, 75834, 19608, '<td valign="top">Me cookie monster.  Great job!  It may be better if the white on the bottom cookie didn''t have the yellowish cast to it - but that''s a minor point.  Nice idea and execution.</td>', 'Me cookie monster.  Great job!  It may be better if the white on the bottom cookie didn''t have the yellowish cast to it - but that''s a minor point.  Nice idea and execution.', '2004-05-15 11:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(719726, 75668, 19608, '<td valign="top">Good colors - nice lighting and a perfect sign showing opposites.  I was going to say you needed more light on "side street" but finally concluded that is was a nice irony that the side street is  shadowed.  Composition seems a bit centered - and just wonder what would it look like if it was shot with the sign pole being a little diagonal instead of straight vertical.</td>', 'Good colors - nice lighting and a perfect sign showing opposites.  I was going to say you needed more light on "side street" but finally concluded that is was a nice irony that the side street is  shadowed.  Composition seems a bit centered - and just wonder what would it look like if it was shot with the sign pole being a little diagonal instead of straight vertical.', '2004-05-15 11:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(719728, 75742, 19608, '<td valign="top">Effective - kinda "spacy"   The several white spots on the striped part of the image are a bit distracting.</td>', 'Effective - kinda "spacy"   The several white spots on the striped part of the image are a bit distracting.', '2004-05-15 11:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(719730, 75940, 19608, '<td valign="top">Exceptional reflection.  The placement of the curving lead-in line starting in the bottom left corner is marvelous.  Once you start there - there are numerous arcs that gently lead the eye up into the buildings and sky. It''s a work of art, but perhaps a bit of a stretch for the challenge.  It doesn''t shout "OPPOSITE" but it does indeed whisper "opposite."</td>', 'Exceptional reflection.  The placement of the curving lead-in line starting in the bottom left corner is marvelous.  Once you start there - there are numerous arcs that gently lead the eye up into the buildings and sky. It''s a work of art, but perhaps a bit of a stretch for the challenge.  It doesn''t shout "OPPOSITE" but it does indeed whisper "opposite."', '2004-05-15 11:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(719733, 75437, 19608, '<td valign="top">Superb macro shot - loads of detail.  Exposue right on.  The only minor point is the few pieces of dirt/hair on the background area - but that''s very minor.  Great submission.</td>', 'Superb macro shot - loads of detail.  Exposue right on.  The only minor point is the few pieces of dirt/hair on the background area - but that''s very minor.  Great submission.', '2004-05-15 11:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
