(719795, 75929, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is an unpleasant shot. Mainly because the model''s boob is about to fall out. I''m not a prude but, honestly, this model''s figure is not attractive enough to pull this off. You just want her to zip her top back up. She''s too bony looking for the ''curves'' your title suggests. Also, you should have made the shot at a moment when the wind wasn''t blowing her hair in her face. The colors are rather drab and the model''s pale skin practically blends into her surroundings.<br/>The composition is good.</td>', 'This is an unpleasant shot. Mainly because the model''s boob is about to fall out. I''m not a prude but, honestly, this model''s figure is not attractive enough to pull this off. You just want her to zip her top back up. She''s too bony looking for the ''curves'' your title suggests. Also, you should have made the shot at a moment when the wind wasn''t blowing her hair in her face. The colors are rather drab and the model''s pale skin practically blends into her surroundings.The composition is good.', '2004-05-15 13:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
