(719844, 74631, 21313, '<td valign="top">This is definately a good idea for "opposite" colors, but it would be fun if you had taken the picture down the row of all the keys with the sharp focus in the middle or at one of the ends.</td>', 'This is definately a good idea for "opposite" colors, but it would be fun if you had taken the picture down the row of all the keys with the sharp focus in the middle or at one of the ends.', '2004-05-15 13:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
