(719847, 75973, 7322, '<td valign="top">Would have been much better with a different background. You might consider an inexpensive light box (you can get them in craft stores for about $15) for shots like this. Another option would be some good colored paper. The composition is quite nice and the lighting is not bad. A little lower and you would have shown a little more form to the mound of sugar.</td>', 'Would have been much better with a different background. You might consider an inexpensive light box (you can get them in craft stores for about $15) for shots like this. Another option would be some good colored paper. The composition is quite nice and the lighting is not bad. A little lower and you would have shown a little more form to the mound of sugar.', '2004-05-15 13:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(719848, 75940, 21313, '<td valign="top">This could be a really fun picture if the ground was not the ''focused'' part of the picture.  Maybe next time you could get them to blur a little, and focus more on the reflection.</td>', 'This could be a really fun picture if the ground was not the ''focused'' part of the picture.  Maybe next time you could get them to blur a little, and focus more on the reflection.', '2004-05-15 13:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
