(719953, 74788, 21313, '<td valign="top">it would be better if both of the subjects of the picture were in focus.</td>', 'it would be better if both of the subjects of the picture were in focus.', '2004-05-15 15:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(719954, 75970, 21313, '<td valign="top">the colors are kind of weird</td>', 'the colors are kind of weird', '2004-05-15 15:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(719955, 76017, 21313, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this picture if it were simply the money, paper and coins.  and brighter more vivid colors.</td>', 'I think I would have liked this picture if it were simply the money, paper and coins.  and brighter more vivid colors.', '2004-05-15 15:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(719958, 75743, 21761, '<td valign="top">Your title and objects both work to support the "opposite" concept.  I like the diagonal horizon.  The blues look unnatural, however, in both the sky and grasses.  Also, I think that if the day had been a clear day (few or no clouds), then the apparent differences in "noise" and texture would have provided even more evidence of the "opposite" concept.</td>', 'Your title and objects both work to support the "opposite" concept.  I like the diagonal horizon.  The blues look unnatural, however, in both the sky and grasses.  Also, I think that if the day had been a clear day (few or no clouds), then the apparent differences in "noise" and texture would have provided even more evidence of the "opposite" concept.', '2004-05-15 15:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(719959, 75971, 21313, '<td valign="top">This is a rally cute picutre!  It would have been fun to zoom in just a little bit omre, so they are completly surrounded by green grass, and not the white in the corner.</td>', 'This is a rally cute picutre!  It would have been fun to zoom in just a little bit omre, so they are completly surrounded by green grass, and not the white in the corner.', '2004-05-15 15:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(719963, 76084, 21761, '<td valign="top">Great detail - especially in the wake of the powered rowboat.  Image seems a bit dark as a whole.  Perhaps "manpower vs. horsepower" may have been a better title.</td>', 'Great detail - especially in the wake of the powered rowboat.  Image seems a bit dark as a whole.  Perhaps "manpower vs. horsepower" may have been a better title.', '2004-05-15 15:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(719969, 76016, 21761, '<td valign="top">Your title leads me to believe you didn''t capture the "opposite" concept, but rather mere differences.  Also, I can''t put my finger on it - but the blue band doesn''t seem quite right.</td>', 'Your title leads me to believe you didn''t capture the "opposite" concept, but rather mere differences.  Also, I can''t put my finger on it - but the blue band doesn''t seem quite right.', '2004-05-15 15:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(719972, 76012, 18098, '<td valign="top">Perfect opposites!</td>', 'Perfect opposites!', '2004-05-15 15:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(719973, 76080, 21761, '<td valign="top">Good use of space - foreground/background, head/tail are working together.  Had the "head" penny been completely in focus (and the tail not), then I would have rated this higher.  Heads and tails are truly opposites.</td>', 'Good use of space - foreground/background, head/tail are working together.  Had the "head" penny been completely in focus (and the tail not), then I would have rated this higher.  Heads and tails are truly opposites.', '2004-05-15 15:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(719976, 75403, 21755, '<td valign="top">wonderful composition</td>', 'wonderful composition', '2004-05-15 15:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(719979, 74641, 21761, '<td valign="top">Red and green are contrasting hues, but I don''t think the difference between figure and ground is sufficient enough to capture the "opposite" concept.</td>', 'Red and green are contrasting hues, but I don''t think the difference between figure and ground is sufficient enough to capture the "opposite" concept.', '2004-05-15 15:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
