(720295, 75854, 16269, '<td valign="top">I was hoping for a shot like this for the Power challenge. Unfortunately, we don''t get much lightning here. This is gorgeous.. I love the colors of the sky. Nice opposites, too!</td>', 'I was hoping for a shot like this for the Power challenge. Unfortunately, we don''t get much lightning here. This is gorgeous.. I love the colors of the sky. Nice opposites, too!', '2004-05-15 20:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(720303, 75414, 16269, '<td valign="top">Out of all of the fire and ice photos, this is one of my favorites. The thumbnail actually looks like the candle itself is made out of wax in the shape of ice! That''d be a neat marketing idea.. hehe. But I really do like this... very well carried out!</td>', 'Out of all of the fire and ice photos, this is one of my favorites. The thumbnail actually looks like the candle itself is made out of wax in the shape of ice! That''d be a neat marketing idea.. hehe. But I really do like this... very well carried out!', '2004-05-15 20:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(720311, 75015, 11278, '<td valign="top">i like this idea, but i think its too busy.  i would prefer just the apple and orange halves that you have placed together.</td>', 'i like this idea, but i think its too busy.  i would prefer just the apple and orange halves that you have placed together.', '2004-05-15 21:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(720312, 75250, 11278, '<td valign="top">i think this would work better against a plain background</td>', 'i think this would work better against a plain background', '2004-05-15 21:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(720315, 75414, 12448, '<td valign="top">Good idea but the glass takes away from the shot rather than adding to it at this angle to me.  The rim of the glass is distracting, maybe if you had taken the shot from above?    Also, a bit more contrast would really help this shot.  Started at a 3 but am bumping to a 5</td>', 'Good idea but the glass takes away from the shot rather than adding to it at this angle to me.  The rim of the glass is distracting, maybe if you had taken the shot from above?    Also, a bit more contrast would really help this shot.  Started at a 3 but am bumping to a 5', '2004-05-15 21:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(720316, 75489, 16829, '<td valign="top">the internal border detracts from the picture by leading the eye around the background tangle and away from the subject.</td>', 'the internal border detracts from the picture by leading the eye around the background tangle and away from the subject.', '2004-05-15 21:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(720317, 75973, 19608, '<td valign="top">Good idea - and nice execution of the macro.  Planned or not, the seed in the lemon adds a great visual touch.   Perhaps it would be a bit better with a non-competing background, but that''s a very minor point.  Nice job.</td>', 'Good idea - and nice execution of the macro.  Planned or not, the seed in the lemon adds a great visual touch.   Perhaps it would be a bit better with a non-competing background, but that''s a very minor point.  Nice job.', '2004-05-15 21:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(720319, 75904, 16269, '<td valign="top">Whoah... how did you do that with absolutely no seam?? It looks outstanding!</td>', 'Whoah... how did you do that with absolutely no seam?? It looks outstanding!', '2004-05-15 21:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(720320, 75850, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice capture on the flame, it isn''t blown out too much in the shot.  It also looks like you took a little time to try to arrange your ice so it had some shape to it.  But the shot left me wanting, the crop seems a bit loose and the background on the right seems wrinkled.  Also if the candle was lower so you couldn''t see the wax part but just the flame?  Build the ice all the way around the candle so the light comes from within?  A 3 as is</td>', 'Nice capture on the flame, it isn''t blown out too much in the shot.  It also looks like you took a little time to try to arrange your ice so it had some shape to it.  But the shot left me wanting, the crop seems a bit loose and the background on the right seems wrinkled.  Also if the candle was lower so you couldn''t see the wax part but just the flame?  Build the ice all the way around the candle so the light comes from within?  A 3 as is', '2004-05-15 21:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(720321, 74732, 19841, '<td valign="top">Blurry and plain.  You could have made this more dynamic by putting the items a little closer together, and using more directional light.</td>', 'Blurry and plain.  You could have made this more dynamic by putting the items a little closer together, and using more directional light.', '2004-05-15 21:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(720322, 76109, 12448, '<td valign="top">A different idea which helps but the crack in the ice and the way it leans is very distracting.  Also the coaster or plate you set the ice candle on is a bit distracting.  Maybe if you set it straight on the mirror and then you could have used the straightening tool so it wasn''t leaning?  A 3</td>', 'A different idea which helps but the crack in the ice and the way it leans is very distracting.  Also the coaster or plate you set the ice candle on is a bit distracting.  Maybe if you set it straight on the mirror and then you could have used the straightening tool so it wasn''t leaning?  A 3', '2004-05-15 21:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(720323, 75558, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice composition - works very well.    Are you sure that''s a US flag from the period?  (35 or 36 states..)  Definitely fits the challenge though.  It may be a bit beyyer if the whites were the same color is each flag.</td>', 'Nice composition - works very well.    Are you sure that''s a US flag from the period?  (35 or 36 states..)  Definitely fits the challenge though.  It may be a bit beyyer if the whites were the same color is each flag.', '2004-05-15 21:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(720324, 76107, 16269, '<td valign="top">Very creative opposite! A lot different from the other shots. It''s nice to see people thinking outside of the norm, here!</td>', 'Very creative opposite! A lot different from the other shots. It''s nice to see people thinking outside of the norm, here!', '2004-05-15 21:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(720325, 75126, 12448, '<td valign="top">I have no idea how this fits the challenge unless you were going for a sea/land thing?  The shot is not bad, has a lot of potential but the young lady on the right is too distracting to start with and the lack of focus in the over all shot is also a minus.  If the camera panned a bit more to the left and captured more buildings or even if the crop was tighter on the right it might make a huge difference in this shot.  A 3 as is</td>', 'I have no idea how this fits the challenge unless you were going for a sea/land thing?  The shot is not bad, has a lot of potential but the young lady on the right is too distracting to start with and the lack of focus in the over all shot is also a minus.  If the camera panned a bit more to the left and captured more buildings or even if the crop was tighter on the right it might make a huge difference in this shot.  A 3 as is', '2004-05-15 21:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
