(720760, 75844, 19608, '<td valign="top">There''s just something about this image - this is about the 4th time I have come back to make comments.  It''s captivating and very well done.  The pose of the model is precious.  It shows "big" and "small" very well.  You have reduced the effect of the terrible sky by placing the trees in optimum positions. I''m not fond of the border, but try not to let that influence my voting.<br/> <br/>I guess my only reason for not giving it a 10 is very subjective - and something I can''t explain.  It doesn''t really have a "wow" impact on me - but it''s darn close.</td>', 'There''s just something about this image - this is about the 4th time I have come back to make comments.  It''s captivating and very well done.  The pose of the model is precious.  It shows "big" and "small" very well.  You have reduced the effect of the terrible sky by placing the trees in optimum positions. I''m not fond of the border, but try not to let that influence my voting. I guess my only reason for not giving it a 10 is very subjective - and something I can''t explain.  It doesn''t really have a "wow" impact on me - but it''s darn close.', '2004-05-16 03:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
