(720930, 75818, 13305, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  My only objection is that I''d prefer it in sharp focus, and maybe a little differently lighted to show the individual eggplants.  9</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  My only objection is that I''d prefer it in sharp focus, and maybe a little differently lighted to show the individual eggplants.  9', '2004-05-16 09:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
