(721203, 75552, 19841, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but off the mark in two ways.  "Ivory Black" is an oxymoron, not a pair of opposites.  The Ivory Black is not in focus.  Your focus is just behind it, shifting the center of interest off your intended focus.</td>', 'Good idea, but off the mark in two ways.  "Ivory Black" is an oxymoron, not a pair of opposites.  The Ivory Black is not in focus.  Your focus is just behind it, shifting the center of interest off your intended focus.', '2004-05-16 14:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
