(721750, 75749, 16148, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  You should score very well with this entry.  I might have cropped a little more from the top and bottom so the red handle hit the edge.  This might give it a little more depth.  Very nice as it is.  Good luck.</td>', 'Great idea!  You should score very well with this entry.  I might have cropped a little more from the top and bottom so the red handle hit the edge.  This might give it a little more depth.  Very nice as it is.  Good luck.', '2004-05-16 23:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(721751, 76103, 16148, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot.  It really looks like fall and spring.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot.  It really looks like fall and spring.  Good luck.', '2004-05-16 23:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(721754, 75757, 14526, '<td valign="top">Lightness of being and weight of institutions?</td>', 'Lightness of being and weight of institutions?', '2004-05-16 23:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(721865, 76114, 16106, '<td valign="top">To shoot a subject that is inherently uninteresting so well is a great test of skill. well done and a frame that serves the shot too.</td>', 'To shoot a subject that is inherently uninteresting so well is a great test of skill. well done and a frame that serves the shot too.', '2004-05-17 00:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(721868, 75738, 5044, '<td valign="top">Yuck!</td>', 'Yuck!', '2004-05-17 00:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(721872, 75309, 19952, '<td valign="top">Really stunning photo. I don''t know what that thing is, but it looks great in this shot.</td>', 'Really stunning photo. I don''t know what that thing is, but it looks great in this shot.', '2004-05-17 00:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(721873, 76055, 5044, '<td valign="top">Cool abstract.</td>', 'Cool abstract.', '2004-05-17 00:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(721876, 75854, 19952, '<td valign="top">Usually I try to clone power lines out of my photos. :-) This is a great idea for this competition and the result is excellent. Great shot.</td>', 'Usually I try to clone power lines out of my photos. :-) This is a great idea for this competition and the result is excellent. Great shot.', '2004-05-17 00:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(721882, 74981, 19952, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful shot and a great idea for a tough competition.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful shot and a great idea for a tough competition.', '2004-05-17 00:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(721884, 74590, 5044, '<td valign="top">As far as I''m concerned, sugar would be the opposite of salt. I like the lighting but find that you have cropped it too tight all around.</td>', 'As far as I''m concerned, sugar would be the opposite of salt. I like the lighting but find that you have cropped it too tight all around.', '2004-05-17 01:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(721890, 75907, 19952, '<td valign="top">Obviously, lots of people went for the fire and ice theme in this competition, but you really pulled it off beautifully. The only thing I would do is clone out a few of those distracting dots here and there, but it looks great as-is. Really great shot.</td>', 'Obviously, lots of people went for the fire and ice theme in this competition, but you really pulled it off beautifully. The only thing I would do is clone out a few of those distracting dots here and there, but it looks great as-is. Really great shot.', '2004-05-17 01:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(721904, 75321, 19952, '<td valign="top">Great black and white shot. BTW, where can I get some of those black sugar cubes? ;-)</td>', 'Great black and white shot. BTW, where can I get some of those black sugar cubes? ;-)', '2004-05-17 01:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(721911, 75968, 19952, '<td valign="top">Even though the cropping isn''t perfect and that shadow under the black knight is a bit distracting, this picture is one of my favorites of this competition. You did a really great job with such an elaborate setup. Nice shot!</td>', 'Even though the cropping isn''t perfect and that shadow under the black knight is a bit distracting, this picture is one of my favorites of this competition. You did a really great job with such an elaborate setup. Nice shot!', '2004-05-17 01:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(721918, 75749, 19952, '<td valign="top">This may be the best idea I''ve seen for this competition. The end result was just a bit soft and over-saturated, but it''s still an excellent shot. Great job!</td>', 'This may be the best idea I''ve seen for this competition. The end result was just a bit soft and over-saturated, but it''s still an excellent shot. Great job!', '2004-05-17 01:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(721940, 75909, 19952, '<td valign="top">Really stunning shot. There is just so much going on in this frame that it looks like you went to a great deal of trouble to set it up. The result is absolutely excellent - great job!</td>', 'Really stunning shot. There is just so much going on in this frame that it looks like you went to a great deal of trouble to set it up. The result is absolutely excellent - great job!', '2004-05-17 01:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(721943, 75474, 20379, '<td valign="top">nice boots</td>', 'nice boots', '2004-05-17 01:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(721946, 75706, 19952, '<td valign="top">Very cute! It''s amazing that you were able to capture such a great moment.</td>', 'Very cute! It''s amazing that you were able to capture such a great moment.', '2004-05-17 01:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(721954, 75970, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of contrasting desert life with water. It''s hard to make out the water in teh background because of the dof and exposure length. Great lush colors.</td>', 'I like the idea of contrasting desert life with water. It''s hard to make out the water in teh background because of the dof and exposure length. Great lush colors.', '2004-05-17 01:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(721958, 74721, 19780, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea - the concept of black and white comes across beautifully. The composition and position of the birds within the frame is a little haphazard, and I''m not quite able to follow the lines as well as possible. I think a closer crop with only the right five birds with allowing the diagonal line of the ground to lead the eye might work a bit better.</td>', 'Wonderful idea - the concept of black and white comes across beautifully. The composition and position of the birds within the frame is a little haphazard, and I''m not quite able to follow the lines as well as possible. I think a closer crop with only the right five birds with allowing the diagonal line of the ground to lead the eye might work a bit better.', '2004-05-17 01:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(721961, 75410, 19780, '<td valign="top">Interesting caputre. I like the balance of your subject. The shininess of the fabric in the background is a little bit hot - something more neutral or maybe indirect lighting would help.</td>', 'Interesting caputre. I like the balance of your subject. The shininess of the fabric in the background is a little bit hot - something more neutral or maybe indirect lighting would help.', '2004-05-17 01:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(721970, 75572, 19708, '<td valign="top">Chessman and Focus would have been a better title.<br/>Image is very out of focus, and perhaps you intended it to be that way...<br/>?</td>', 'Chessman and Focus would have been a better title.Image is very out of focus, and perhaps you intended it to be that way...?', '2004-05-17 01:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(721973, 75844, 19780, '<td valign="top">At first I didn''t think this fit the opposites challenge, but I kept it up on my screen for a while and now I appreciate it much more. The lines of the figure''s body, the position of the arms and contrasted with the boughs of the tree and the framing with the background of the water is very nice. The horizon looks just slightly off a little rotation would fix that.</td>', 'At first I didn''t think this fit the opposites challenge, but I kept it up on my screen for a while and now I appreciate it much more. The lines of the figure''s body, the position of the arms and contrasted with the boughs of the tree and the framing with the background of the water is very nice. The horizon looks just slightly off a little rotation would fix that.', '2004-05-17 01:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(721979, 75681, 19708, '<td valign="top">Lighting was the key here. Better lighting would have rated this high!</td>', 'Lighting was the key here. Better lighting would have rated this high!', '2004-05-17 01:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(721998, 75668, 19780, '<td valign="top">What a great capture. It fits the challenge will. I love the blues and the texture of the post.</td>', 'What a great capture. It fits the challenge will. I love the blues and the texture of the post.', '2004-05-17 01:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(722055, 76117, 19575, '<td valign="top">the colors are what interest me, then the metaphor carries the weight for the project.</td>', 'the colors are what interest me, then the metaphor carries the weight for the project.', '2004-05-17 02:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(722060, 76046, 19575, '<td valign="top">Good composition and solution of the challenge. Different and rewarding.</td>', 'Good composition and solution of the challenge. Different and rewarding.', '2004-05-17 02:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(722061, 76122, 19575, '<td valign="top">nice composition, good original concept. The background is the only down fall... too grey for me.</td>', 'nice composition, good original concept. The background is the only down fall... too grey for me.', '2004-05-17 02:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(722064, 75046, 19575, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Would like to see more contast from black to white.</td>', 'Nice image. Would like to see more contast from black to white.', '2004-05-17 02:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(722068, 75932, 19575, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but I feel like it is tilting to the right.</td>', 'Nice composition but I feel like it is tilting to the right.', '2004-05-17 02:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(722071, 75854, 19575, '<td valign="top">Great solution to the challenge. Wonderful shot.</td>', 'Great solution to the challenge. Wonderful shot.', '2004-05-17 02:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(722072, 76027, 19575, '<td valign="top">Subtle opposites, nice composition.</td>', 'Subtle opposites, nice composition.', '2004-05-17 02:21:53.000000', NULL, 1);
