(723011, 74599, 14700, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ve heard it a few times... but focus is a little off.  I admire your originality.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ve heard it a few times... but focus is a little off.  I admire your originality.', '2004-05-17 14:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
