(723015, 75898, 14700, '<td valign="top">Whose is whose?</td>', 'Whose is whose?', '2004-05-17 14:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(723017, 75394, 14700, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  Focus is a little too soft on the batteries and the lighting is not too good.... but its the greatest idea in the challenge so far!  Great idea.  If give you an 8 inspite of everything else.</td>', 'Great idea!  Focus is a little too soft on the batteries and the lighting is not too good.... but its the greatest idea in the challenge so far!  Great idea.  If give you an 8 inspite of everything else.', '2004-05-17 14:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(723027, 75957, 19670, '<td valign="top">Could have increased DOF for whole shot so all is in focus.</td>', 'Could have increased DOF for whole shot so all is in focus.', '2004-05-17 14:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(723032, 74684, 19670, '<td valign="top">The violent side is only a little violent to me. Tranquil scene overall.</td>', 'The violent side is only a little violent to me. Tranquil scene overall.', '2004-05-17 14:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(723087, 74745, 21905, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Colors, great concept for opposite.  Very well done photograph.</td>', 'Beautiful Colors, great concept for opposite.  Very well done photograph.', '2004-05-17 15:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(723096, 76062, 5364, '<td valign="top">A nice interpretation of the challenge, but the reflections in the glass are too distracting</td>', 'A nice interpretation of the challenge, but the reflections in the glass are too distracting', '2004-05-17 15:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(723100, 75851, 5364, '<td valign="top">A nice attempt, but I feel you could have rotated the image a bit to get the black/white edge vertical</td>', 'A nice attempt, but I feel you could have rotated the image a bit to get the black/white edge vertical', '2004-05-17 15:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(723113, 75958, 18389, '<td valign="top">I take it the opposite here is ''Underexposed, Overexposed''.</td>', 'I take it the opposite here is ''Underexposed, Overexposed''.', '2004-05-17 15:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(723114, 76084, 5364, '<td valign="top">It''s a technically good photo, I just feel it would been psychologically more effective illustration of the challenge topic if the two boats had been going in opposite directions!</td>', 'It''s a technically good photo, I just feel it would been psychologically more effective illustration of the challenge topic if the two boats had been going in opposite directions!', '2004-05-17 15:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(723118, 75896, 5364, '<td valign="top">I think you would have had a stronger image if you could have had more texture on the column. The gradual transistion from white to black is a more unique idea than most however.</td>', 'I think you would have had a stronger image if you could have had more texture on the column. The gradual transistion from white to black is a more unique idea than most however.', '2004-05-17 15:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(723122, 75971, 18389, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  The white bit in the top right is a bit distracting though.  Well done.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  The white bit in the top right is a bit distracting though.  Well done.', '2004-05-17 15:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(723126, 75752, 18389, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I dont think the graininess works too well though</td>', 'Nice shot.  I dont think the graininess works too well though', '2004-05-17 16:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(723136, 75903, 5364, '<td valign="top">Excellent quality image, but a bit of a boring composition - maybe could could have had the chalk stuck in the cheese.</td>', 'Excellent quality image, but a bit of a boring composition - maybe could could have had the chalk stuck in the cheese.', '2004-05-17 16:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(723140, 75838, 19914, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the frame, too big! THe photo is ok, I like it, but the frame...</td>', 'I don''t like the frame, too big! THe photo is ok, I like it, but the frame...', '2004-05-17 16:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(723153, 75743, 19780, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and simple composition. I love the uphill portion and the angle of the grass.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and simple composition. I love the uphill portion and the angle of the grass.', '2004-05-17 16:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(723155, 75281, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this shot very much. The colors are a little too much on the fantastic side - perhaps it''s the background. The focus and composition are quite nice, I love the texture of the pepper and the curve of it with the stem.</td>', 'I like the idea of this shot very much. The colors are a little too much on the fantastic side - perhaps it''s the background. The focus and composition are quite nice, I love the texture of the pepper and the curve of it with the stem.', '2004-05-17 16:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(723157, 76063, 19780, '<td valign="top">Very nice image - I''d like to see the background either darker or lighter than the ceramic bowl. The yellow of the chip and the red of the salsa pop very nicely.</td>', 'Very nice image - I''d like to see the background either darker or lighter than the ceramic bowl. The yellow of the chip and the red of the salsa pop very nicely.', '2004-05-17 16:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(723159, 75904, 19780, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and production values. The colors are magnificent and the exposure is really great - I love the sharp focus on the embossing on the green bottles.</td>', 'Lovely composition and production values. The colors are magnificent and the exposure is really great - I love the sharp focus on the embossing on the green bottles.', '2004-05-17 16:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(723160, 75973, 19780, '<td valign="top">I love the crisp focus and textures on the lemon slice and shadow on the pile of sugar. I wish the background was more bland but I appreciate the centered composition.</td>', 'I love the crisp focus and textures on the lemon slice and shadow on the pile of sugar. I wish the background was more bland but I appreciate the centered composition.', '2004-05-17 16:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(723164, 75262, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here - how there''s a rugged landscape and then these structures that bind the two sides of the river together. I like the use of the right side tree to ground that side of the composition. I''d only suggest that you rotate slightly to counter clockwise to get your horizon straight.</td>', 'I like the idea here - how there''s a rugged landscape and then these structures that bind the two sides of the river together. I like the use of the right side tree to ground that side of the composition. I''d only suggest that you rotate slightly to counter clockwise to get your horizon straight.', '2004-05-17 16:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(723190, 76122, 19780, '<td valign="top">I love your inventive angle here, it really highlights the difference between the oil and water. I''d like to see a little higher contrast or truer whites for the background but the translucence of the glass is very nice as is the highlight along the edge of the oil.</td>', 'I love your inventive angle here, it really highlights the difference between the oil and water. I''d like to see a little higher contrast or truer whites for the background but the translucence of the glass is very nice as is the highlight along the edge of the oil.', '2004-05-17 16:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(723191, 75572, 19780, '<td valign="top">The softness of this is actually pretty pleasing, but I don''t quite get the opposite part of it becaus the color of the pieces looks the same. I like the diagonal angle of your composition and framing to allow for the very high king piece. The contrast could be bumped a little higher even if you want to keep it soft.</td>', 'The softness of this is actually pretty pleasing, but I don''t quite get the opposite part of it becaus the color of the pieces looks the same. I like the diagonal angle of your composition and framing to allow for the very high king piece. The contrast could be bumped a little higher even if you want to keep it soft.', '2004-05-17 16:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(723193, 75321, 19780, '<td valign="top">Nicely done studio shot! I love the composition and variations between the two setups (instead of being perfect mirrors). The only suggestion would be either better fill light to avoid harsh shadows or re-angle the light source so the shadow of the black spoon doesn''t bleed into the other side.</td>', 'Nicely done studio shot! I love the composition and variations between the two setups (instead of being perfect mirrors). The only suggestion would be either better fill light to avoid harsh shadows or re-angle the light source so the shadow of the black spoon doesn''t bleed into the other side.', '2004-05-17 16:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(723198, 75750, 21911, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent photograph in of itself. However, the theme of opposties is not clearly defined in the picture space (it is present, just not entirely clear.), and it would not be apparant without the aide of your title "Black &amp; White."</td>', 'This is an excellent photograph in of itself. However, the theme of opposties is not clearly defined in the picture space (it is present, just not entirely clear.), and it would not be apparant without the aide of your title "Black & White."', '2004-05-17 16:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(723205, 76118, 21911, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph!</td>', 'Nice photograph!', '2004-05-17 16:58:10.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(723209, 74744, 21911, '<td valign="top">Nice picture...however, I do not think it clearly shows "opposites" as the ice looks (to me, anyhow) like a cake pan....</td>', 'Nice picture...however, I do not think it clearly shows "opposites" as the ice looks (to me, anyhow) like a cake pan....', '2004-05-17 17:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(723211, 76046, 17505, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, composition and colors. <br/>I like it very much, although  I would like to see a bit more of the weight.</td>', 'Interesting idea, composition and colors. I like it very much, although  I would like to see a bit more of the weight.', '2004-05-17 17:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(723212, 75897, 21911, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t really show opposites...</td>', 'This doesn''t really show opposites...', '2004-05-17 17:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(723214, 76102, 17505, '<td valign="top">The little curls within the flower really add a lot to this photo. Nice detail. I also like your framing. Th eflower in the lower left is the only thing I would remove.</td>', 'The little curls within the flower really add a lot to this photo. Nice detail. I also like your framing. Th eflower in the lower left is the only thing I would remove.', '2004-05-17 17:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(723219, 75403, 17505, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Cute little guy. I would like to see the other duckling(s) or crop the left side a little to hide the other little fuzzball. I''m not sure I like the drops falling from the adult, but it''s still a great capture. Thanks for sharing it with us.</td>', 'Beautiful. Cute little guy. I would like to see the other duckling(s) or crop the left side a little to hide the other little fuzzball. I''m not sure I like the drops falling from the adult, but it''s still a great capture. Thanks for sharing it with us.', '2004-05-17 17:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(723221, 75844, 17505, '<td valign="top">Good choice of black &amp; white. I would have cropped it a little lower to avoid the other tree which is intruding on the frame. It''s very still a very nice shot.</td>', 'Good choice of black & white. I would have cropped it a little lower to avoid the other tree which is intruding on the frame. It''s very still a very nice shot.', '2004-05-17 17:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(723264, 75562, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of your composition. My only complaint is the black napkin (?) directly behind the glasses - otherwise I love the duplication of the other iced tea glasses in the BG. Your DOF is very nice - soft and still maintains shape.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of your composition. My only complaint is the black napkin (?) directly behind the glasses - otherwise I love the duplication of the other iced tea glasses in the BG. Your DOF is very nice - soft and still maintains shape.', '2004-05-17 17:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(723267, 75975, 19780, '<td valign="top">This is a highly original view of this challenge. I like the perspective and the line of the railing as it goes from foreground left to bg right - ending visually with the post and countdown. I''m curious to see it in color - I like the monochrome choice for the challenge.</td>', 'This is a highly original view of this challenge. I like the perspective and the line of the railing as it goes from foreground left to bg right - ending visually with the post and countdown. I''m curious to see it in color - I like the monochrome choice for the challenge.', '2004-05-17 17:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(723271, 75411, 19780, '<td valign="top">An interesting composition of lights - very soft and I''m not sure if that''s intentional. The blacks are very dark, which highlights the theme of the challenge well. The colors are super - rich and luminous. I like the different directions going on - the arrow, and then all the upright signs.</td>', 'An interesting composition of lights - very soft and I''m not sure if that''s intentional. The blacks are very dark, which highlights the theme of the challenge well. The colors are super - rich and luminous. I like the different directions going on - the arrow, and then all the upright signs.', '2004-05-17 17:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(723278, 75998, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the position here in your composition of the candle up and off-center. The DOF and focus on the water lends itself to your title and interpretation of the challenge well. I might have liked to see more of a diagonal, but I recognize the limitations of the compostion based on all light eminating from the candle.</td>', 'I like the position here in your composition of the candle up and off-center. The DOF and focus on the water lends itself to your title and interpretation of the challenge well. I might have liked to see more of a diagonal, but I recognize the limitations of the compostion based on all light eminating from the candle.', '2004-05-17 17:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(723280, 75437, 19780, '<td valign="top">Fascinating capture! I love the detail, all the hais and translucence of the wings. The dirt and dust is a little distracting but not enough to lower the score (could easily be fixed w/clone but not under open challenge rules)</td>', 'Fascinating capture! I love the detail, all the hais and translucence of the wings. The dirt and dust is a little distracting but not enough to lower the score (could easily be fixed w/clone but not under open challenge rules)', '2004-05-17 17:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(723282, 75520, 19780, '<td valign="top">NIce composition, I like the choice of portrait aspect ratio - with so much of the space filled with green to highlight the color differences in the sheep.</td>', 'NIce composition, I like the choice of portrait aspect ratio - with so much of the space filled with green to highlight the color differences in the sheep.', '2004-05-17 17:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(723287, 75992, 19780, '<td valign="top">An interesting still life composition. I ilke your dof and the detail captured in the textures of the different fabrics and fasteners/patche. I have difficulty fitting it into the challenge topic but it''s very well executed - your concept comes through clearly from your title.</td>', 'An interesting still life composition. I ilke your dof and the detail captured in the textures of the different fabrics and fasteners/patche. I have difficulty fitting it into the challenge topic but it''s very well executed - your concept comes through clearly from your title.', '2004-05-17 17:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(723307, 75154, 21912, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting on this shot.</td>', 'Lovely lighting on this shot.', '2004-05-17 18:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(723316, 74588, 20018, '<td valign="top">nice ghost-like image. I like the way you used the sloping horizon meeting the sky</td>', 'nice ghost-like image. I like the way you used the sloping horizon meeting the sky', '2004-05-17 18:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(723318, 76122, 20018, '<td valign="top">very cool concept...cropping out the glass, and desaturating the pic might have helped...great shot though especially the angle</td>', 'very cool concept...cropping out the glass, and desaturating the pic might have helped...great shot though especially the angle', '2004-05-17 18:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(723324, 76126, 20018, '<td valign="top">love this!  only other comment or wish might be that the points of light in the center top of the glass look out of place/distracting</td>', 'love this!  only other comment or wish might be that the points of light in the center top of the glass look out of place/distracting', '2004-05-17 18:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(723332, 76061, 20018, '<td valign="top">i like the use of the veil.</td>', 'i like the use of the veil.', '2004-05-17 18:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(723342, 75854, 20018, '<td valign="top">great capture &amp;  great idea</td>', 'great capture &  great idea', '2004-05-17 18:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(723344, 75386, 20018, '<td valign="top">very...very...er...scary</td>', 'very...very...er...scary', '2004-05-17 18:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(723354, 76109, 20018, '<td valign="top">one of the better fire/ice ones</td>', 'one of the better fire/ice ones', '2004-05-17 18:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(723361, 75898, 20018, '<td valign="top">pictures of male thongs = automatic -3 points.... &gt;:)</td>', 'pictures of male thongs = automatic -3 points.... >:)', '2004-05-17 18:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(723367, 75245, 20018, '<td valign="top">very interesting and engaging image</td>', 'very interesting and engaging image', '2004-05-17 18:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(723385, 75854, 21916, '<td valign="top">Not only is this a great picture, it is also IMHO the best capture of opposites in this contest. Great work!</td>', 'Not only is this a great picture, it is also IMHO the best capture of opposites in this contest. Great work!', '2004-05-17 18:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(723498, 76126, 14053, '<td valign="top">Half empty or half full is the same</td>', 'Half empty or half full is the same', '2004-05-17 19:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(723501, 75411, 16126, '<td valign="top">Colors are interesting, but the image is so out of focus and so dark that I don''t find it attractive, sorry.</td>', 'Colors are interesting, but the image is so out of focus and so dark that I don''t find it attractive, sorry.', '2004-05-17 19:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(723518, 75430, 20235, '<td valign="top">I like this picture. Very dramatic shot that speaks volumes. I think revealing more detail in the structures (particularly the closest fence) would have increased the images impact slightly.</td>', 'I like this picture. Very dramatic shot that speaks volumes. I think revealing more detail in the structures (particularly the closest fence) would have increased the images impact slightly.', '2004-05-17 19:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(723521, 75840, 20235, '<td valign="top">Might have been better if the subject was more centrally framed since I''m not sure the darkness in the background really adds to the picture</td>', 'Might have been better if the subject was more centrally framed since I''m not sure the darkness in the background really adds to the picture', '2004-05-17 19:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(723522, 75816, 20235, '<td valign="top">Really nice picture. It perfectly captures the essence of opposites in theme, color, size, and contrast.</td>', 'Really nice picture. It perfectly captures the essence of opposites in theme, color, size, and contrast.', '2004-05-17 19:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(723525, 76094, 20235, '<td valign="top">Picture is a little small so it''s hard to judge. Looks like some really nice effects that could have been better shown with a bigger pic</td>', 'Picture is a little small so it''s hard to judge. Looks like some really nice effects that could have been better shown with a bigger pic', '2004-05-17 19:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(723526, 76109, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. I like how the opposites are emphasized using reflection</td>', 'Very nice shot. I like how the opposites are emphasized using reflection', '2004-05-17 19:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(723528, 75477, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very creative and interesting picture to look at.</td>', 'Very creative and interesting picture to look at.', '2004-05-17 19:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(723535, 75250, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and contrasting colors</td>', 'Nice composition and contrasting colors', '2004-05-17 20:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(723550, 75456, 21313, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph... I really like how the back one is in focus, not the front!</td>', 'Beautiful photograph... I really like how the back one is in focus, not the front!', '2004-05-17 20:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(723551, 75681, 20235, '<td valign="top">Looks like the camera is tilted clockwise. Otherwise nice shot that plays off the lighting very well.</td>', 'Looks like the camera is tilted clockwise. Otherwise nice shot that plays off the lighting very well.', '2004-05-17 20:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(723575, 75715, 20235, '<td valign="top">Picture is too small but nice shot otherwise</td>', 'Picture is too small but nice shot otherwise', '2004-05-17 20:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(723582, 75752, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colors. Some areas look a little grainy.</td>', 'Nice composition and colors. Some areas look a little grainy.', '2004-05-17 20:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(723596, 76009, 19944, '<td valign="top">Very interesting, but I can''t feel a bit of sympathy for the owners of those homes....I hope they got a good deal. 8</td>', 'Very interesting, but I can''t feel a bit of sympathy for the owners of those homes....I hope they got a good deal. 8', '2004-05-17 20:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(723606, 75175, 20235, '<td valign="top">The date stamp needs to go</td>', 'The date stamp needs to go', '2004-05-17 21:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(723613, 76009, 2223, '<td valign="top">Thats just wrong!!! I bet those houses are dirt cheap though.8</td>', 'Thats just wrong!!! I bet those houses are dirt cheap though.8', '2004-05-17 21:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(723618, 75046, 18505, '<td valign="top">Exquisite.  Love the expression.  You got my only 10 for this challenge so far.</td>', 'Exquisite.  Love the expression.  You got my only 10 for this challenge so far.', '2004-05-17 21:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(723630, 74588, 2223, '<td valign="top">This can be such a great image, but the clouds look to blurry, was this intentional? Did you use a tripod?6</td>', 'This can be such a great image, but the clouds look to blurry, was this intentional? Did you use a tripod?6', '2004-05-17 21:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(723632, 76017, 13937, '<td valign="top">Excellent message, well stated.</td>', 'Excellent message, well stated.', '2004-05-17 21:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
