(723650, 75928, 7252, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look like it''s sublimating. However, I think you could improve this by choosing a darker pan so there is more contrast in the scene. I would also allow more room at the top because you are trying to show how a solid goes to a gas without first becoming a liquid so the vapor is a primary element. Might also be better to use dry ice next time too.</td>', 'Doesn''t look like it''s sublimating. However, I think you could improve this by choosing a darker pan so there is more contrast in the scene. I would also allow more room at the top because you are trying to show how a solid goes to a gas without first becoming a liquid so the vapor is a primary element. Might also be better to use dry ice next time too.', '2004-05-17 21:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
