(724284, 75676, 8891, '<td valign="top">I like this...I think it could be better by a bit more contrast,  it appears a bit bright to me.  Also the near subject could be cropped a bit left...I would like to see here see the chop more centered on her and less of a crop on the right as the far subject is too crowded in the frame and maybe just a little more definition on the far subject as well.  Great idea!</td>', 'I like this...I think it could be better by a bit more contrast,  it appears a bit bright to me.  Also the near subject could be cropped a bit left...I would like to see here see the chop more centered on her and less of a crop on the right as the far subject is too crowded in the frame and maybe just a little more definition on the far subject as well.  Great idea!', '2004-05-18 09:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
