(724316, 75681, 19841, '<td valign="top">I understand your desire to use backlighting to highlight the chess pieces, and it worked well for that, but the resulting glare on the chess board spoils it.</td>', 'I understand your desire to use backlighting to highlight the chess pieces, and it worked well for that, but the resulting glare on the chess board spoils it.', '2004-05-18 10:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(724318, 75648, 19670, '<td valign="top">Good idea in trying to portray many opposites. I see the opposite leg and shoe, and dress vs. pants, I guess, but how is it color? And what''s the opposite size? Is there such a thing?...maybe the smallest and largest size would work, but these look pretty close. Could have done without the border.</td>', 'Good idea in trying to portray many opposites. I see the opposite leg and shoe, and dress vs. pants, I guess, but how is it color? And what''s the opposite size? Is there such a thing?...maybe the smallest and largest size would work, but these look pretty close. Could have done without the border.', '2004-05-18 10:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
