(724348, 76094, 20027, '<td valign="top">Make sure your largest dimension is 640 pixels. This image is to small to make out the details. If using photoshop, use "save for web" and adjust the slider until the size is just under 150k.</td>', 'Make sure your largest dimension is 640 pixels. This image is to small to make out the details. If using photoshop, use "save for web" and adjust the slider until the size is just under 150k.', '2004-05-18 11:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
