(724414, 75823, 18525, '<td valign="top">I scored you a  7 on the first day of voting I did not get around to commenting till today the last day of voting.<br/> <br/>It is a nice night photo ,clear well exposed .<br/>I get your opposites theme it just does not jump out and grab you the way others do.<br/>While the pool looks inviting I would say the photo holds little interest after the first couple of views.<br/>It looks a lot like a brochure shot for the resort ,but I bet it is a nice keepsake for you.<br/> <br/>Good Luck</td>', 'I scored you a  7 on the first day of voting I did not get around to commenting till today the last day of voting. It is a nice night photo ,clear well exposed .I get your opposites theme it just does not jump out and grab you the way others do.While the pool looks inviting I would say the photo holds little interest after the first couple of views.It looks a lot like a brochure shot for the resort ,but I bet it is a nice keepsake for you. Good Luck', '2004-05-18 12:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
