(724905, 75913, 17505, '<td valign="top">Good angle, nice lighting, I also like the little bits of yellow on the props that tie everything together. You''ve created a very solid still life.</td>', 'Good angle, nice lighting, I also like the little bits of yellow on the props that tie everything together. You''ve created a very solid still life.', '2004-05-18 17:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(724907, 76031, 15810, '<td valign="top">So I reckon 5 seconds to come up with tis idea and about 3 mins to upload and post....time well spent?</td>', 'So I reckon 5 seconds to come up with tis idea and about 3 mins to upload and post....time well spent?', '2004-05-18 17:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
