(724909, 76087, 17505, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shapes. I also like that there are only two colors, it draws attention to the lines and shapes. Simple and effective. Nice shot.</td>', 'Very interesting shapes. I also like that there are only two colors, it draws attention to the lines and shapes. Simple and effective. Nice shot.', '2004-05-18 17:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(724910, 76073, 21542, '<td valign="top">Both the iconography and the angles of this shot capture my attention right from the start.  Conceptually, this is among the best shots I''ve seen in this contest (opposites).  I think the statement may have been more strongly served by baffling your lights such that no red fell on the cross, and no blue fell on the pentagram.  The edging on the pentagram is faint enough to ignore, but the red edge on the cross is so noticeable as to confuse the sense of color involved in your statement.</td>', 'Both the iconography and the angles of this shot capture my attention right from the start.  Conceptually, this is among the best shots I''ve seen in this contest (opposites).  I think the statement may have been more strongly served by baffling your lights such that no red fell on the cross, and no blue fell on the pentagram.  The edging on the pentagram is faint enough to ignore, but the red edge on the cross is so noticeable as to confuse the sense of color involved in your statement.', '2004-05-18 17:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(724912, 75242, 15810, '<td valign="top">Lovely take on the challenge, the picture isn''t screaming "opposites" to me but I admire your different entry and it''s a great photo as well......thank god it''s not another ice cube over a flame ;-)</td>', 'Lovely take on the challenge, the picture isn''t screaming "opposites" to me but I admire your different entry and it''s a great photo as well......thank god it''s not another ice cube over a flame ;-)', '2004-05-18 17:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(724913, 75749, 19780, '<td valign="top">Great capture - I like the spikyness of the sparks and the hot reflection on the handles. Great composition.</td>', 'Great capture - I like the spikyness of the sparks and the hot reflection on the handles. Great composition.', '2004-05-18 17:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(724915, 75892, 21542, '<td valign="top">GREAT statement!  It actually takes a moment''s thought, and I love that in an artistic rendering!  While there does appear to be just a bit of noise, and possibly a little lens dust involved, it doesn''t significantly detract from the shot.  Also, I''m noticing a fair bit of moire in the background, but I''m willing to lay odds that''s simply a matter of downsampling for submission -- it probably doesn''t appear in the original.  All in all, I''m very fond of this one!</td>', 'GREAT statement!  It actually takes a moment''s thought, and I love that in an artistic rendering!  While there does appear to be just a bit of noise, and possibly a little lens dust involved, it doesn''t significantly detract from the shot.  Also, I''m noticing a fair bit of moire in the background, but I''m willing to lay odds that''s simply a matter of downsampling for submission -- it probably doesn''t appear in the original.  All in all, I''m very fond of this one!', '2004-05-18 17:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(724916, 75744, 19780, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept - very well executed. I love the mellow colors from the window and the light is not too bright. I might have liked to see the computer on (but I understand photographing a screen isn''t the easiest thing to do). Strong composition with the lines of the gothic arch and open windows.</td>', 'Interesting concept - very well executed. I love the mellow colors from the window and the light is not too bright. I might have liked to see the computer on (but I understand photographing a screen isn''t the easiest thing to do). Strong composition with the lines of the gothic arch and open windows.', '2004-05-18 17:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(724917, 75503, 15810, '<td valign="top">A couple doesn''t really say opposites to me. I can see how man and woman could be opposites but the photograph would need to do more to pitch them against each other to work, rather than the closeness depicted here</td>', 'A couple doesn''t really say opposites to me. I can see how man and woman could be opposites but the photograph would need to do more to pitch them against each other to work, rather than the closeness depicted here', '2004-05-18 17:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(724918, 75913, 19780, '<td valign="top">Very nicely executed - the colors are great and the angle is really wonderful - a strong way to compose this otherwise lackluster subject.</td>', 'Very nicely executed - the colors are great and the angle is really wonderful - a strong way to compose this otherwise lackluster subject.', '2004-05-18 17:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(724919, 75968, 16301, '<td valign="top">Very nice arrangement, its a nice way to show black and white, I hope its not getting voted down just because it has chess peices.<br/> <br/>Good luck...</td>', 'Very nice arrangement, its a nice way to show black and white, I hope its not getting voted down just because it has chess peices. Good luck...', '2004-05-18 17:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(724920, 76055, 19780, '<td valign="top">Beautiful abstract shapes and color. I like the wide ratio of the photo and the choice of the slight green blending at the bottom of the center.</td>', 'Beautiful abstract shapes and color. I like the wide ratio of the photo and the choice of the slight green blending at the bottom of the center.', '2004-05-18 17:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(724921, 75271, 19780, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture - I wish it was bigger, but it gets the point across instantly.</td>', 'Excellent capture - I wish it was bigger, but it gets the point across instantly.', '2004-05-18 17:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(724922, 75321, 16301, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition, its a nice and simple way to show black and white.<br/> <br/>Good job...</td>', 'Very nice composition, its a nice and simple way to show black and white. Good job...', '2004-05-18 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(724924, 75466, 19780, '<td valign="top">A great idea, but the dim lighting makes the details rather mushy. Perhaps a different background.</td>', 'A great idea, but the dim lighting makes the details rather mushy. Perhaps a different background.', '2004-05-18 17:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(724925, 74744, 21542, '<td valign="top">I can honestly say that I have now looked at more "Fire &amp; Ice" shots than I ever care to again, and I have rated only one above a three.  The focus lines in this piece are very ambiguous, and the ice is underplayed to the point of detrimental to the shot.  I just don''t think it emphasises the ice enough to reach a very bold statement of "opposites".</td>', 'I can honestly say that I have now looked at more "Fire & Ice" shots than I ever care to again, and I have rated only one above a three.  The focus lines in this piece are very ambiguous, and the ice is underplayed to the point of detrimental to the shot.  I just don''t think it emphasises the ice enough to reach a very bold statement of "opposites".', '2004-05-18 17:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(724926, 75986, 19780, '<td valign="top">A nice set up and good sense of composition. I''d like to see a bit crisper focus and maybe a little bit truer blacks.</td>', 'A nice set up and good sense of composition. I''d like to see a bit crisper focus and maybe a little bit truer blacks.', '2004-05-18 17:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(724927, 75401, 16301, '<td valign="top">Beautiful way to show New and Old, the tone is really good. Good luck...</td>', 'Beautiful way to show New and Old, the tone is really good. Good luck...', '2004-05-18 17:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(724928, 75924, 19780, '<td valign="top">I love this photo - the contrary directions and the worn paint. The colors are great, I even like the little pine needles in frame.</td>', 'I love this photo - the contrary directions and the worn paint. The colors are great, I even like the little pine needles in frame.', '2004-05-18 17:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(724929, 76032, 15810, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, colour &amp; DOF. It''s not really saying "opposites" to me though.</td>', 'Nice focus, colour & DOF. It''s not really saying "opposites" to me though.', '2004-05-18 17:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(724930, 76062, 15810, '<td valign="top">For "out of place" yes this would be great as "opposites" I dont think it works.</td>', 'For "out of place" yes this would be great as "opposites" I dont think it works.', '2004-05-18 17:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(724931, 75744, 16301, '<td valign="top">Ancient and Modern windows? Great idea, the composition is really good and it is well executed.<br/> <br/>Great job...</td>', 'Ancient and Modern windows? Great idea, the composition is really good and it is well executed. Great job...', '2004-05-18 17:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(724932, 75364, 19780, '<td valign="top">Interesting way to interpret the challenge - the geese captured in frame are great, but the idea of no wakes isn''t quite illustrated by the photo - it''s only in the title. I like the turquoise of the boat and the color of the water.</td>', 'Interesting way to interpret the challenge - the geese captured in frame are great, but the idea of no wakes isn''t quite illustrated by the photo - it''s only in the title. I like the turquoise of the boat and the color of the water.', '2004-05-18 17:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(724933, 75504, 20809, '<td valign="top">best empty/full glass shot of the lot.</td>', 'best empty/full glass shot of the lot.', '2004-05-18 17:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(724934, 76029, 15810, '<td valign="top">Very nice arty shot. Strikingly obvious opposites and a well executed photo. Well done</td>', 'Very nice arty shot. Strikingly obvious opposites and a well executed photo. Well done', '2004-05-18 17:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(724935, 74981, 19780, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and texture. Your sense of composition is wonderful with the curve of the stem and the twist of the but combined with the large swaths of color from the petals and leaves in the background.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and texture. Your sense of composition is wonderful with the curve of the stem and the twist of the but combined with the large swaths of color from the petals and leaves in the background.', '2004-05-18 17:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(724936, 76069, 16301, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, the background color fits well with the firecrackers.<br/> <br/>Good job...</td>', 'Nice idea, the background color fits well with the firecrackers. Good job...', '2004-05-18 17:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(724937, 75262, 21542, '<td valign="top">for a title of "Sea &amp; Sky", this shot encompasses far too much land.  The bridge, too, becomes a primary focus that required me to look at the title to discover what opposite was being struck here.  And I while I will certainly grant that trying to get rich, opposing colors out of water and sky can be next to impossible, having the only bold color statement in a picture thus entitled be the green of the grass completely defeats any other color statement that could have been made here.</td>', 'for a title of "Sea & Sky", this shot encompasses far too much land.  The bridge, too, becomes a primary focus that required me to look at the title to discover what opposite was being struck here.  And I while I will certainly grant that trying to get rich, opposing colors out of water and sky can be next to impossible, having the only bold color statement in a picture thus entitled be the green of the grass completely defeats any other color statement that could have been made here.', '2004-05-18 17:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(724938, 76086, 19780, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful candid capture. I like that everyone is facing the camera and the lighting for the walking people is quite nice. I might like more light on the foreground couple seated, but an excellent urban shot.</td>', 'This is a wonderful candid capture. I like that everyone is facing the camera and the lighting for the walking people is quite nice. I might like more light on the foreground couple seated, but an excellent urban shot.', '2004-05-18 17:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(724939, 75761, 16301, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, the choice of color really fits with the lighting.<br/> <br/>Good job...</td>', 'Nice idea, the choice of color really fits with the lighting. Good job...', '2004-05-18 17:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(724940, 75780, 15810, '<td valign="top">Nuts and bolts are two things I would associate as having a very strong close bond, they wouldnt exist without each other..definately not opposites.</td>', 'Nuts and bolts are two things I would associate as having a very strong close bond, they wouldnt exist without each other..definately not opposites.', '2004-05-18 17:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(724941, 76004, 16301, '<td valign="top">This is funny! I like it, you captured it at the right moment. A black border wouldn''t hurt. Great job...</td>', 'This is funny! I like it, you captured it at the right moment. A black border wouldn''t hurt. Great job...', '2004-05-18 17:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(724942, 75738, 15810, '<td valign="top">excellent, I''ll bet you''ve provoked some "yuk" reactions with this one which is a great achievement for a photo to force that recoil reaction...well done.</td>', 'excellent, I''ll bet you''ve provoked some "yuk" reactions with this one which is a great achievement for a photo to force that recoil reaction...well done.', '2004-05-18 17:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(724943, 75104, 21542, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the concept, and I think this shot makes a good statement.  But at the same time, it lacks....  something.  I really couldn''t say what, but it just doesn''t jump out at me.  Maybe a different background color to offset the cold tone of the metal?  Maybe a more simplistic metal (say, one ring instead of three?) to streamline the angles a bit more?  I''m really not sure.</td>', 'I enjoy the concept, and I think this shot makes a good statement.  But at the same time, it lacks....  something.  I really couldn''t say what, but it just doesn''t jump out at me.  Maybe a different background color to offset the cold tone of the metal?  Maybe a more simplistic metal (say, one ring instead of three?) to streamline the angles a bit more?  I''m really not sure.', '2004-05-18 17:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(724944, 74764, 15287, '<td valign="top">Not quite as sharp as I would like, although I do enjoy the blue flames.</td>', 'Not quite as sharp as I would like, although I do enjoy the blue flames.', '2004-05-18 17:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(724945, 75203, 16301, '<td valign="top">Very nice and original idea, it is well executed. B&amp;W was a good choice.<br/> <br/>Good job...</td>', 'Very nice and original idea, it is well executed. B&W was a good choice. Good job...', '2004-05-18 17:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(724946, 75386, 15810, '<td valign="top">Brilliant, great idea done really well. Very weird,  very compelling and very good.</td>', 'Brilliant, great idea done really well. Very weird,  very compelling and very good.', '2004-05-18 17:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(724952, 74631, 21542, '<td valign="top">The concept is stong, and I''m also fond of the angle.  In my opinion, though, the shot would have been better served by a much tighter crop, and less of an overall gradient in the lighting (the keys in the foreground are too washed out, while the keys in the background are too dark).  A crop encompassing, say, F# through C would have probably served you better.</td>', 'The concept is stong, and I''m also fond of the angle.  In my opinion, though, the shot would have been better served by a much tighter crop, and less of an overall gradient in the lighting (the keys in the foreground are too washed out, while the keys in the background are too dark).  A crop encompassing, say, F# through C would have probably served you better.', '2004-05-18 17:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(724959, 76102, 20521, '<td valign="top">like the composition and colours</td>', 'like the composition and colours', '2004-05-18 17:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(724960, 75386, 21542, '<td valign="top">Normally I''m a devoted fan of B&amp;W''s and Sepias.  In this instance, though, especially using a model with such vivid and striking eyes, I feel that color would have been your best tool to show the "opposites".  Having the rich reds of the lipstick, the blue or green of a heavy eyeshadow, and the other richness that color would have lent the piece would have most likely made a significant difference.</td>', 'Normally I''m a devoted fan of B&W''s and Sepias.  In this instance, though, especially using a model with such vivid and striking eyes, I feel that color would have been your best tool to show the "opposites".  Having the rich reds of the lipstick, the blue or green of a heavy eyeshadow, and the other richness that color would have lent the piece would have most likely made a significant difference.', '2004-05-18 17:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(724963, 76027, 21542, '<td valign="top">Great concept, fantastic angle, and the blur of moving person in the foreground opposed to the still figure in the background all lend this shot a good number.  But since your main focus is on the text in the picture, a greater depth of field would have been appreciated, creating a greater legibility of "downtown".</td>', 'Great concept, fantastic angle, and the blur of moving person in the foreground opposed to the still figure in the background all lend this shot a good number.  But since your main focus is on the text in the picture, a greater depth of field would have been appreciated, creating a greater legibility of "downtown".', '2004-05-18 17:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(724964, 76087, 21542, '<td valign="top">good topic, great angle, and the lighting''s pretty darned good, too!  I especially enjoy the modern-esque reflections in the windows, helping to embolden the statement.</td>', 'good topic, great angle, and the lighting''s pretty darned good, too!  I especially enjoy the modern-esque reflections in the windows, helping to embolden the statement.', '2004-05-18 17:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(724965, 76117, 20521, '<td valign="top">i like the mood of it. and the colours.</td>', 'i like the mood of it. and the colours.', '2004-05-18 17:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(724968, 75972, 21542, '<td valign="top">Overall, I love this piece!  My only criticisms, and I should mention that they are VERY minor ones, are that I would have prefered to see the same texture in the white background as I see in the black, and you may have been better served by shifting the image to a true B&amp;W to eliviate the tonal differences between the "white" knight and the "white" background" -- I do find each of those just the slightest bit distracting.</td>', 'Overall, I love this piece!  My only criticisms, and I should mention that they are VERY minor ones, are that I would have prefered to see the same texture in the white background as I see in the black, and you may have been better served by shifting the image to a true B&W to eliviate the tonal differences between the "white" knight and the "white" background" -- I do find each of those just the slightest bit distracting.', '2004-05-18 18:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(724972, 75489, 20521, '<td valign="top">i am not a frame''s friend nevertheless i like your picture. a more unusual perspective would have been better - probably.</td>', 'i am not a frame''s friend nevertheless i like your picture. a more unusual perspective would have been better - probably.', '2004-05-18 18:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(724973, 75818, 21542, '<td valign="top">(while I realize this isn''t a terribly helpful comment, I can''t come up with anything else...)<br/> <br/>huh?!</td>', '(while I realize this isn''t a terribly helpful comment, I can''t come up with anything else...) huh?!', '2004-05-18 18:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(724974, 75052, 21513, '<td valign="top">The dark beach is almost as bright as the bright sky ...</td>', 'The dark beach is almost as bright as the bright sky ...', '2004-05-18 18:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(724975, 75558, 21542, '<td valign="top">absolutely perfect shot in every way I can think of, right down to the flowing Stars &amp; Stripes opposite the crisp Confederate Cross!</td>', 'absolutely perfect shot in every way I can think of, right down to the flowing Stars & Stripes opposite the crisp Confederate Cross!', '2004-05-18 18:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(724976, 75052, 21542, '<td valign="top">for a beach/sky picture, there''s just too much middle ground.  Also, all of your movement is happenning in that middle ground, and that will draw my eye every time.</td>', 'for a beach/sky picture, there''s just too much middle ground.  Also, all of your movement is happenning in that middle ground, and that will draw my eye every time.', '2004-05-18 18:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(724977, 75907, 21542, '<td valign="top">I can honestly say that the number of "Fire &amp; Ice" shots in this competition has been relatively obscene, but this is also only the second that I have scored over a 2!  Very nicely done, regardless of the predictable topic.</td>', 'I can honestly say that the number of "Fire & Ice" shots in this competition has been relatively obscene, but this is also only the second that I have scored over a 2!  Very nicely done, regardless of the predictable topic.', '2004-05-18 18:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(724978, 75681, 21542, '<td valign="top">the reflections in general, and the "light bath" of the right side of the board detract from this shot far too much for my tastes.</td>', 'the reflections in general, and the "light bath" of the right side of the board detract from this shot far too much for my tastes.', '2004-05-18 18:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(724980, 76093, 21542, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but there''s too much of a grey cast to the shot and not nearly enough color to embolden the statement enough to get it past a 4.</td>', 'I like the concept, but there''s too much of a grey cast to the shot and not nearly enough color to embolden the statement enough to get it past a 4.', '2004-05-18 18:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(724981, 75917, 21542, '<td valign="top">a bit better focus, and I couldn''t have asked for more!  Still, a solid concept (and the fact that you used ice and didn''t feel you had to tie it to fire to get the opposite scores you major bonus points in my world!)</td>', 'a bit better focus, and I couldn''t have asked for more!  Still, a solid concept (and the fact that you used ice and didn''t feel you had to tie it to fire to get the opposite scores you major bonus points in my world!)', '2004-05-18 18:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(724982, 75976, 11324, '<td valign="top">What I am seeing here:  black and white; under and over; and the least obvious but MOST thought provoking:  liquid and solid / water and ice.  This composition is truly genius.  How did you do this?  It looks like you froze a chess board in a block of ice.  You deserve to win this competition by a long shot - truly the most amazing photo I have seen on DPChallenge for a looooong time.  With this photograph, you have managed to rekindle my passion for photography and for DPChallenge.  A well-deserved 10 for what promises to be a well-deserved 1st place blue ribbon!</td>', 'What I am seeing here:  black and white; under and over; and the least obvious but MOST thought provoking:  liquid and solid / water and ice.  This composition is truly genius.  How did you do this?  It looks like you froze a chess board in a block of ice.  You deserve to win this competition by a long shot - truly the most amazing photo I have seen on DPChallenge for a looooong time.  With this photograph, you have managed to rekindle my passion for photography and for DPChallenge.  A well-deserved 10 for what promises to be a well-deserved 1st place blue ribbon!', '2004-05-18 18:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(724987, 75291, 19780, '<td valign="top">A good capture. I like the lighting and how the contours of the face are scultped by it. I wouldn''t mind a closer crop to see more detail at this size. Good muted, moody colors too.</td>', 'A good capture. I like the lighting and how the contours of the face are scultped by it. I wouldn''t mind a closer crop to see more detail at this size. Good muted, moody colors too.', '2004-05-18 18:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(724990, 75903, 19780, '<td valign="top">The proportions on these items are really odd. That''s big chalk, or small cheese and that''s what I notice most of all in this photo. I think to highlight the difference between the smoothness of the cheese and the chalk there should be a little bit of dust and maybe a different background - the fabric feels a little off to me. <br/> <br/>Excellent macro capture - the texutres and colors are great - the lighting is good. I''d adjust the DOF a little bit to keep the chalk sharp though. Nice work.</td>', 'The proportions on these items are really odd. That''s big chalk, or small cheese and that''s what I notice most of all in this photo. I think to highlight the difference between the smoothness of the cheese and the chalk there should be a little bit of dust and maybe a different background - the fabric feels a little off to me.  Excellent macro capture - the texutres and colors are great - the lighting is good. I''d adjust the DOF a little bit to keep the chalk sharp though. Nice work.', '2004-05-18 18:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(724991, 76026, 19780, '<td valign="top">Very cool capture. The flames are just wonderful - I like how they form a bit of cup shape jsut like the ice does in the center. The colors are really nice.</td>', 'Very cool capture. The flames are just wonderful - I like how they form a bit of cup shape jsut like the ice does in the center. The colors are really nice.', '2004-05-18 18:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(724993, 75670, 19780, '<td valign="top">Great black and white caputre. I love the difference in value of the gravel and the exposure on the rails. I''d like to see it slightly sharper so we can appreciate the textures of the ties.</td>', 'Great black and white caputre. I love the difference in value of the gravel and the exposure on the rails. I''d like to see it slightly sharper so we can appreciate the textures of the ties.', '2004-05-18 18:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(725006, 76073, 21513, '<td valign="top">Simple and cool. Very clear opposites and excellent use of colors. I like it.</td>', 'Simple and cool. Very clear opposites and excellent use of colors. I like it.', '2004-05-18 18:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(725010, 75873, 21513, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea. A very creative way to express the subject of opposites. Good work.</td>', 'Excellent idea. A very creative way to express the subject of opposites. Good work.', '2004-05-18 18:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(725012, 76019, 21513, '<td valign="top">Creative and colorful. I like it.</td>', 'Creative and colorful. I like it.', '2004-05-18 18:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(725013, 75940, 21513, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea. Fits the challenge in a way I like. Using the water to get results better than most would achieve with advanced editing in Photoshop is outstanding. My favorite photo in this challenge. 9.</td>', 'Very cool idea. Fits the challenge in a way I like. Using the water to get results better than most would achieve with advanced editing in Photoshop is outstanding. My favorite photo in this challenge. 9.', '2004-05-18 18:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(725068, 76046, 21635, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2004-05-18 19:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(725071, 76029, 19841, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but the paint on the white fork is really unappetizing.  It would have been worth your time to run to the corner store and get a real white plastic fork for this idea.</td>', 'Sorry, but the paint on the white fork is really unappetizing.  It would have been worth your time to run to the corner store and get a real white plastic fork for this idea.', '2004-05-18 19:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(725096, 75763, 18191, '<td valign="top">Beatles :)</td>', 'Beatles :)', '2004-05-18 19:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(725111, 75924, 19841, '<td valign="top">It''s not clear what the image is.</td>', 'It''s not clear what the image is.', '2004-05-18 19:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(725118, 74727, 19780, '<td valign="top">Very interesting take on the challenge - old school/high tech. I like the exposure - I know some will think it''s a little overexposed but I think it gives the shadows a nice techy quality that''s appropriate for the concept of the shot. I like the perspective too.</td>', 'Very interesting take on the challenge - old school/high tech. I like the exposure - I know some will think it''s a little overexposed but I think it gives the shadows a nice techy quality that''s appropriate for the concept of the shot. I like the perspective too.', '2004-05-18 19:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(725121, 75857, 19780, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the ducks going in two different directions. I like the quality of detail on the foreground duck''s feathers, especially on the back of his neck. The contrast could be bumped up slightly without losing the feather details.</td>', 'Nice capture of the ducks going in two different directions. I like the quality of detail on the foreground duck''s feathers, especially on the back of his neck. The contrast could be bumped up slightly without losing the feather details.', '2004-05-18 19:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(725127, 75838, 19780, '<td valign="top">I''m bugged immediately by the border on this. If it were solid, I think I''d be happier. I do, however, love the subject with its textures and variations and I think it''s a lovely, subtle way to meet the challenge topic.</td>', 'I''m bugged immediately by the border on this. If it were solid, I think I''d be happier. I do, however, love the subject with its textures and variations and I think it''s a lovely, subtle way to meet the challenge topic.', '2004-05-18 19:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(725129, 76109, 19780, '<td valign="top">Very nice reflection - giving it both the opposition of fire and ice, but also up and down. The DOF and exposure are very nice - capturing the essence of the fire very well.</td>', 'Very nice reflection - giving it both the opposition of fire and ice, but also up and down. The DOF and exposure are very nice - capturing the essence of the fire very well.', '2004-05-18 19:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(725131, 74788, 19780, '<td valign="top">Fabulous candid. I love the focus on the woman, and then the motion blur on the child. It gives another sense of opposition - the stillness of age and wisdom compared to the exhuberance and activitiy of youth. I just wish that little window or frame wasn''t up in the background. The textures on her face are wonderful.</td>', 'Fabulous candid. I love the focus on the woman, and then the motion blur on the child. It gives another sense of opposition - the stillness of age and wisdom compared to the exhuberance and activitiy of youth. I just wish that little window or frame wasn''t up in the background. The textures on her face are wonderful.', '2004-05-18 20:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(725138, 75015, 19780, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lush colors. I like your choice of the black base and white background. The texture on the orange and apple are a little lost with the DOF that seems to favor the orange in the background. Great idea, wonderfully executed. You composed the photo very well with excellent use of the negative space on the lower right.</td>', 'Beautiful lush colors. I like your choice of the black base and white background. The texture on the orange and apple are a little lost with the DOF that seems to favor the orange in the background. Great idea, wonderfully executed. You composed the photo very well with excellent use of the negative space on the lower right.', '2004-05-18 20:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(725141, 75184, 19780, '<td valign="top">Lovely pastoral shot - I love that the size of the lambs is identical and that their positions are so charming. I think the contrast could be bumped every so slightly to highlight the black/white difference without losing the detail on the black one''s face.</td>', 'Lovely pastoral shot - I love that the size of the lambs is identical and that their positions are so charming. I think the contrast could be bumped every so slightly to highlight the black/white difference without losing the detail on the black one''s face.', '2004-05-18 20:05:45.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(725143, 75548, 19780, '<td valign="top">Wonderful detail and textures. Their eyes are glassy and clear and really draw the viewer in. The glossyness of the background is a little problematic, as we lose the black cat in it.</td>', 'Wonderful detail and textures. Their eyes are glassy and clear and really draw the viewer in. The glossyness of the background is a little problematic, as we lose the black cat in it.', '2004-05-18 20:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(725147, 75659, 19780, '<td valign="top">Great capture - a concise way to sum up the challenge. I love the textures and the detail of the water beads on the thistle. The backlighting keeps this from being an amazing photo - but it''s still a very good one, your sense of space and DOF is very nice.</td>', 'Great capture - a concise way to sum up the challenge. I love the textures and the detail of the water beads on the thistle. The backlighting keeps this from being an amazing photo - but it''s still a very good one, your sense of space and DOF is very nice.', '2004-05-18 20:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(725148, 74764, 19780, '<td valign="top">How fun! A great new take on the fire and ice idea. I wish the focus was more crisp but the color difference with the blue flame and the white of the ice is really fun along with the centered composition.</td>', 'How fun! A great new take on the fire and ice idea. I wish the focus was more crisp but the color difference with the blue flame and the white of the ice is really fun along with the centered composition.', '2004-05-18 20:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(725150, 76110, 19780, '<td valign="top">How fun! I got this concept intstantly, you framed it very well to tell the story. A wider DOF field would allow us to enjoy the needle as well as making out the spindle. The reflections are great and I like your choice of B&amp;W.</td>', 'How fun! I got this concept intstantly, you framed it very well to tell the story. A wider DOF field would allow us to enjoy the needle as well as making out the spindle. The reflections are great and I like your choice of B&W.', '2004-05-18 20:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(725158, 75854, 19780, '<td valign="top">What an amazing capture. The colors are just wonderful as is your exposure and the framing with the lines in front. I''m not sure the streetlight in the lower right needs to be included, but that''s being very picky on my part. Good luck.</td>', 'What an amazing capture. The colors are just wonderful as is your exposure and the framing with the lines in front. I''m not sure the streetlight in the lower right needs to be included, but that''s being very picky on my part. Good luck.', '2004-05-18 20:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(725161, 75751, 19780, '<td valign="top">Nice lush colors and details - I like the curves of the tulip against the upright grasses. Nicely framed.</td>', 'Nice lush colors and details - I like the curves of the tulip against the upright grasses. Nicely framed.', '2004-05-18 20:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(725166, 75761, 19780, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of monochrome - the fullness of the glass and the differences in reds that go from purple and black to orange and yellow are just wonderful. I ilke that the background is not quite regular, adding to the visual interest.</td>', 'Wonderful use of monochrome - the fullness of the glass and the differences in reds that go from purple and black to orange and yellow are just wonderful. I ilke that the background is not quite regular, adding to the visual interest.', '2004-05-18 20:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(725180, 75548, 4729, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!</td>', 'Gorgeous!', '2004-05-18 20:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(725183, 75907, 4729, '<td valign="top">Great job!</td>', 'Great job!', '2004-05-18 20:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(725191, 76027, 327, '<td valign="top">Really a good find for the challenge. I hope people will look long enough to see.... <br/>? Good job but may be too subtle.</td>', 'Really a good find for the challenge. I hope people will look long enough to see.... ? Good job but may be too subtle.', '2004-05-18 20:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(725192, 75940, 327, '<td valign="top">Amazing reflection. Did you invert the shot? Love the unique idea here. Maybe bump the saturation a bit.</td>', 'Amazing reflection. Did you invert the shot? Love the unique idea here. Maybe bump the saturation a bit.', '2004-05-18 20:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(725193, 76001, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty light and color tone.</td>', 'Pretty light and color tone.', '2004-05-18 20:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(725217, 76004, 19780, '<td valign="top">A wonderful find and great take on the challenge. I love the saturation of colors - the reds and blues are just wonderful. I might crop it to take the woman out - just have dad with the stroller and child in contrast to the naked cowboy (two different directions a man can take with his life).</td>', 'A wonderful find and great take on the challenge. I love the saturation of colors - the reds and blues are just wonderful. I might crop it to take the woman out - just have dad with the stroller and child in contrast to the naked cowboy (two different directions a man can take with his life).', '2004-05-18 21:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(725219, 75601, 19780, '<td valign="top">The colors are just wonderful here- how it''s all muted beige and browns. The subject is actually rather well done, though I get little sense of opposites in this setting. The framing is nice as is the exposure and focus. Did you happen to feed any of these dogs? They look pretty scrawny.</td>', 'The colors are just wonderful here- how it''s all muted beige and browns. The subject is actually rather well done, though I get little sense of opposites in this setting. The framing is nice as is the exposure and focus. Did you happen to feed any of these dogs? They look pretty scrawny.', '2004-05-18 21:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(725223, 75216, 19780, '<td valign="top">What a fun shot - I love how we can see the texture of the pads on the paw in the reflection. The composition is really lovely, with the lines leading the eye to and from the center.</td>', 'What a fun shot - I love how we can see the texture of the pads on the paw in the reflection. The composition is really lovely, with the lines leading the eye to and from the center.', '2004-05-18 21:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(725230, 75242, 19780, '<td valign="top">Great colors and framing. The sense of altitude is a good subject for this challenge. I like the light source and shadow on the rocks in the foreground.</td>', 'Great colors and framing. The sense of altitude is a good subject for this challenge. I like the light source and shadow on the rocks in the foreground.', '2004-05-18 21:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(725235, 75805, 19780, '<td valign="top">A nice capture. I like the greeness of the grass and the difference in the colors of the dogs. The composition is quite good, but the softness of the focus detracts slightly.</td>', 'A nice capture. I like the greeness of the grass and the difference in the colors of the dogs. The composition is quite good, but the softness of the focus detracts slightly.', '2004-05-18 21:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(725237, 74699, 19780, '<td valign="top">I liked this both in the thumbnail and full verison. the differences in color, shadow and texture are really wonderful, you have a great eye for creating something out of the mundane.</td>', 'I liked this both in the thumbnail and full verison. the differences in color, shadow and texture are really wonderful, you have a great eye for creating something out of the mundane.', '2004-05-18 21:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(725239, 75873, 18315, '<td valign="top">I think if you would of used a different background the creature would stand out more.   Good focus and DOF.</td>', 'I think if you would of used a different background the creature would stand out more.   Good focus and DOF.', '2004-05-18 21:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(725243, 74590, 18315, '<td valign="top">I like it, but I would of liked a little more light.</td>', 'I like it, but I would of liked a little more light.', '2004-05-18 21:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(725315, 75271, 9457, '<td valign="top">37 years of age ain''t exactly new, but good shoot, slightly out of focus but higly airworthy ;)</td>', '37 years of age ain''t exactly new, but good shoot, slightly out of focus but higly airworthy ;)', '2004-05-18 22:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(725348, 75750, 3306, '<td valign="top">Incredible capture.</td>', 'Incredible capture.', '2004-05-18 22:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(725361, 74616, 19780, '<td valign="top">Wonderful find - I like your choice of decoloring the phoot. I would have liked a bigger difference in the watches (digital vs analogue). The reflection on the left one is a little distracting. Great simple composition.</td>', 'Wonderful find - I like your choice of decoloring the phoot. I would have liked a bigger difference in the watches (digital vs analogue). The reflection on the left one is a little distracting. Great simple composition.', '2004-05-18 23:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(725362, 75909, 19780, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo - I like the perspective you chose and the saturation of the colors - the similarity with the red of the roses to the reds of the lips is wonderful.</td>', 'Very nice photo - I like the perspective you chose and the saturation of the colors - the similarity with the red of the roses to the reds of the lips is wonderful.', '2004-05-18 23:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(725365, 74991, 19780, '<td valign="top">Great detail and textures for the fur and face. The color is wonderful and the POV is very compelling (eye level). It doesn''t feel like it an "opposite" but a great capture.</td>', 'Great detail and textures for the fur and face. The color is wonderful and the POV is very compelling (eye level). It doesn''t feel like it an "opposite" but a great capture.', '2004-05-18 23:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(725367, 76010, 19780, '<td valign="top">Nice composition - the story is ery compelling and the choice of putting the empty flutes into the bucket really helps to sell it. The "hot" part isn''t quite as apparent (some feet in the background would have helped - it could be an empty room as it is now). Good DOF and exposure.</td>', 'Nice composition - the story is ery compelling and the choice of putting the empty flutes into the bucket really helps to sell it. The "hot" part isn''t quite as apparent (some feet in the background would have helped - it could be an empty room as it is now). Good DOF and exposure.', '2004-05-18 23:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(725369, 75780, 19780, '<td valign="top">A nice shot - I like the POV and DOF on the shot - the simplicity is compelling as is the variety of the positions for the items.</td>', 'A nice shot - I like the POV and DOF on the shot - the simplicity is compelling as is the variety of the positions for the items.', '2004-05-18 23:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(725371, 75932, 19780, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Abstract yet absolutely clear what it means with the difference between the red and white lights. I like your choice of a wide format. I wish the little sign in the median was more visible.</td>', 'Very nice! Abstract yet absolutely clear what it means with the difference between the red and white lights. I like your choice of a wide format. I wish the little sign in the median was more visible.', '2004-05-18 23:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(725380, 75773, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like your framing of the tombstone with the pine boughs. The choice of decolorizing is very interesting and gives more weight to the lines and shapes. The figure isn''t terribly compelling to me and feels a little too posed.</td>', 'I like your framing of the tombstone with the pine boughs. The choice of decolorizing is very interesting and gives more weight to the lines and shapes. The figure isn''t terribly compelling to me and feels a little too posed.', '2004-05-18 23:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(725382, 75991, 19780, '<td valign="top">An interesting choice for the challenge. I think it would be more successful if they shoes were posed or framed a little more interesting - the judge of a shoes appropriateness for an event is not really best shown from above and the flowerpot in the left corner is a little distracting.</td>', 'An interesting choice for the challenge. I think it would be more successful if they shoes were posed or framed a little more interesting - the judge of a shoes appropriateness for an event is not really best shown from above and the flowerpot in the left corner is a little distracting.', '2004-05-18 23:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(725402, 75854, 21977, '<td valign="top">very cool</td>', 'very cool', '2004-05-18 23:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(725404, 75850, 19780, '<td valign="top">A very interesting composition - I like the melted ice in the foreground. The exposure on the flame is very good and the detail on the ice and candle is very good.</td>', 'A very interesting composition - I like the melted ice in the foreground. The exposure on the flame is very good and the detail on the ice and candle is very good.', '2004-05-18 23:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(725408, 76096, 19780, '<td valign="top">Great exposure on the blue flame - a very nice looking abstract as well as for the challenge here. The DOF on the ice is a little strange - it feels like it should be crisp on the far side, not the left side and front.</td>', 'Great exposure on the blue flame - a very nice looking abstract as well as for the challenge here. The DOF on the ice is a little strange - it feels like it should be crisp on the far side, not the left side and front.', '2004-05-18 23:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(725410, 76093, 11518, '<td valign="top">The reflections are distracting, need to bounce the flash.</td>', 'The reflections are distracting, need to bounce the flash.', '2004-05-18 23:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(725422, 75397, 11518, '<td valign="top">too much space behind her, she is too centered.  Need to apply rule of thirds.</td>', 'too much space behind her, she is too centered.  Need to apply rule of thirds.', '2004-05-18 23:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(725430, 75644, 18742, '<td valign="top">how many people submit fire and ice???!!! Be creative!</td>', 'how many people submit fire and ice???!!! Be creative!', '2004-05-18 23:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(725445, 75656, 21611, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Cant stop looking but would have liked to see more foreground ... too much black</td>', 'Nice shot. Cant stop looking but would have liked to see more foreground ... too much black', '2004-05-18 23:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(725447, 76062, 19780, '<td valign="top">A great, offbeat subject for this challenge. I love the difference in the colors - the silvery chrome and the texture of the black paint on the window frame.</td>', 'A great, offbeat subject for this challenge. I love the difference in the colors - the silvery chrome and the texture of the black paint on the window frame.', '2004-05-18 23:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(725449, 75474, 19780, '<td valign="top">The forced perspective that accentuates the size difference between the boots and the bear is quite nice. The reflection on the shiny wall is a little distracting.</td>', 'The forced perspective that accentuates the size difference between the boots and the bear is quite nice. The reflection on the shiny wall is a little distracting.', '2004-05-18 23:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(725450, 76103, 19780, '<td valign="top">Great concept  - the colors are wonderfully lush and fit the challenge well - as if one side of the street is fall and the other is spring.</td>', 'Great concept  - the colors are wonderfully lush and fit the challenge well - as if one side of the street is fall and the other is spring.', '2004-05-18 23:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(725451, 76046, 10614, '<td valign="top">I love the color choices of the featers up against the black weight.  Very nice</td>', 'I love the color choices of the featers up against the black weight.  Very nice', '2004-05-18 23:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(725452, 75749, 10614, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Really nice.</td>', 'Great idea.  Really nice.', '2004-05-18 23:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(725453, 75843, 19780, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo - I like the silhouette around the right figure but I think the left one is a bit overexposed for this style.</td>', 'Interesting photo - I like the silhouette around the right figure but I think the left one is a bit overexposed for this style.', '2004-05-18 23:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(725457, 76009, 19780, '<td valign="top">What an amazing photo - the idea of a little suburban cul-de-sac next to these silos is great. I like the touch of everyone having the same type of car on top of it.</td>', 'What an amazing photo - the idea of a little suburban cul-de-sac next to these silos is great. I like the touch of everyone having the same type of car on top of it.', '2004-05-18 23:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(725459, 75943, 19780, '<td valign="top">The angle on this is very compelling, it gives it an abstract quality. The greens of the algae is a little distracting but I like how you captured the position of the fish.</td>', 'The angle on this is very compelling, it gives it an abstract quality. The greens of the algae is a little distracting but I like how you captured the position of the fish.', '2004-05-18 23:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(725461, 75058, 10614, '<td valign="top">very nice.  extremely creative.</td>', 'very nice.  extremely creative.', '2004-05-18 23:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(725463, 76087, 10614, '<td valign="top">nice capture.  I hope you do well.</td>', 'nice capture.  I hope you do well.', '2004-05-18 23:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(725464, 75930, 19780, '<td valign="top">Very concise and simple. I like the addition of grain, it removes it from reality and gives it more of an abstract feel. The white ball is slightly overexposed (I think) but I like the opposing shadows.</td>', 'Very concise and simple. I like the addition of grain, it removes it from reality and gives it more of an abstract feel. The white ball is slightly overexposed (I think) but I like the opposing shadows.', '2004-05-18 23:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(725465, 75823, 10614, '<td valign="top">Being that they are opposites on the color wheel is exactly why this makes such a nice photo.  Nice job.</td>', 'Being that they are opposites on the color wheel is exactly why this makes such a nice photo.  Nice job.', '2004-05-18 23:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(725467, 75831, 19780, '<td valign="top">How fun that the ant is in the frame too - the texture and detail on the feather and the surface of the rock is nice. The blade of dead grass across the top of the frame distracts from the overall lines of the composition.</td>', 'How fun that the ant is in the frame too - the texture and detail on the feather and the surface of the rock is nice. The blade of dead grass across the top of the frame distracts from the overall lines of the composition.', '2004-05-18 23:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(725469, 76024, 19780, '<td valign="top">A great action capture - I like the colors and the position you''ve caught the girl in. It would be great if it was slightly sharper.</td>', 'A great action capture - I like the colors and the position you''ve caught the girl in. It would be great if it was slightly sharper.', '2004-05-18 23:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(725470, 75293, 19780, '<td valign="top">Nice set up and composition. The execution of this shot is really well done, your attention to the lines and reflections is great.</td>', 'Nice set up and composition. The execution of this shot is really well done, your attention to the lines and reflections is great.', '2004-05-18 23:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(725471, 75744, 10614, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Great idea.  You are lucky to have access to such a beautiful place.</td>', 'Very nice.  Great idea.  You are lucky to have access to such a beautiful place.', '2004-05-18 23:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(725472, 75912, 19780, '<td valign="top">A very interesting way of handling the fire and ice concept. I like the the colors very much and your decision to position the tip of the flame dead center.</td>', 'A very interesting way of handling the fire and ice concept. I like the the colors very much and your decision to position the tip of the flame dead center.', '2004-05-18 23:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(725475, 75828, 10614, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I am glad to see the reflections, it seems to add to the photo.</td>', 'Very nice. I am glad to see the reflections, it seems to add to the photo.', '2004-05-18 23:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(725478, 75763, 19780, '<td valign="top">Great colors and composition. I like your set up and execution of the shot.</td>', 'Great colors and composition. I like your set up and execution of the shot.', '2004-05-18 23:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(725480, 75770, 10614, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Unique way to portray these opposites.</td>', 'Very nice.  Unique way to portray these opposites.', '2004-05-18 23:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(725483, 75648, 19780, '<td valign="top">Great concept. I like the choice of the ballet slipper and pants &amp; shoe. The execution leaves a little to be desired - the shadow from the right legt and then the black drape has that bit of a snag. I''m glad you chose color, I think it lends a lot to the differences.</td>', 'Great concept. I like the choice of the ballet slipper and pants & shoe. The execution leaves a little to be desired - the shadow from the right legt and then the black drape has that bit of a snag. I''m glad you chose color, I think it lends a lot to the differences.', '2004-05-18 23:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(725486, 75968, 19780, '<td valign="top">Fascinating capture - the exposure and contrast is great, the detail is still very easy to make out, the diffuse light really makes this photo pop.</td>', 'Fascinating capture - the exposure and contrast is great, the detail is still very easy to make out, the diffuse light really makes this photo pop.', '2004-05-18 23:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(725488, 74994, 19780, '<td valign="top">A wonderfully simple shot - I like your choice to tilt each of them. Your detail and lighting is quite nice.</td>', 'A wonderfully simple shot - I like your choice to tilt each of them. Your detail and lighting is quite nice.', '2004-05-18 23:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(725489, 76004, 21158, '<td valign="top">nice candid shot... well exposed</td>', 'nice candid shot... well exposed', '2004-05-18 23:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(725490, 74684, 21611, '<td valign="top">I think I''ve been there!!!   Very interesting colors and effects. Cant stop looking at it Well placed sunlight falling on the background water makes the shot. Great job</td>', 'I think I''ve been there!!!   Very interesting colors and effects. Cant stop looking at it Well placed sunlight falling on the background water makes the shot. Great job', '2004-05-18 23:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(725491, 75974, 10614, '<td valign="top">I don''t like to comment on my lower scores because I am not a professional, but I think this image is just to orange.  If more of the white was a crisp white, I think it would''ve made for a better photo.</td>', 'I don''t like to comment on my lower scores because I am not a professional, but I think this image is just to orange.  If more of the white was a crisp white, I think it would''ve made for a better photo.', '2004-05-18 23:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(725492, 75397, 19780, '<td valign="top">Great colors and textures - the grass and the detail on the side of the tombstone are very nice. The composition could be a little more engaging, perhaps a closer crop to focus more on the emotion as it relates to the challenge instead of the stark reality.</td>', 'Great colors and textures - the grass and the detail on the side of the tombstone are very nice. The composition could be a little more engaging, perhaps a closer crop to focus more on the emotion as it relates to the challenge instead of the stark reality.', '2004-05-18 23:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(725494, 76054, 10614, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  I really like this one.</td>', 'Very nice photo.  I really like this one.', '2004-05-18 23:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(725495, 75430, 10614, '<td valign="top">Amazing that you have access to a place like this. Very nice.</td>', 'Amazing that you have access to a place like this. Very nice.', '2004-05-18 23:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(725496, 76008, 21158, '<td valign="top">wonderful.. nice detail..</td>', 'wonderful.. nice detail..', '2004-05-18 23:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(725497, 75308, 19780, '<td valign="top">Well framed and I like the soft exposure and crisp highlights. The composition is very nice, I like the way you placed the figures on the frame and have the right one go right to the edge.</td>', 'Well framed and I like the soft exposure and crisp highlights. The composition is very nice, I like the way you placed the figures on the frame and have the right one go right to the edge.', '2004-05-18 23:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(725499, 76016, 21611, '<td valign="top">Wow colors, contrast, material, lines, detail.... what more can I say.. I think you nailed it.</td>', 'Wow colors, contrast, material, lines, detail.... what more can I say.. I think you nailed it.', '2004-05-18 23:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(725500, 76063, 21158, '<td valign="top">very good</td>', 'very good', '2004-05-18 23:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(725501, 75850, 10614, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the fire &amp; ice entries.  Great choice of background color, and candle color.  Nicely done.</td>', 'My favorite of the fire & ice entries.  Great choice of background color, and candle color.  Nicely done.', '2004-05-18 23:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(725504, 75863, 19780, '<td valign="top">What fun expressions they have! I love the color of the background and the detail of their fur, especially the one looking at the camera.</td>', 'What fun expressions they have! I love the color of the background and the detail of their fur, especially the one looking at the camera.', '2004-05-19 00:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(725507, 75823, 19780, '<td valign="top">A nicely done night shot. The lines are very crisp and the illumination of the water is great. I like the cabanas in the background and the curves in the bottom of the pool and how they lead the eye across the frame.</td>', 'A nicely done night shot. The lines are very crisp and the illumination of the water is great. I like the cabanas in the background and the curves in the bottom of the pool and how they lead the eye across the frame.', '2004-05-19 00:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(725508, 75952, 21158, '<td valign="top">good B&amp;W</td>', 'good B&W', '2004-05-19 00:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(725509, 75386, 19780, '<td valign="top">A great concept. I wish the photo was larger and a little crisper focus because it''s a wonderful comment on beauty. The choice of sepia is very nice, I like the qualilty it lends to the light and texture.</td>', 'A great concept. I wish the photo was larger and a little crisper focus because it''s a wonderful comment on beauty. The choice of sepia is very nice, I like the qualilty it lends to the light and texture.', '2004-05-19 00:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(725510, 75898, 21158, '<td valign="top">well done</td>', 'well done', '2004-05-19 00:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(725511, 76073, 10614, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge.', '2004-05-19 00:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
