(725518, 76054, 19780, '<td valign="top">The colors and differences in textures with your two subjects are great. The flower is obviously not there naturally so it detracts from the overall photo but I enjoy your composition and framing with the flagstones and use of negative space.</td>', 'The colors and differences in textures with your two subjects are great. The flower is obviously not there naturally so it detracts from the overall photo but I enjoy your composition and framing with the flagstones and use of negative space.', '2004-05-19 00:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(725520, 75903, 10614, '<td valign="top">This must be an old saying or something ( I have never heard of).  However, I like the image. Nicely done.</td>', 'This must be an old saying or something ( I have never heard of).  However, I like the image. Nicely done.', '2004-05-19 00:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(725522, 76020, 19780, '<td valign="top">Great capture of reflections in this glassy pond. I really like the little tree and the detail in the reflection. The composition is really boosted by the lily pads/leaves in the lower left. It helps to ground it as water and supports the idea of reflection and floating.</td>', 'Great capture of reflections in this glassy pond. I really like the little tree and the detail in the reflection. The composition is really boosted by the lily pads/leaves in the lower left. It helps to ground it as water and supports the idea of reflection and floating.', '2004-05-19 00:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(725523, 74604, 19780, '<td valign="top">What a bizarre find and so fun for this challenge. I think a closer crop would have helped to get rid of the stuff in the lower part of the frame. Great colors an soft lighting without loss of detail on the rind of the right lemon.</td>', 'What a bizarre find and so fun for this challenge. I think a closer crop would have helped to get rid of the stuff in the lower part of the frame. Great colors an soft lighting without loss of detail on the rind of the right lemon.', '2004-05-19 00:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(725525, 76001, 10614, '<td valign="top">I like this photo very well.  I would just say that the tree in the lower left background is a little distracting.  Very nice take on life and death.</td>', 'I like this photo very well.  I would just say that the tree in the lower left background is a little distracting.  Very nice take on life and death.', '2004-05-19 00:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
