(725658, 75998, 19708, '<td valign="top">Only problem I had was the point of focus.<br/>The Fire is too far behind and the Water is too close.<br/>Eyes are drawn to the water, yetis contrasting to the reflection/surface, not the fire.<br/>Great concept, but needs refining in my opinion.</td>', 'Only problem I had was the point of focus.The Fire is too far behind and the Water is too close.Eyes are drawn to the water, yetis contrasting to the reflection/surface, not the fire.Great concept, but needs refining in my opinion.', '2004-05-19 00:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
