(726088, 75761, 16004, '<td valign="top">blimey, that was a surprise! <br/> <br/>i just realised i didn''t leave any comments when i submitted this, so just in case you''re wondering a few particulars are as follows:<br/> <br/>the liquid in the full glass is "purple herbal" fairy (dishwashing) liquid<br/> <br/>lighting comprised of a torch<br/> <br/>background is an A3 sheet of red paper.<br/> <br/>the final picture is the 96th of a 100 odd attempts, with some minor works to curves, cropping and neat image (wonderful software that).<br/> <br/>can''t think of anything else.  anyway, thanks to all you splendid peoples for the nice comments.  and yay!  i''m quite royally pleased with meself.</td>', 'blimey, that was a surprise!  i just realised i didn''t leave any comments when i submitted this, so just in case you''re wondering a few particulars are as follows: the liquid in the full glass is "purple herbal" fairy (dishwashing) liquid lighting comprised of a torch background is an A3 sheet of red paper. the final picture is the 96th of a 100 odd attempts, with some minor works to curves, cropping and neat image (wonderful software that). can''t think of anything else.  anyway, thanks to all you splendid peoples for the nice comments.  and yay!  i''m quite royally pleased with meself.', '2004-05-19 05:16:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(726116, 75744, 6999, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all for votes and comments. I had no real plan for the challenge. Link below is to the venue - in itself quite an extraordinary story - in that it isn''t actually an ancient building at all, being constructed in 1932. A ''genuine fake'' as someone described it. <br/> <br/><a href="//www.hshotels.co.uk/bailiffscourt-main.htm" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Bailiffscourt Hotel</a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-05-19 05:43:19.</i></td>', 'Thanks to all for votes and comments. I had no real plan for the challenge. Link below is to the venue - in itself quite an extraordinary story - in that it isn''t actually an ancient building at all, being constructed in 1932. A ''genuine fake'' as someone described it.  Bailiffscourt Hotel', '2004-05-19 06:09:07.000000', '2004-05-19 06:43:19.000000', 0),
